on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"4\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container opacity-0\"><section data-section-type=\"foreword\" data-section-id=\"pg005_sec001\" class=\"bg-white text-zinc-800\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-14 max-lg:px-8 max-sm:px-4 pt-6 max-sm:pt-4\"><h1 class=\"adt-h1 sr-only\" data-id=\"pg005_n0002\">Titulli</h1><div class=\"bg-fuchsia-500/90 px-6 py-3 max-sm:px-5 max-sm:py-3\"><h2 class=\"adt-h2 font-semibold text-white\" data-id=\"pg005_n0004\">Parath&#xeb;nie</h2></div></div><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-14 max-lg:px-8 max-sm:px-5 pt-12 pb-16 max-lg:pt-10 max-sm:pt-8 max-sm:pb-12\"><p class=\"adt-body font-semibold text-zinc-800 mb-10 max-sm:mb-8\" data-id=\"pg005_n0005\">T&#xeb; dashur nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;s,</p><p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed mb-6 max-sm:mb-5\"><span data-id=\"pg005_n0007\">Po takohemi s&#xeb;rish edhe k&#xeb;t&#xeb; vit.</span> <span data-id=\"pg005_n0008\">Kemi punuar me shum&#xeb; kujdes q&#xeb; t&#xeb; sjellim nj&#xeb; lib&#xeb;r t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rshtatsh&#xeb;m p&#xeb;r ju, pasi, tashm&#xeb;, jeni nj&#xeb; vit m&#xeb; t&#xeb; rritur dhe d&#xeb;shironi t&#xeb; dini edhe m&#xeb; shum&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id=\"pg005_n0009\">Ky lib&#xeb;r, sikurse dhe librat tan&#xeb; t&#xeb; m&#xeb;parsh&#xeb;m, &#xeb;sht&#xeb; i thjesht&#xeb; dhe do t&apos;ju m&#xeb;soj&#xeb; shum&#xeb; gj&#xeb;ra t&#xeb; reja.</span></p><p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed mb-6 max-sm:mb-5\"><span data-id=\"pg005_n0011\">Libri do t&apos;ju ndihmoj&#xeb; q&#xeb; t&#xeb; m&#xeb;soni m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; p&#xeb;r grupet shoq&#xeb;rore dhe si t&#xeb; krijoni marr&#xeb;dh&#xeb;nie bashk&#xeb;punimi me t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;t, t&apos;i thelloni njohurit&#xeb; tuaja p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; drejtat dhe p&#xeb;rgjegj&#xeb;sit&#xeb; dhe, gjithashtu, do t&#xeb; merrni njohuri p&#xeb;r institucionet q&#xeb; jan&#xeb; n&#xeb; sh&#xeb;rbimin tuaj.</span> <span data-id=\"pg005_n0012\">N&#xeb;p&#xeb;rmjet situatave dhe ilustrimeve t&#xeb; ndryshme, do t&#xeb; m&#xeb;soni ta respektoni diversitetin kulturor, ta vler&#xeb;soni mendimin ndryshe, t&apos;i kultivoni toleranc&#xeb;n dhe miq&#xeb;sin&#xeb; dhe t&apos;i mb&#xeb;shtetni t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;t n&#xeb; rast nevoje.</span></p><p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed mb-6 max-sm:mb-5\"><span data-id=\"pg005_n0014\">N&#xeb; klas&#xeb;n e kat&#xeb;rt, do t&#xeb; m&#xeb;soni se cil&#xeb;t jan&#xeb; hapat q&#xeb; duhet t&apos;i ndiqni gjat&#xeb; vendimmarrjes n&#xeb; familje, klas&#xeb; dhe komunitet.</span> <span data-id=\"pg005_n0015\">Gjithashtu, do t&#xeb; njiheni me sh&#xeb;rbimet q&#xeb; ju ofrojn&#xeb; disa prej institucioneve n&#xeb; komunitetin tuaj dhe m&#xeb; gjer&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id=\"pg005_n0016\">S&#xeb; bashku me m&#xeb;suesin, do ta vizitoni nj&#xeb; studio ligjore, ku, mes t&#xeb; tjerash, do t&#xeb; m&#xeb;soni se si funksionojn&#xeb; ato.</span></p><p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed mb-6 max-sm:mb-5\"><span data-id=\"pg005_n0018\">Po ashtu, ju do t&#xeb; m&#xeb;soni shum&#xeb; gj&#xeb;ra p&#xeb;r atdheun ton&#xeb;, Kosov&#xeb;n.</span> <span data-id=\"pg005_n0019\">Do t&#xeb; njiheni me rajonet e saj, komunitetet dhe ve&#xe7;orit&#xeb; e tyre, si dhe me fqinj&#xeb;t e Kosov&#xeb;s.</span> <span data-id=\"pg005_n0020\">Do t&#xeb; fitoni njohuri p&#xeb;r familjen dikur dhe sot, p&#xeb;r fshatin dhe qytetin, p&#xeb;r deg&#xeb;t e ekonomis&#xeb;, si dhe p&#xeb;r pasurit&#xeb; tona komb&#xeb;tare.</span></p><p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed mb-6 max-sm:mb-5\"><span data-id=\"pg005_n0022\">N&#xeb;p&#xeb;rmjet aktiviteteve t&#xeb; ndryshme, q&#xeb; ju do t&#xeb; organizoni s&#xeb; bashku me m&#xeb;suesen, do t&#xeb; m&#xeb;soni si t&#xeb; jeni qytetar&#xeb; t&#xeb; mir&#xeb; t&#xeb; vendit.</span> <span data-id=\"pg005_n0023\">Organizimi i aktiviteteve t&#xeb; tilla, si &#x201c;Festojm&#xeb; Pavar&#xeb;sin&#xeb; e Kosov&#xeb;s&#x201d;, do t&#xeb; na b&#xeb;jn&#xeb; q&#xeb; t&#xeb; ndihemi krenar&#xeb; p&#xeb;r vendin ton&#xeb;.</span></p><p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed mb-6 max-sm:mb-5\"><span data-id=\"pg005_n0025\">Edhe ky lib&#xeb;r ka situata t&#xeb; cilat do t&#xeb; nxisin fantazin&#xeb; tuaj dhe do t&#xeb; k&#xeb;rkojn&#xeb; q&#xeb; ju t&#xeb; mbani q&#xeb;ndrimin tuaj.</span> <span data-id=\"pg005_n0026\">Do t&#xeb; keni mund&#xeb;si q&#xeb; t&#xeb; flisni rreth higjien&#xeb;s personale, higjien&#xeb;s n&#xeb; komunitet etj.</span> <span data-id=\"pg005_n0027\">Do t&#xeb; njiheni me pasurit&#xeb; natyrore t&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;s.</span> <span data-id=\"pg005_n0028\">Do t&#xeb; m&#xeb;soni se si b&#xeb;het procesi i riciklimit t&#xeb; mbetjeve.</span> <span data-id=\"pg005_n0029\">N&#xeb;p&#xeb;rmjet projektit &#x201c;Ndihmoj p&#xeb;r nj&#xeb; mjedis t&#xeb; past&#xeb;r dhe t&#xeb; gjelb&#xeb;r&#x201d;, do t&#xeb; punoni n&#xeb; grupe e do t&#xeb; ndihmoni p&#xeb;r nj&#xeb; mjedis t&#xeb; past&#xeb;r, do t&#xeb; m&#xeb;soni si t&apos;i mbroni tok&#xeb;n, uj&#xeb;rat, pyjet etj.</span></p><p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed mb-10 max-sm:mb-8\"><span data-id=\"pg005_n0031\">Njohurit&#xeb; q&#xeb; ju kemi dh&#xeb;n&#xeb; nga viti n&#xeb; vit kan&#xeb; ardhur duke u shtuar, me q&#xeb;llim q&#xeb; t&apos;u p&#xeb;rshtaten k&#xeb;rkesave tuaja, gjithnj&#xeb; n&#xeb; rritje.</span></p><p class=\"adt-body font-semibold text-right pt-4\" data-id=\"pg005_n0032\">Autoret</p></div></section></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg006_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg006_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"5\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container bg-[#f4d7d0] opacity-0\">\n  <section data-section-type=\"text_and_single_image\" data-section-id=\"pg006_sec001\" class=\"pb-10\">\n    <div class=\"w-full bg-[#a86bb0]\">\n      <div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 py-6\">\n        <h1 data-id=\"pg006_n0002\" class=\"adt-h1 text-left font-bold text-white\">Un&#xeb; po rritem</h1>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 pt-8\">\n      <h3 data-id=\"pg006_n0004\" class=\"adt-h3 inline-block bg-[#69b874] px-4 py-2 text-left font-semibold text-black\">Situata 1.</h3>\n\n      <p class=\"adt-body mt-5 text-left leading-relaxed text-[#2f2323]\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg006_n0006\">Un&#xeb; jam Linda.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg006_n0007\">Jam n&#xeb; klas&#xeb;n e kat&#xeb;rt.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg006_n0008\">Prind&#xeb;rit &#xe7;do dit&#xeb; m&#xeb; thon&#xeb;: &#x201c;Linda, ti po rritesh dhe po b&#xeb;hesh vajz&#xeb; e mbar&#xeb;!&#x201d;.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg006_n0009\">Po ju tregoj se pse ata mendojn&#xeb; k&#xeb;shtu.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg006_n0010\">M&#xeb; besoni, nuk po mburrem, vet&#xeb;m dua t&#xeb; ndaj k&#xeb;t&#xeb; k&#xeb;naq&#xeb;si me ju, moshatar&#xeb;t e mi.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg006_n0011\">Tani un&#xeb; kam krijuar shprehit&#xeb; e mia.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg006_n0012\">&#xc7;do m&#xeb;ngjes pastrohem, rregulloj dhom&#xeb;n time, vishem dhe mbath k&#xeb;puc&#xeb;t e p&#xeb;rshtatshme p&#xeb;r stin&#xeb;n.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg006_n0013\">Ushqehem me orar dhe me ushqime t&#xeb; sh&#xeb;ndetshme.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg006_n0014\">Shkoj n&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb; pasi t`i kem kryer t&#xeb; gjitha detyrat.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg006_n0015\">Ushtroj balet, sepse &#xeb;sht&#xeb; pasioni im.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg006_n0016\">Po ashtu, vijoj kurse t&#xeb; gjuh&#xeb;ve t&#xeb; huaja, sepse, si&#xe7; thon&#xeb; poet&#xeb;t tan&#xeb;: &quot;Sa gjuh&#xeb; di, aq vlen&quot;.</span>\n      </p>\n\n      <p class=\"adt-body mt-4 text-left leading-relaxed text-[#2f2323]\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg006_n0018\">Jasht&#xeb;, n&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;, n&#xeb; teat&#xeb;r, n&#xeb; kinema e kudo sillem mir&#xeb; dhe respektoj rregullat.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg006_n0019\">P&#xeb;rvojat ditore e sidomos ndonj&#xeb; shqet&#xeb;sim ose problem i diskutoj me prind&#xeb;rit.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg006_n0020\">Mos t&#xeb; harroj t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rmend se u ndihmoj babait e n&#xeb;n&#xeb;s rreth pun&#xeb;ve t&#xeb; sht&#xeb;pis&#xeb;.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg006_n0021\">M&#xeb; s&#xeb; shumti m&#xeb; p&#xeb;lqen t&#xeb; gatuaj dhe ta shtroj tryez&#xeb;n e ngr&#xeb;nies.</span>\n      </p>\n\n      <p class=\"adt-body mt-4 text-left leading-relaxed text-[#2f2323]\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg006_n0023\">N&#xeb; koh&#xeb;n e lir&#xeb; luaj me shok&#xeb;t e shoqet e mia, arg&#xeb;tohemi me prind&#xeb;rit dhe nganj&#xeb;her&#xeb; k&#xeb;qyri televizor.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg006_n0024\">Af&#xeb;r shtratit gjithmon&#xeb; mbaj nj&#xeb; lib&#xeb;r dhe para gjumit lexoj, sepse leximi m&#xeb; qet&#xeb;son dhe m&#xeb; b&#xeb;n t&#xeb; &#xeb;nd&#xeb;rroj.</span>\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"mt-8 overflow-hidden rounded-3xl shadow-lg ring-4 ring-white/40\">\n        <img data-id=\"pg006_im001\" src=\"images/pg006_im001.png\" alt=\"Linda duke lexuar nj&#xeb; lib&#xeb;r n&#xeb; tavolin&#xeb;n e dhom&#xeb;s s&#xeb; saj, pran&#xeb; krevatit dhe dritares me perde blu.\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg007_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg007_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\