 text-gray-800\"><span data-id=\"pg010_n0027\">Njeriu mund t&#xeb; jet&#xeb; pjes&#xeb; e shum&#xeb; grupeve n&#xeb; t&#xeb; nj&#xeb;jt&#xeb;n koh&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id=\"pg010_n0028\">P&#xeb;r shembull, ai &#xeb;sht&#xeb; pjes&#xeb; e familjes, i klas&#xeb;s n&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;, i lagjes ku banon, i nj&#xeb; grupi t&#xeb; sportit, t&#xeb; k&#xeb;ndimit ose t&#xeb; vall&#xeb;zimit etj.</span></p><p class=\"adt-body text-left italic leading-relaxed text-gray-800\"><span data-id=\"pg010_n0030\">N&#xeb; t&#xeb; kaluar&#xeb;n, njer&#xeb;zit nuk kishin t&#xeb; nj&#xeb;jtat ide dhe grupe si sot.</span> <span data-id=\"pg010_n0031\">Sot ka shum&#xeb; m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; grupe, sepse jan&#xeb; zhvilluar teknologjia, ekonomia dhe m&#xeb;nyra se si jetojm&#xeb;.</span></p></div></div><div class=\"border-l-4 border-purple-400 pl-3\"><p class=\"adt-body text-left text-gray-900\"><span data-id=\"pg010_n0034\" class=\"font-semibold\">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e:</span> <span data-id=\"pg010_n0035\">grup shoq&#xeb;ror, dikur, sot, q&#xeb;llim i p&#xeb;rbashk&#xeb;t.</span></p></div></div></section></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg011_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg011_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives th