ntent/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container opacity-0\"><section data-section-type=\"text_and_single_image\" data-section-id=\"pg012_sec001\" class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-4 py-8 bg-white text-slate-800\">\n  <div class=\"mb-10 flex items-stretch max-sm:mb-8\">\n    <div class=\"w-36 shrink-0 rounded-l-2xl bg-[#a96ab0] flex items-center justify-center max-sm:w-24\">\n      <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-16 h-16 max-sm:w-12 max-sm:h-12 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-white\">&#x1f465;</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\">\n      <div class=\"bg-[#a96ab0] px-6 py-4 max-sm:px-4 max-sm:py-3\">\n        <h1 data-id=\"pg012_n0002\" class=\"adt-h1 font-bold text-white\">Lidhjet dhe bashk&#xeb;punimi me t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;t</h1>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bg-white px-6 pt-3 pb-2 max-sm:px-4\">\n        <h2 data-id=\"pg012_n0003\" class=\"adt-h2 text-slate-900 border-b-4 border-[#b56bbb] pb-2 inline-block pr-12 max-sm:pr-0\">E mira jon&#xeb; e p&#xeb;rbashk&#xeb;t</h2>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mb-8\">\n    <div class=\"mb-5 flex items-start gap-5 max-lg:flex-col max-lg:gap-3\">\n      <h3 data-id=\"pg012_n0005\" class=\"adt-h3 shrink-0 inline-block bg-[#69bd79] text-slate-900 px-5 py-2\">Situata 1.</h3>\n      <p class=\"adt-body flex-1 leading-relaxed\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg012_n0007\">Ishin festat e fundvitit.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg012_n0008\">Moti i ftoht&#xeb; i fundvitit nxiti f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;t e shkoll&#xeb;s q&#xeb; t&#xeb; mendonin p&#xeb;r f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;t n&#xeb; nevoj&#xeb;.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg012_n0009\">N&#xeb;n moton &#x201c;Dhurojm&#xeb; cop&#xeb;za lumturie&#x201d;, nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;sit organizuan nj&#xeb; aktivitet bamir&#xeb;sie.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg012_n0010\">Secili f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;, sipas mund&#xeb;sive, do t&#xeb; sillte di&#xe7;ka q&#xeb; do t&apos;u dhurohej f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;ve n&#xeb; nevoj&#xeb;.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg012_n0011\">Mund t&#xeb; ishin rroba q&#xeb; f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;t nuk i p&#xeb;rdornin m&#xeb;, mund t&#xeb; ishte ndonj&#xeb; shall apo doreza, ndonj&#xeb; fletore apo mjet tjet&#xeb;r shkollor, ndonj&#xeb; produkt higjienik apo &#xe7;far&#xeb;do tjet&#xeb;r q&#xeb; do t&apos;i leht&#xeb;sonte dit&#xeb;t e ftohta t&#xeb; dimrit.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg012_n0012\">T&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; kishin sjell&#xeb; dhurata t&#xeb; bukura.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg012_n0013\">Ata po diskutonin me nj&#xeb;ri-tjetrin p&#xeb;r dhuratat q&#xeb; i kishin p&#xeb;rgatitur me shum&#xeb; dashuri p&#xeb;r f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;t n&#xeb; nevoj&#xeb;.</span>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mx-auto mb-6 w-full max-w-4xl overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border-4 border-orange-100 bg-[#f9eddc] shadow-sm\">\n      <img data-id=\"pg012_im001_crop_v1\" src=\"images/pg012_im001_crop_v1.png\" alt=\"Dy nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;se n&#xeb; korridorin e shkoll&#xeb;s po sjellin kuti me dhurata, nd&#xeb;rsa pako t&#xeb; tjera jan&#xeb; mbledhur p&#xeb;r t&#x2019;u dhuruar f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;ve n&#xeb; nevoj&#xeb;.\" class=\"block w-full h-auto\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <aside class=\"mb-10 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-[#e8d8f0] border border-[#dbc4e8] shadow-sm max-sm:mb-8\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-stretch max-lg:flex-col\">\n      <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-24 shrink-0 bg-[#a96ab0] text-white flex items-center justify-center max-lg:w-full max-lg:h-16\">?</div>\n      <div class=\"flex-1 p-5 max-sm:p-4 space-y-4\">\n        <div class=\"rounded-xl bg-white/55 p-4\">\n          <div data-id=\"pg012_n0015\" class=\"adt-body mb-3\">&#x2013; &#xc7;far&#xeb; kuptoni me shprehjen &#x201c;Dhurojm&#xeb; cop&#xeb;za lumturie&#x201d;?</div>\n          <label for=\"item-1\" class=\"sr-only\">&#x2013; &#xc7;far&#xeb; kuptoni me shprehjen &#x201c;Dhurojm&#xeb; cop&#xeb;za lumturie&#x201d;?</label>\n          <textarea id=\"item-1\" data-activity-item=\"item-1\" aria-label=\"&#x2013; &#xc7;far&#xeb; kuptoni me shprehjen &#x201c;Dhurojm&#xeb; cop&#xeb;za lumturie&#x201d;?\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 h-24 rounded-xl border-2 border-[#e3c8ff] bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-[#a96ab0]\"></textarea>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"rounded-xl bg-white/55 p-4\">\n          <div data-id=\"pg012_n0016\" class=\"adt-body mb-3\">&#x2013; Cili ishte motivi i f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;ve p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; organizuar nj&#xeb; aktivitet bamir&#xeb;sie?</div>\n          <label for=\"item-2\" class=\"sr-only\">&#x2013; Cili ishte motivi i f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;ve p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; organizuar nj&#xeb; aktivitet bamir&#xeb;sie?</label>\n          <textarea id=\"item-2\" data-activity-item=\"item-2\" aria-label=\"&#x2013; Cili ishte motivi i f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;ve p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; organizuar nj&#xeb; aktivitet bamir&#xeb;sie?\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 h-24 rounded-xl border-2 border-[#e3c8ff] bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-[#a96ab0]\"></textarea>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"rounded-xl bg-white/55 p-4\">\n          <div data-id=\"pg012_n0017\" class=\"adt-body mb-3\">&#x2013; &#xc7;far&#xeb; t&#xeb; b&#xeb;n ty t&#xeb; lumtur?</div>\n          <label for=\"item-3\" class=\"sr-only\">&#x2013; &#xc7;far&#xeb; t&#xeb; b&#xeb;n ty t&#xeb; lumtur?</label>\n          <textarea id=\"item-3\" data-activity-item=\"item-3\" aria-label=\"&#x2013; &#xc7;far&#xeb; t&#xeb; b&#xeb;n ty t&#xeb; lumtur?\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 h-24 rounded-xl border-2 border-[#e3c8ff] bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-[#a96ab0]\"></textarea>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"rounded-xl bg-white/55 p-4\">\n          <div data-id=\"pg012_n0018\" class=\"adt-body mb-3\">&#x2013; A ke pasur mund&#xeb;si ndonj&#xeb;her&#xeb; q&#xeb; ti ta b&#xeb;sh dik&#xeb; t&#xeb; lumtur duke e ndihmuar?</div>\n          <label for=\"item-4\" class=\"sr-only\">&#x2013; A ke pasur mund&#xeb;si ndonj&#xeb;her&#xeb; q&#xeb; ti ta b&#xeb;sh dik&#xeb; t&#xeb; lumtur duke e ndihmuar?</label>\n          <textarea id=\"item-4\" data-activity-item=\"item-4\" aria-label=\"&#x2013; A ke pasur mund&#xeb;si ndonj&#xeb;her&#xeb; q&#xeb; ti ta b&#xeb;sh dik&#xeb; t&#xeb; lumtur duke e ndihmuar?\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 h-24 rounded-xl border-2 border-[#e3c8ff] bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-[#a96ab0]\"></textarea>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </aside>\n\n  <div class=\"mb-12 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border-2 border-[#c883d1] bg-white shadow-sm\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-stretch max-lg:flex-col\">\n      <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-24 shrink-0 bg-[#a96ab0] text-white flex items-center justify-center max-lg:w-full max-lg:h-16\">&#x1f4d6;</div>\n      <div class=\"flex-1 p-5 space-y-5 max-sm:p-4\">\n        <p class=\"adt-body italic leading-relaxed\">\n          <span data-id=\"pg012_n0021\">E mira jon&#xeb; e p&#xeb;rbashk&#xeb;t &#xeb;sht&#xeb; fakti q&#xeb; ne kujdesemi dhe mendojm&#xeb; p&#xeb;r nj&#xeb;ri-tjetrin.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg012_n0022\">K&#xeb;t&#xeb; e quajm&#xeb; humaniz&#xeb;m.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg012_n0023\">Pra, humanizmi &#xeb;sht&#xeb; kur mendojm&#xeb; p&#xeb;r nevojat e t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;ve dhe duam t&#x2019;i ndihmojm&#xeb;, pa k&#xeb;rkuar shp&#xeb;rblim.</span>\n        </p>\n        <p class=\"adt-body italic leading-relaxed\">\n          <span data-id=\"pg012_n0025\">Ne tregojm&#xeb; humaniz&#xeb;m kur jemi t&#xeb; sjellsh&#xeb;m, t&#xeb; duruesh&#xeb;m dhe kur ndihmojm&#xeb; dik&#xeb; q&#xeb; ka nevoj&#xeb;.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg012_n0026\">Humaniz&#xeb;m do t&#xeb; thot&#xeb; t&#xeb; v&#xeb;m&#xeb; njeriun dhe ndjenjat e tij n&#xeb; rend t&#xeb; par&#xeb;.</span>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"border-l-4 border-[#c883d1] pl-4\">\n    <p class=\"adt-body\"><span data-id=\"pg012_n0029\" class=\"font-bold\">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e:</span> <span data-id=\"pg012_n0030\">dashuri, ndihm&#xeb;, buz&#xeb;qeshje, p&#xeb;rkrahje.</span></p>\n  </div>\n</section></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg013_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg013_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"16\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container opacity-0\"><section data-section-type=\"text_and_single_image\" data-section-id=\"pg013_sec001\" class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-4 py-8 bg-white text-slate-800\">\n  <div class=\"-mx-8 max-sm:-mx-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-700 via-fuchsia-600 to-purple-500\">\n    <div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-4 py-6 max-sm:py-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-6 max-sm:flex-col max-sm:items-start\">\n      <div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\">\n        <h1 data-id=\"pg013_n0002\" class=\"adt-h1 font-bold text-white\">Lidhjet dhe bashk&#xeb;punimi me t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;t</h1>\n        <h2 data-id=\"pg013_n0003\" class=\"adt-h2 text-slate-900 border-b-4 border-purple-200 inline-block pb-2 mt-4\">S&#xeb; bashku ia dalim</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"shrink-0 w-32 h-32 max-lg:w-28 max-lg:h-28 max-sm:w-20 max-sm:h-20 rounded-2xl bg-purple-400/80 flex items-center justify-center self-start\">\n        <div class=\"relative w-14 h-10 max-sm:w-10 max-sm:h-8\">\n          <span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-0 -translate-x-1/2 w-4 h-4 max-sm:w-3 max-sm:h-3 rounded-full bg-white\"></span>\n          <span class=\"absolute left-1 top-1 w-3.5 h-3.5 max-sm:w-2.5 max-sm:h-2.5 rounded-full bg-white\"></span>\n          <span class=\"absolute right-1 top-1 w-3.5 h-3.5 max-sm:w-2.5 max-sm:h-2.5 rounded-full bg-white\"></span>\n          <span class=\"absolute left-1/2 bottom-0 -translate-x-1/2 w-9 h-6 max-sm:w-7 max-sm:h-5 rounded-t-full bg-white\"></span>\n          <span class=\"absolute left-0 bottom-0 w-5 h-4 max-sm:w-4 max-sm:h-3 rounded-t-full bg-white\"></span>\n          <span class=\"absolute right-0 bottom-0 w-5 h-4 max-sm:w-4 max-sm:h-3 rounded-t-full bg-white\"></span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-8\">\n    <h3 data-id=\"pg013_n0005\" class=\"adt-h3 inline-block bg-green-400 text-slate-900 px-4 py-2 font-semibold rounded-sm\">Situata 1.</h3>\n    <p class=\"adt-body mt-4 leading-relaxed text-left\">\n      <span data-id=\"pg013_n0007\">Ishin dit&#xeb;t e fundit t&#xeb; gushtit, kur Lisi po rregullonte dhom&#xeb;n e tij t&#xeb; gjumit para fillimit t&#xeb; vitit shkollor.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg013_n0008\">Do ta fillonte klas&#xeb;n e kat&#xeb;rt dhe kjo e b&#xeb;nte m&#xeb; p&#xeb;rgjegj&#xeb;s ndaj gj&#xeb;rave t&#xeb; tij.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg013_n0009\">Lisi &#xeb;sht&#xeb; idhtar i rip&#xeb;rdorimit dhe i riciklimit dhe ai &#xe7;do vit shikon se &#xe7;far&#xeb; i ka mbetur nga viti i kaluar shkollor p&#xeb;r t&#x2019;i p&#xeb;rdorur n&#xeb; vitin e ardhsh&#xeb;m.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg013_n0010\">Mir&#xeb;po, di&#xe7;ka q&#xeb; nuk i duhej m&#xeb;, por q&#xeb; kishin shum&#xeb; vler&#xeb; p&#xeb;r t&#xeb;, ishin librat e tij t&#xeb; par&#xeb;.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg013_n0011\">Mendoi t&#x2019;i vendoste diku n&#xeb; sht&#xeb;pi p&#xeb;r t&#x2019;i ruajtur, por e dinte q&#xeb; k&#xeb;shtu nuk b&#xeb;nte mir&#xeb; p&#xeb;r ask&#xeb;nd.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg013_n0012\">Kur bisedoi me prind&#xeb;rit p&#xeb;r k&#xeb;t&#xeb; &#xe7;&#xeb;shtje, ata i dhan&#xeb; nj&#xeb; ide t&#xeb; shk&#xeb;lqyeshme.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg013_n0013\">- Pse nuk mbledh libra edhe nga shok&#xeb;t e klas&#xeb;s dhe t&#xeb; krijoni bibliotek&#xeb;n e klas&#xeb;s? - ishte ideja e p&#xeb;rbashk&#xeb;t e prind&#xeb;rve.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg013_n0014\">Lisi u lumturua shum&#xeb; nga kjo ide.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg013_n0015\">E mendonte sa mir&#xeb; do t&#xeb; b&#xeb;hej kur t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;t e klas&#xeb;s do t&#xeb; mblidhnin librat e tyre dhe t&#x2019;i shk&#xeb;mbenin me nj&#xeb;ri-tjetrin.</span>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-6 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50\">\n    <img data-id=\"pg013_im002\" src=\"images/pg013_im002.png\" alt=\"Lisi mban n&#xeb; duar nj&#xeb; grumbull librash pran&#xeb; rafteve t&#xeb; mbushura me libra, nd&#xeb;rsa prind&#xeb;rit e tij shihen n&#xeb; sfond n&#xeb; sht&#xeb;pi.\" class=\"w-full h-auto block\">\n  </div>\n\n  <aside class=\"mt-6 bg-purple-100 border-l-8 border-purple-400 p-4 max-sm:p-3 rounded-r-xl\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4 max-lg:flex-col\">\n      <div class=\"flex-1 space-y-4 w-full order-1\">\n        <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n          <div data-id=\"pg013_n0019\" class=\"adt-body\">Sa e vler&#xeb;son bashk&#xeb;punimin me t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;t p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; b&#xeb;r&#xeb; nj&#xeb; veprim t&#xeb; mir&#xeb; p&#xeb;r komunitetin?</div>\n          <label for=\"item-1\" class=\"sr-only\">Sa e vler&#xeb;son bashk&#xeb;punimin me t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;t p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; b&#xeb;r&#xeb; nj&#xeb; veprim t&#xeb; mir&#xeb; p&#xeb;r komunitetin?</label>\n          <textarea id=\"item-1\" data-activity-item=\"item-1\" aria-label=\"Sa e vler&#xeb;son bashk&#xeb;punimin me t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;t p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; b&#xeb;r&#xeb; nj&#xeb; veprim t&#xeb; mir&#xeb; p&#xeb;r komunitetin?\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 rounded-lg border border-purple-300 bg-white px-3 py-3 text-slate-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-400\"></textarea>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n          <div data-id=\"pg013_n0021\" class=\"adt-body\">Si p&#xeb;rfiton komuniteti nga veprimi i Lisit me shok&#xeb;t?</div>\n          <label for=\"item-2\" class=\"sr-only\">Si p&#xeb;rfiton komuniteti nga veprimi i Lisit me shok&#xeb;t?</label>\n          <textarea id=\"item-2\" data-activity-item=\"item-2\" aria-label=\"Si p&#xeb;rfiton komuniteti nga veprimi i Lisit me shok&#xeb;t?\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 rounded-lg border border-purple-300 bg-white px-3 py-3 text-slate-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-400\"></textarea>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n          <div data-id=\"pg013_n0023\" class=\"adt-body\">A ke b&#xeb;r&#xeb; ndonj&#xeb;her&#xeb; ndonj&#xeb; aktivitet/veprim p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; mir&#xeb;n e t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;ve?</div>\n          <label for=\"item-3\" class=\"sr-only\">A ke b&#xeb;r&#xeb; ndonj&#xeb;her&#xeb; ndonj&#xeb; aktivitet/veprim p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; mir&#xeb;n e t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;ve?</label>\n          <textarea id=\"item-3\" data-activity-item=\"item-3\" aria-label=\"A ke b&#xeb;r&#xeb; ndonj&#xeb;her&#xeb; ndonj&#xeb; aktivitet/veprim p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; mir&#xeb;n e t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;ve?\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 rounded-lg border border-purple-300 bg-white px-3 py-3 text-slate-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-400\"></textarea>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n          <div data-id=\"pg013_n0025\" class=\"adt-body\">Si e vler&#xeb;son iden&#xeb; e prind&#xeb;rve t&#xeb; Lisit p&#xeb;r krijimin e bibliotek&#xeb;s s&#xeb; klas&#xeb;s?</div>\n          <label for=\"item-4\" class=\"sr-only\">Si e vler&#xeb;son iden&#xeb; e prind&#xeb;rve t&#xeb; Lisit p&#xeb;r krijimin e bibliotek&#xeb;s s&#xeb; klas&#xeb;s?</label>\n          <textarea id=\"item-4\" data-activity-item=\"item-4\" aria-label=\"Si e vler&#xeb;son iden&#xeb; e prind&#xeb;rve t&#xeb; Lisit p&#xeb;r krijimin e bibliotek&#xeb;s s&#xeb; klas&#xeb;s?\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 rounded-lg border border-purple-300 bg-white px-3 py-3 text-slate-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-400\"></textarea>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n          <div data-id=\"pg013_n0027\" class=\"adt-body\">Sa &#xeb;sht&#xeb; e r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sishme q&#xeb; shkollat t&#xeb; ken&#xeb; biblioteka?</div>\n          <label for=\"item-5\" class=\"sr-only\">Sa &#xeb;sht&#xeb; e r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sishme q&#xeb; shkollat t&#xeb; ken&#xeb; biblioteka?</label>\n          <textarea id=\"item-5\" data-activity-item=\"item-5\" aria-label=\"Sa &#xeb;sht&#xeb; e r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sishme q&#xeb; shkollat t&#xeb; ken&#xeb; biblioteka?\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 rounded-lg border border-purple-300 bg-white px-3 py-3 text-slate-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-400\"></textarea>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"order-2 shrink-0 w-16 h-16 rounded-xl bg-purple-400 flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden max-lg:self-start\">\n        <span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-2 -translate-x-1/2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white\"></span>\n        <span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-4 -translate-x-1/2 w-4 h-6 border-2 border-white border-b-0 rounded-t-full\"></span>\n        <span class=\"absolute left-1/2 bottom-3 -translate-x-1/2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white\"></span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </aside>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-6 border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white p-4 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4 max-sm:flex-col\">\n      <p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed italic text-left flex-1\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg013_n0030\">Njer&#xeb;zit dallojn&#xeb; nga nj&#xeb;ri-tjetri.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg013_n0031\">Ata jetojn&#xeb; n&#xeb; familje, mjedise t&#xeb; ndryshme, kan&#xeb; edukat&#xeb; dhe kultura t&#xeb; ndryshme.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg013_n0032\">K&#xeb;shtu q&#xeb;, secili njeri ka mendimet e veta.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg013_n0033\">N&#xeb;se respektojm&#xeb; kulturat dhe mendimet e t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;ve dhe i shk&#xeb;mbejm&#xeb; ato n&#xeb; mes nesh, at&#xeb;her&#xeb; &#xe7;do pun&#xeb; b&#xeb;het m&#xeb; mir&#xeb; dhe ne b&#xeb;hemi m&#xeb; t&#xeb; ditur, pasi p&#xeb;rfitojm&#xeb; shum&#xeb; nga t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;t.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg013_n0034\">Pun&#xeb; n&#xeb; ekip do t&#xeb; thot&#xeb; kur disa persona punojn&#xeb; s&#xeb; bashku p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; arritur nj&#xeb; q&#xeb;llim t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rbashk&#xeb;t ose p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; kryer nj&#xeb; detyr&#xeb; sa m&#xeb; mir&#xeb;.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg013_n0035\">Puna n&#xeb; ekip nuk njeh mosh&#xeb;.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg013_n0036\">Ajo &#xeb;sht&#xeb; e nj&#xeb;jt&#xeb; p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; gjitha moshat.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg013_n0037\">An&#xeb;tar&#xeb;t e grupit ndajn&#xeb; n&#xeb; m&#xeb;nyr&#xeb; t&#xeb; barabart&#xeb; p&#xeb;rgjegj&#xeb;sit&#xeb; dhe detyrat e tyre.</span>\n      </p>\n      <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"shrink-0 w-16 h-12 rounded-sm bg-purple-500 relative max-sm:self-end\">\n        <div class=\"absolute top-2 right-2 w-9 h-8 border-2 border-white rounded-sm\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-1 right-4 w-9 h-8 border-2 border-white rounded-sm\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-5\">\n    <p data-id=\"pg013_n0038\" class=\"adt-body font-semibold text-left\">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e: bashk&#xeb;punim, kujdes, nd&#xeb;rveprim, vler&#xeb;sim.</p>\n  </div>\n</section></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg014_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg014_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"17\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container opacity-0\"><section data-section-type=\"text_and_images\" data-section-id=\"pg014_sec001\" class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl bg-white px-8 py-8 text-slate-800 max-sm:px-5\">\n  <div class=\"mb-10\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-start max-sm:flex-col max-sm:items-stretch\">\n      <div class=\"flex h-40 w-36 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-l-2xl rounded-r-none bg-[#a86aae] px-4 py-6 max-sm:h-auto max-sm:w-full max-sm:rounded-b-none max-sm:rounded-t-2xl max-sm:py-8\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" class=\"h-16 w-16 fill-white\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"7\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"17\" r=\"8\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"45\" cy=\"20\" r=\"7\"/>\n          <path d=\"M10 44c0-8 4-14 10-14s10 6 10 14v4H10z\"/>\n          <path d=\"M20 48c0-10 5-17 12-17s12 7 12 17v0H20z\"/>\n          <path d=\"M34 48v-4c0-8 4-14 10-14s10 6 10 14v4z\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col pt-10 max-sm:pt-0\">\n        <div class=\"bg-[#a86aae] px-6 py-3 max-sm:px-5\">\n          <h1 data-id=\"pg014_n0002\" class=\"adt-h1 font-bold text-white\">Lidhjet dhe bashk&#xeb;punimi me t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;t</h1>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"px-2 pt-4 max-sm:px-2 max-sm:pt-3\">\n          <h3 data-id=\"pg014_n0004\" class=\"adt-h3 inline-block border-b-4 border-[#b779bf] pb-2 font-semibold text-slate-900\">Veprimtaria 1: &#x201c;Puna vullnetare na bashkon&#x201d;</h3>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"adt-body mx-auto mb-10 max-w-4xl text-center leading-relaxed text-slate-700\">\n    <span data-id=\"pg014_n0006\">Nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;sit e klas&#xeb;s ndahen n&#xeb; dy grupe.</span>\n    <span data-id=\"pg014_n0007\">Secilit grup i caktohet detyra q&#xeb; do t&#xeb; kryej&#xeb; dhe p&#xeb;rgjegj&#xeb;sit&#xeb; q&#xeb; do t&#xeb; marrin nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;sit p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; realizuar aktivitetin.</span>\n    <span data-id=\"pg014_n0008\">Nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;sit udh&#xeb;zohen se si do t&#xeb; veprojn&#xeb; p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rmbushur sa m&#xeb; mir&#xeb; detyrimet q&#xeb; kan&#xeb;.</span>\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"space-y-10\">\n    <div class=\"bg-[#6fbc79] px-10 py-10 max-sm:px-0 max-sm:py-0\">\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-[44%_56%] items-center max-sm:grid-cols-1\">\n        <div class=\"bg-[#6fbc79] px-6 py-6 max-sm:px-5 max-sm:pt-6 max-sm:pb-3\">\n          <div class=\"w-full bg-[#6fbc79] p-8 max-sm:p-6\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 16px white, inset 16px 16px 0 0 white;\">\n            <img data-id=\"pg014_im001_seg001_v1\" src=\"images/pg014_im001_seg001_v1.png\" alt=\"Kek i vog&#xeb;l me krem roz&#xeb;, sp&#xeb;rkat&#xeb;se shum&#xeb;ngjyr&#xeb;she dhe dy shkopinj dekorues.\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-contain\">\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-8 py-10 text-center max-sm:px-5 max-sm:pt-2 max-sm:pb-8\">\n          <h4 data-id=\"pg014_n0010\" class=\"adt-h4 mb-8 font-medium text-slate-900 max-sm:mb-4\">Grupi i par&#xeb;:</h4>\n          <h4 data-id=\"pg014_n0011\" class=\"adt-h4 max-w-sm font-medium text-slate-900\">Do t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rgatit&#xeb; &#xeb;mb&#xeb;lsira n&#xeb; sht&#xeb;pi.</h4>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"border-2 border-yellow-400 bg-[#ffe08a] px-10 py-10 max-sm:px-0 max-sm:py-0\">\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-[44%_56%] items-center max-sm:grid-cols-1\">\n        <div class=\"bg-[#ffe08a] px-6 py-6 max-sm:px-5 max-sm:pt-6 max-sm:pb-3\">\n          <div class=\"w-full bg-[#ffe08a] p-8 max-sm:p-6\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 16px white, inset 16px 16px 0 0 white;\">\n            <img data-id=\"pg014_im001_seg002_v1\" src=\"images/pg014_im001_seg002_v1.png\" alt=\"Kartolin&#xeb; e kalt&#xeb;r e zbukuruar me dy lule shum&#xeb;ngjyr&#xeb;she n&#xeb; ballin&#xeb;.\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-contain\">\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-8 py-10 text-center max-sm:px-5 max-sm:pt-2 max-sm:pb-8\">\n          <h4 data-id=\"pg014_n0013\" class=\"adt-h4 mb-8 font-medium text-slate-900 max-sm:mb-4\">Grupi i dyt&#xeb;:</h4>\n          <h4 data-id=\"pg014_n0014\" class=\"adt-h4 max-w-md font-medium text-slate-900\">Do t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rgatit&#xeb; kartolina t&#xeb; bukura (pa shkrim brenda), t&#xeb; dekoruara me materiale t&#xeb; ndryshme ricikluese.</h4>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-10 border-2 border-[#c98ad7] bg-white p-5\">\n    <p class=\"adt-body text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-800\">\n      <span data-id=\"pg014_n0017\">&#xcb;mb&#xeb;lsirat dhe kartolinat shitni n&#xeb; nj&#xeb; k&#xeb;nd brenda shkoll&#xeb;s.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg014_n0018\">Parat&#xeb; q&#xeb; do t&#xeb; mblidhen nga shitja e tyre, p&#xeb;rdorini p&#xeb;r t&#x2019;u ardhur n&#xeb; ndihm&#xeb; nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;sve t&#xeb; nj&#xeb; shkolle tjet&#xeb;r, q&#xeb; kan&#xeb; nevoj&#xeb; p&#xeb;r pajisje dhe mjete t&#xeb; tjera ndihm&#xeb;se.</span>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</section></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg015_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg015_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"18\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container opacity-0\"><section data-section-type=\"text_and_single_image\" data-section-id=\"pg015_sec001\" class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 py-8 max-sm:px-5 bg-white text-zinc-800\">\n  <div class=\"-mx-8 bg-purple-500 max-sm:-mx-5\">\n    <div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-5xl items-center justify-between px-8 py-5 max-sm:px-5 max-sm:py-4\">\n      <h1 class=\"adt-h1 font-bold text-white\" data-id=\"pg015_n0002\">Secili ka t&#xeb; drejta dhe p&#xeb;rgjegj&#xeb;si</h1>\n      <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ml-6 flex h-20 w-20 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-purple-400 text-white\">\n        <span>&#x2696;</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-5\">\n    <h2 class=\"adt-h2 border-b-4 border-purple-400 pb-2 font-medium text-zinc-900\" data-id=\"pg015_n0004\">T&#xeb; drejtat dhe p&#xeb;rgjegj&#xeb;sit&#xeb; e mia</h2>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-8 inline-block bg-green-400 px-5 py-2 shadow-sm\">\n    <h3 class=\"adt-h3 font-medium text-zinc-900\" data-id=\"pg015_n0006\">Situata 1.</h3>\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"adt-body mt-5 leading-relaxed text-left text-zinc-800\">\n    <span data-id=\"pg015_n0008\">N&#xeb; klas&#xeb;, gjat&#xeb; pushimit midis or&#xeb;ve, mblidhemi dhe diskutojm&#xeb; p&#xeb;r probleme t&#xeb; ndryshme.</span> <span data-id=\"pg015_n0009\">M&#xeb;suesja na k&#xeb;shillon q&#xeb; t&#xeb; mos b&#xeb;jm&#xeb; zhurm&#xeb;, pasi k&#xeb;shtu shqet&#xeb;sojm&#xeb; t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;t.</span> <span data-id=\"pg015_n0010\">Po ashtu, ajo theksoi se duhet t&#xeb; tregohemi t&#xeb; kujdessh&#xeb;m kur l&#xeb;vizim n&#xeb; klas&#xeb;, pasi mund t&#xeb; l&#xeb;ndojm&#xeb; nj&#xeb;ri-tjetrin.</span> <span data-id=\"pg015_n0011\">- Ne kemi t&#xeb; drejt&#xeb;n e arsimimit, por edhe p&#xeb;rgjegj&#xeb;sin&#xeb; p&#xeb;r njohjen dhe respektimin e rregullave n&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;, - tha m&#xeb;suesja.</span>\n  </p>\n\n  <p class=\"adt-body mt-6 leading-relaxed text-left text-zinc-800\">\n    <span data-id=\"pg015_n0013\">Detyra juaj &#xeb;sht&#xeb; t&#xeb; m&#xeb;soni shum&#xeb;, q&#xeb; t&#xeb; jeni gati p&#xeb;r jet&#xeb;n dhe t&#xeb; ndihmoni me dinjitet vendin, shoq&#xeb;rin&#xeb; dhe mjedisin ku jetoni.</span>\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-6 overflow-hidden rounded-sm bg-cyan-50\">\n    <img data-id=\"pg015_im001\" src=\"images/pg015_im001.png\" alt=\"M&#xeb;suesja para tabel&#xeb;s u flet nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;sve n&#xeb; klas&#xeb;, nd&#xeb;rsa ata jan&#xeb; ulur n&#xeb; banka dhe e d&#xeb;gjojn&#xeb;.\" class=\"h-auto w-full object-cover\">\n  </div>\n\n  <aside class=\"mt-8 rounded-none bg-purple-100 p-5 max-sm:p-4\">\n    <div class=\"mb-4 flex items-start justify-between gap-4\">\n      <div class=\"flex-1\"></div>\n      <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex h-16 w-16 shrink-0 items-center justify-center bg-purple-500 text-white\">?</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"space-y-5\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-zinc-900\"><span data-id=\"pg015_n0017\">&#xc7;far&#xeb; k&#xeb;rkonte m&#xeb;suesja nga nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;sit?</span></p>\n        <label for=\"item-1\" class=\"sr-only\">&#xc7;far&#xeb; k&#xeb;rkonte m&#xeb;suesja nga nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;sit?</label>\n        <textarea id=\"item-1\" data-activity-item=\"item-1\" aria-label=\"&#xc7;far&#xeb; k&#xeb;rkonte m&#xeb;suesja nga nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;sit?\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-11 w-full rounded-lg border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-zinc-900 outline-none transition focus:border-purple-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-200\"></textarea>\n      </div>\n\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-zinc-900\"><span data-id=\"pg015_n0019\">Po ju, a i respektoni rregullat n&#xeb; klas&#xeb;?</span></p>\n        <label for=\"item-2\" class=\"sr-only\">Po ju, a i respektoni rregullat n&#xeb; klas&#xeb;?</label>\n        <textarea id=\"item-2\" data-activity-item=\"item-2\" aria-label=\"Po ju, a i respektoni rregullat n&#xeb; klas&#xeb;?\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-11 w-full rounded-lg border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-zinc-900 outline-none transition focus:border-purple-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-200\"></textarea>\n      </div>\n\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-zinc-900\"><span data-id=\"pg015_n0022\">Cilat jan&#xeb; disa nga t&#xeb; drejtat tuaja?</span></p>\n        <label for=\"item-3\" class=\"sr-only\">Cilat jan&#xeb; disa nga t&#xeb; drejtat tuaja?</label>\n        <textarea id=\"item-3\" data-activity-item=\"item-3\" aria-label=\"Cilat jan&#xeb; disa nga t&#xeb; drejtat tuaja?\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-11 w-full rounded-lg border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-zinc-900 outline-none transition focus:border-purple-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-200\"></textarea>\n      </div>\n\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-zinc-900\"><span data-id=\"pg015_n0024\">P&#xeb;rmend disa p&#xeb;rgjegj&#xeb;si q&#xeb; ke n&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;.</span></p>\n        <label for=\"item-4\" class=\"sr-only\">P&#xeb;rmend disa p&#xeb;rgjegj&#xeb;si q&#xeb; ke n&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;.</label>\n        <textarea id=\"item-4\" data-activity-item=\"item-4\" aria-label=\"P&#xeb;rmend disa p&#xeb;rgjegj&#xeb;si q&#xeb; ke n&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;.\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-11 w-full rounded-lg border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-zinc-900 o