xeb;sh informacione t&#xeb; ndryshme?</label>\n                  <textarea id=\"item-2\" data-activity-item=\"item-2\" aria-label=\"Pse &#xeb;sht&#xeb; e r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sishme q&#xeb; t&#xeb; marr&#xeb;sh informacione t&#xeb; ndryshme?\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 rounded-xl border-2 border-[#b36bb6] bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#a968af]\"></textarea>\n                </div>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"adt-body\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n                  <span data-id=\"pg017_n0011\">Po ju, a merrni informacione nga televizioni?</span>\n                  <label for=\"item-3\" class=\"sr-only\">Po ju, a merrni informacione nga televizioni?</label>\n                  <input id=\"item-3\" type=\"text\" data-activity-item=\"item-3\" aria-label=\"Po ju, a merrni informacione nga televizioni?\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 rounded-xl border-2 border-[#b36bb6] bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#a968af]\">\n                </div>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"adt-body\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n                  <span data-id=\"pg017_n0013\">Pse vajza duhej t&#xeb; mbante distanc&#xeb;?</span>\n                  <label for=\"item-4\" class=\"sr-only\">Pse vajza duhej t&#xeb; mbante distanc&#xeb;?</label>\n                  <textarea id=\"item-4\" data-activity-item=\"item-4\" aria-label=\"Pse vajza duhej t&#xeb; mbante distanc&#xeb;?\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 rounded-xl border-2 border-[#b36bb6] bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#a968af]\"></textarea>\n                </div>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"adt-body\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n                  <span data-id=\"pg017_n0015\">&#xc7;far&#xeb; ndodh n&#xeb;se nuk kujdeseni p&#xeb;r sh&#xeb;ndetin tuaj?</span>\n                  <label for=\"item-5\" class=\"sr-only\">&#xc7;far&#xeb; ndodh n&#xeb;se nuk kujdeseni p&#xeb;r sh&#xeb;ndetin tuaj?</label>\n                  <textarea id=\"item-5\" data-activity-item=\"item-5\" aria-label=\"&#xc7;far&#xeb; ndodh n&#xeb;se nuk kujdeseni p&#xeb;r sh&#xeb;ndetin tuaj?\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 rounded-xl border-2 border-[#b36bb6] bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#a968af]\"></textarea>\n                </div>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"adt-body\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n                  <span data-id=\"pg017_n0017\">Pse &#xeb;sht&#xeb; e r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sishme q&#xeb; &#xe7;do f&#xeb;mij&#xeb; t&#xeb; ket&#xeb; t&#xeb; drejt&#xeb;n p&#xeb;r kujdes sh&#xeb;ndet&#xeb;sor?</span>\n                  <label for=\"item-6\" class=\"sr-only\">Pse &#xeb;sht&#xeb; e r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sishme q&#xeb; &#xe7;do f&#xeb;mij&#xeb; t&#xeb; ket&#xeb; t&#xeb; drejt&#xeb;n p&#xeb;r kujdes sh&#xeb;ndet&#xeb;sor?</label>\n                  <textarea id=\"item-6\" data-activity-item=\"item-6\" aria-label=\"Pse &#xeb;sht&#xeb; e r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sishme q&#xeb; &#xe7;do f&#xeb;mij&#xeb; t&#xeb; ket&#xeb; t&#xeb; drejt&#xeb;n p&#xeb;r kujdes sh&#xeb;ndet&#xeb;sor?\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 rounded-xl border-2 border-[#b36bb6] bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#a968af]\"></textarea>\n                </div>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"relative z-10 mt-10 px-14 max-lg:px-5 max-sm:px-0\">\n          <div class=\"border-2 border-[#bf83c3] bg-white/20 p-4 max-sm:p-4\">\n            <p class=\"adt-body italic leading-8 text-slate-800\">\n              <span data-id=\"pg017_n0020\">Dokumenti q&#xeb; mbron t&#xeb; drejtat e njeriut quhet Deklarata Universale mbi t&#xeb; Drejtat e Njeriut.</span>\n              <span data-id=\"pg017_n0021\">Shtetet q&#xeb; e n&#xeb;nshkruajn&#xeb; at&#xeb;, jan&#xeb; t&#xeb; detyruara ta zbatojn&#xeb;.</span>\n              <span data-id=\"pg017_n0022\">T&#xeb; drejtat e njeriut ndahen n&#xeb; t&#xeb; drejta civile dhe politike (e drejta p&#xeb;r jet&#xeb;n, shprehja e lir&#xeb; e mendimit, liria e besimit fetar, e drejta p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; votuar etj.) dhe t&#xeb; drejtat sociale, ekonomike dhe kulturore (e drejta p&#xeb;r arsimim, pun&#xeb;sim, kujdes sh&#xeb;ndet&#xeb;sor etj.).</span>\n              <span data-id=\"pg017_n0023\">F&#xeb;mij&#xeb;t kan&#xeb; t&#xeb; drejtat e tyre, t&#xeb; cilat mbrohen n&#xeb;p&#xeb;rmjet 54 neneve t&#xeb; Konvent&#xeb;s mbi t&#xeb; Drejtat e F&#xeb;mij&#xeb;s, miratuar m&#xeb; 20 n&#xeb;ntor 1989.</span>\n              <span data-id=\"pg017_n0024\">Njohja e f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;ve me t&#xeb; drejtat fillon n&#xeb; familje.</span>\n              <span data-id=\"pg017_n0025\">Shkolla i aft&#xeb;son ata q&#xeb; t&apos;i njohin, t&apos;i kuptojn&#xeb; dhe t&apos;i mbrojn&#xeb; t&#xeb; drejtat e tyre.</span>\n              <span data-id=\"pg017_n0026\">N&#xeb; themel t&#xeb; t&#xeb; drejtave q&#xeb;ndrojn&#xeb; respekti dhe dinjiteti njer&#xeb;zor.</span>\n              <span data-id=\"pg017_n0027\">T&#xeb; drejtat dhe p&#xeb;rgjegj&#xeb;sit&#xeb; shkojn&#xeb; bashk&#xeb;.</span>\n              <span data-id=\"pg017_n0028\">Duke marr&#xeb; p&#xeb;rgjegj&#xeb;si, ne m&#xeb;sojm&#xeb; kush jemi dhe si t&#xeb; sillemi me t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;t.</span>\n              <span data-id=\"pg017_n0029\">P&#xeb;rgjegj&#xeb;sia do t&#xeb; thot&#xeb; t&#xeb; respektojm&#xeb; veten dhe t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;t, t&#xeb; mbrojm&#xeb; t&#xeb; drejtat dhe t&#xeb; punojm&#xeb; s&#xeb; bashku.</span>\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"relative z-10 mt-8 px-14 pb-4 max-lg:px-5 max-sm:px-0 adt-body\">\n          <p class=\"inline font-semibold\" data-id=\"pg017_n0031\">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e:</p>\n          <span class=\"ml-1 inline\" data-id=\"pg017_n0032\">e drejt&#xeb;, p&#xeb;rgjegj&#xeb;si, informim, distanc&#xeb;.</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg018_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg018_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"21\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container opacity-0\">\n  <section data-section-type=\"text_and_images\" data-section-id=\"pg018_sec001\" class=\"bg-white\">\n    <div class=\"w-full bg-purple-500\">\n      <div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 py-6\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-stretch gap-4 max-sm:gap-3\">\n          <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"shrink-0 w-24 rounded-2xl bg-purple-400 flex items-center justify-center max-sm:w-20\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" class=\"w-14 h-14 text-white\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\