activity-item=\"item-2\" aria-label=\"Cilat nga loj&#xeb;rat mund t&#xeb; realizohen me karroca l&#xeb;viz&#xeb;se?\" class=\"w-full min-h-28 max-sm:min-h-24 rounded-lg border border-purple-300 bg-white/90 px-4 py-3 leading-7 resize-y focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-400\"></textarea></div><div><label for=\"activity-item-3\" class=\"block mb-3 text-slate-900 leading-snug\"><span data-id=\"pg024_n0021\">Jep shembuj nga komuniteti juaj, n&#xeb; t&#xeb; cilin i p&#xeb;rfshini individ&#xeb;t me aft&#xeb;si t&#xeb; kufizuara.</span></label><textarea id=\"activity-item-3\" data-activity-item=\"item-3\" aria-label=\"Jep shembuj nga komuniteti juaj, n&#xeb; t&#xeb; cilin i p&#xeb;rfshini individ&#xeb;t me aft&#xeb;si t&#xeb; kufizuara.\" class=\"w-full min-h-32 max-sm:min-h-28 rounded-lg border border-purple-300 bg-white/90 px-4 py-3 leading-7 resize-y focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-400\"></textarea></div></div></div></div></section></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg025_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg025_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"34\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container opacity-0\"><section data-section-type=\"text_and_single_image\" data-section-id=\"pg025_sec001\" class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl bg-white px-8 py-8 text-slate-800 max-sm:px-5\">\n  <div class=\"mb-6 overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-fuchsia-500\">\n    <div class=\"px-8 py-6 max-sm:px-5\">\n      <h1 class=\"adt-h2 text-left text-slate-900\" data-id=\"pg025_n0003\">Ndihem i/e barabart&#xeb;</h1>\n      <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-3 h-1 w-40 rounded-full bg-purple-200 max-sm:w-32\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mb-8 rounded-3xl bg-amber-50 px-5 py-5 ring-1 ring-amber-200\">\n    <h3 class=\"adt-h3 inline-block rounded-xl bg-amber-300 px-3 py-1 font-semibold text-slate-900\" data-id=\"pg025_n0005\">Situata 2.</h3>\n    <p class=\"adt-body mt-4 text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-800\">\n      <span data-id=\"pg025_n0006\">Nora kishte koh&#xeb; q&#xeb; mendonte se si ta ndihmonte shokun e saj t&#xeb; bank&#xeb;s.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg025_n0007\" class=\"ml-1\">Ai kishte v&#xeb;shtir&#xeb;si n&#xeb; matematik&#xeb;.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg025_n0008\" class=\"ml-1\">Shpeshher&#xeb;, m&#xeb;suesja i t&#xeb;rhiqte v&#xeb;mendjen, pasi ai nuk i zgjidhte sakt&#xeb; ushtrimet dhe problemat.</span>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mb-8 overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-slate-50 shadow-md ring-1 ring-slate-200\">\n    <img data-id=\"pg025_im002\" src=\"images/pg025_im002.png\" alt=\"Nora dhe shoku i saj i bank&#xeb;s shkruajn&#xeb; n&#xeb; fletore, ulur pran&#xeb; nj&#xeb;ri-tjetrit n&#xeb; klas&#xeb;.\" class=\"h-auto w-full object-cover\">\n  </div>\n\n  <aside class=\"mb-10 rounded-3xl bg-purple-100 px-5 py-5 ring-1 ring-purple-200\">\n    <div class=\"space-y-5\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-slate-800\" data-id=\"pg025_n0010\">&#x2013; Vazhd&#x43e;je tregimin ashtu si&#xe7; do ti t&#xeb; zhvillohen ngjarjet!</p>\n        <label for=\"item-1\" class=\"sr-only\">&#x2013; Vazhd&#x43e;je tregimin ashtu si&#xe7; do ti t&#xeb; zhvillohen ngjarjet!</label>\n        <textarea id=\"item-1\" data-activity-item=\"item-1\" aria-label=\"&#x2013; Vazhd&#x43e;je tregimin ashtu si&#xe7; do ti t&#xeb; zhvillohen ngjarjet!\" class=\"mt-3 min-h-11 w-full rounded-2xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-slate-800 outline-none focus:border-purple-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-200\"></textarea>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-slate-800\" data-id=\"pg025_n0011\">&#x2013; Si mendoi q&#xeb; ta zgjidhte Nora problemin e shokut t&#xeb; saj?</p>\n        <label for=\"item-2\" class=\"sr-only\">&#x2013; Si mendoi q&#xeb; ta zgjidhte Nora problemin e shokut t&#xeb; saj?</label>\n        <textarea id=\"item-2\" data-activity-item=\"item-2\" aria-label=\"&#x2013; Si mendoi q&#xeb; ta zgjidhte Nora problemin e shokut t&#xeb; saj?\" class=\"mt-3 min-h-11 w-full rounded-2xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-slate-800 outline-none focus:border-purple-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-200\"></textarea>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-slate-800\" data-id=\"pg025_n0012\">&#x2013; Po ju, si do t&#xeb; vepronit n&#xeb; nj&#xeb; situat&#xeb; t&#xeb; till&#xeb;?</p>\n        <label for=\"item-3\" class=\"sr-only\">&#x2013; Po ju, si do t&#xeb; vepronit n&#xeb; nj&#xeb; situat&#xeb; t&#xeb; till&#xeb;?</label>\n        <textarea id=\"item-3\" data-activity-item=\"item-3\" aria-label=\"&#x2013; Po ju, si do t&#xeb; vepronit n&#xeb; nj&#xeb; situat&#xeb; t&#xeb; till&#xeb;?\" class=\"mt-3 min-h-11 w-full rounded-2xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-slate-800 outline-none focus:border-purple-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-200\"></textarea>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </aside>\n\n  <div class=\"mb-8 rounded-3xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-5 py-4 shadow-sm\">\n    <p class=\"adt-body text-left italic leading-relaxed text-slate-700\">\n      <span data-id=\"pg025_n0015\">F&#xeb;mij&#xeb;ve, q&#xeb; kan&#xeb; v&#xeb;shtir&#xeb;si t&#xeb; ndryshme, duhet t&#x2019;u jepen t&#xeb; nj&#xeb;jtat mund&#xeb;si, p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; b&#xeb;r&#xeb; nj&#xeb; jet&#xeb; dinjitoze, si gjith&#xeb; t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;t.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg025_n0016\" class=\"ml-1\">F&#xeb;mij&#xeb;t me v&#xeb;shtir&#xeb;si n&#xeb; t&#xeb; nx&#xeb;n&#xeb; kan&#xeb; nevoj&#xeb; p&#xeb;r kujdes dhe arsimim t&#xeb; ve&#xe7;ant&#xeb; p&#xeb;r mir&#xeb;rritjen e tyre.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg025_n0017\" class=\"ml-1\">M&#xeb;suesi duhet t&#x2019;u ofroj&#xeb; besim dhe mb&#xeb;shtetje p&#xeb;r zhvillim t&#xeb; plot&#xeb;.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg025_n0018\" class=\"ml-1\">Ata jan&#xeb; pjes&#xeb; e r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sishme e shoq&#xeb;ris&#xeb;.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg025_n0019\" class=\"ml-1\">Secili prej tyre duhet t&#xeb; ndihmohet p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; qen&#xeb; i pavarur dhe t&#x2019;i sigurohet pjes&#xeb;marrje aktive n&#xeb; komunitetin e tij.</span>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-slate-800\" data-id=\"pg025_n0020\">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e: aft&#xeb;si e kufizuar, v&#xeb;shtir&#xeb;si, nevoj&#xeb; e ve&#xe7;ant&#xeb;.</p>\n</section></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg026_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg026_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"35\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 opacity-0\">\n  <section data-section-type=\"text_and_single_image\" data-section-id=\"pg026_sec001\" class=\"bg-[#f7ebe4] text-slate-800 overflow-hidden\">\n    <div class=\"w-full bg-[#ab6ab0] rounded-t-[2rem] rounded-bl-[2rem] mt-6 mb-6\">\n      <div class=\"px-6 py-6 flex items-start justify-between gap-4 max-lg:flex-col max-lg:items-start\">\n        <div class=\"flex-1 pt-2\">\n          <h1 class=\"adt-h2 font-semibold text-white\"><span data-id=\"pg026_n0003\">Mendimi ndryshe</span></h1>\n          <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-3 h-1 w-52 max-w-full rounded-full bg-white/80\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"shrink-0 w-24 h-24 rounded-[1.5rem] bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-semibold\">\n          <span>&#x1f91d;</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pb-8\">\n      <div class=\"mb-5 inline-block rounded-md bg-[#6fbd77] px-5 py-2 shadow-sm\">\n        <h3 class=\"adt-h3 font-semibold text-slate-900\"><span data-id=\"pg026_n0004\">Situata 1.</span></h3>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed mb-5 text-left max-w-[58rem]\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg026_n0006\">M&#xeb;suesi i l&#xeb;nd&#xeb;s Shoq&#xeb;ria dhe mjedisi e nisi or&#xeb;n me nj&#xeb; pyetje q&#xeb; nxiti diskutim:</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg026_n0007\">- &#xc7;far&#xeb; mendoni, &#xeb;sht&#xeb; m&#xeb; mir&#xeb; t&#xeb; shikoni nj&#xeb; film apo t&#xeb; lexoni nj&#xeb; roman?</span>\n      </p>\n\n      <p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed mb-8 text-left max-w-[58rem]\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg026_n0009\">Andi dhe Tea reaguan menj&#xeb;her&#xeb;, duke th&#xeb;n&#xeb; se filmi ta jep ngjarjen me pamje, &#xeb;sht&#xeb; m&#xeb; i leht&#xeb; p&#xeb;r t&apos;u mbajtur n&#xeb; mend dhe ta kursen koh&#xeb;n.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg026_n0010\">Por, Trina dhe Agroni nuk e p&#xeb;rkrah&#xeb;n k&#xeb;t&#xeb; mendim.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg026_n0011\">Ata than&#xeb; se libri &#xeb;sht&#xeb; m&#xeb; i mir&#xeb;, sepse t&#xeb; l&#xeb; hap&#xeb;sir&#xeb; p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; menduar, p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; imagjinuar dhe t&#xeb; b&#xeb;n m&#xeb; kreativ.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg026_n0012\">K&#xeb;shtu, t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; u p&#xeb;rfshin&#xeb; n&#xeb; diskutim, duke dh&#xeb;n&#xeb; mendime t&#xeb; ndryshme, por gjithmon&#xeb; duke pritur radh&#xeb;n p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; folur.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg026_n0013\">M&#xeb;suesi e dinte q&#xeb; t&#xeb; dy kishin vler&#xeb;n e vet.</span>\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"mb-6 rounded-[2rem] border-[6px] border-[#d6a06d] bg-[#f3dfd2] shadow-md overflow-hidden clear-both\">\n        <img data-id=\"pg026_im001\" src=\"images/pg026_im001.png\" alt=\"Kat&#xeb;r nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;s t&#xeb; ulur rreth nj&#xeb; tavoline n&#xeb; klas&#xeb; diskutojn&#xeb; me radh&#xeb;, me libra t&#xeb; hapur p&#xeb;rpara dhe tabel&#xeb;n e gjelb&#xeb;r pas tyre.\" class=\"w-full h-auto block\">\n      </div>\n\n      <aside class=\"rounded-[1.75rem] bg-[#d9c3e6] border-2 border-white shadow-lg p-5 max-sm:p-4 text-left\">\n        <div class=\"flex gap-4 items-start max-sm:flex-col\">\n          <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"shrink-0 w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-[#ab6ab0] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-semibold\">\n            <span>?</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex-1 space-y-5 w-full\">\n            <div class=\"rounded-2xl bg-white/40 p-4\">\n              <p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed mb-3\"><span data-id=\"pg026_n0015\">- Po ty, a t&#xeb; p&#xeb;lqen m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; filmi apo libri? Argumentoje p&#xeb;rgjigjen t&#xeb;nde!</span></p>\n              <label for=\"item-1\" class=\"sr-only\">- Po ty, a t&#xeb; p&#xeb;lqen m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; filmi apo libri? Argumentoje p&#xeb;rgjigjen t&#xeb;nde!</label>\n              <textarea id=\"item-1\" data-activity-item=\"item-1\" aria-label=\"- Po ty, a t&#xeb; p&#xeb;lqen m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; filmi apo libri? Argumentoje p&#xeb;rgjigjen t&#xeb;nde!\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 h-28 rounded-xl border-2 border-[#b06ab3] bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#b06ab3]\"></textarea>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"rounded-2xl bg-white/40 p-4\">\n              <p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed mb-3\"><span data-id=\"pg026_n0016\">- A duhet t&#xeb; pajtohesh gjithmon&#xeb; me mendimin e t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;ve? Sa &#xeb;sht&#xeb; i r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sish&#xeb;m mendimi yt?</span></p>\n              <label for=\"item-2\" class=\"sr-only\">- A duhet t&#xeb; pajtohesh gjithmon&#xeb; me mendimin e t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;ve? Sa &#xeb;sht&#xeb; i r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sish&#xeb;m mendimi yt?</label>\n              <textarea id=\"item-2\" data-activity-item=\"item-2\" aria-label=\"- A duhet t&#xeb; pajtohesh gjithmon&#xeb; me mendimin e t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;ve? Sa &#xeb;sht&#xeb; i r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sish&#xeb;m mendimi yt?\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 h-28 rounded-xl border-2 border-[#b06ab3] bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#b06ab3]\"></textarea>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"rounded-2xl bg-white/40 p-4\">\n              <p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed mb-3\"><span data-id=\"pg026_n0017\">- Pasi e keni kuptuar sa i r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sish&#xeb;m &#xeb;sht&#xeb; mendimi juaj, realizoni nj&#xeb; diskutim t&#xeb; ngjash&#xeb;m n&#xeb; klas&#xeb; p&#xeb;r sportet.</span></p>\n              <label for=\"item-3\" class=\"sr-only\">- Pasi e keni kuptuar sa i r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sish&#xeb;m &#xeb;sht&#xeb; mendimi juaj, realizoni nj&#xeb; diskutim t&#xeb; ngjash&#xeb;m n&#xeb; klas&#xeb; p&#xeb;r sportet.</label>\n              <textarea id=\"item-3\" data-activity-item=\"item-3\" aria-label=\"- Pasi e keni kuptuar sa i r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sish&#xeb;m &#xeb;sht&#xeb; mendimi juaj, realizoni nj&#xeb; diskutim t&#xeb; ngjash&#xeb;m n&#xeb; klas&#xeb; p&#xeb;r sportet.\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 h-24 rounded-xl border-2 border-[#b06ab3] bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#b06ab3]\"></textarea>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </aside>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg027_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg027_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"36\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container opacity-0\"><section data-section-type=\"boxed_text\" data-section-id=\"pg027_sec001\" class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 py-8 max-sm:px-5 bg-[#f7e9df] text-neutral-800\">\n  <div class=\"mb-8 overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-purple-200 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#b35ee8] to-[#b061ea] shadow-sm\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-6 px-8 py-6 max-sm:flex-col max-sm:items-start max-sm:px-5\">\n      <div class=\"flex-1\">\n        <h1 data-id=\"pg027_n0003\" class=\"adt-h2 font-semibold text-left text-neutral-900\">Mendimi ndryshe</h1>\n      </div>\n      <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex h-24 w-24 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-purple-600/40 text-white shadow-sm max-sm:h-20 max-sm:w-20\">\n        <span class=\"adt-h3\">&#x1f90d;</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mb-8 rounded-[2rem] bg-white/55 p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-yellow-200\">\n    <div class=\"mb-4 inline-block rounded-xl bg-yellow-300 px-4 py-2 shadow-sm\">\n      <h3 data-id=\"pg027_n0005\" class=\"adt-h3 font-semibold text-left text-neutral-900\">Situata 2.</h3>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"adt-body text-left leading-8 text-neutral-800\">\n      <span data-id=\"pg027_n0007\">Vjosa, bashk&#xeb; me familjen e saj, kishte koh&#xeb; q&#xeb; ishte zhvendosur p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; jetuar n&#xeb; Gjermani.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg027_n0008\">Me t&#xeb; kisha kaluar koh&#xeb; shum&#xeb; t&#xeb; bukur, sidomos gjat&#xeb; ver&#xeb;s.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg027_n0009\">Kur m&#xeb; tha se do t&#xeb; vinte k&#xeb;t&#xeb; ver&#xeb;, u g&#xeb;zova shum&#xeb;.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg027_n0010\">Koha iku shpejt dhe, ja, vera erdhi.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg027_n0011\">Dit&#xeb;n q&#xeb; po prisja ta shihja, nuk p&#xeb;rmbahesha dot nga g&#xeb;zimi.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg027_n0012\">Kur e pash&#xeb; shoqen time, nuk e njoha fare.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg027_n0013\">Ajo kishte veshur nj&#xeb; pal&#xeb; pantallona t&#xeb; gjera, q&#xeb; dukeshin si fustan.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg027_n0014\">U &#xe7;udita!</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg027_n0015\">Sa shum&#xeb; kishte ndryshuar Vjosa!</span>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <aside class=\"mb-8 rounded-[2rem] bg-purple-200/70 p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-purple-200\">\n    <div class=\"space-y-5\">\n      <div class=\"rounded-2xl bg-white/45 p-4\">\n        <p class=\"adt-body text-left font-medium text-neutral-900\"><span data-id=\"pg027_n0019\">Pse u &#xe7;udit shoqja kur e pa Vjos&#xeb;n?</span></p>\n        <label for=\"item-1\" class=\"sr-only\">Pse u &#xe7;udit shoqja kur e pa Vjos&#xeb;n?</label>\n        <textarea id=\"item-1\" data-activity-item=\"item-1\" aria-label=\"Pse u &#xe7;udit shoqja kur e pa Vjos&#xeb;n?\" class=\"mt-3 min-h-11 w-full rounded-2xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-neutral-800 outline-none transition focus:border-purple-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-200\"></textarea>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rounded-2xl bg-white/45 p-4\">\n        <p class=\"adt-body text-left font-medium text-neutral-900\"><span data-id=\"pg027_n0021\">A ndryshon m&#xeb;nyra e veshjes dhe e sjelljes nga nj&#xeb; vend n&#xeb; tjetrin?</span></p>\n        <label for=\"item-2\" class=\"sr-only\">A ndryshon m&#xeb;nyra e veshjes dhe e sjelljes nga nj&#xeb; vend n&#xeb; tjetrin?</label>\n        <textarea id=\"item-2\" data-activity-item=\"item-2\" aria-label=\"A ndryshon m&#xeb;nyra e veshjes dhe e sjelljes nga nj&#xeb; vend n&#xeb; tjetrin?\" class=\"mt-3 min-h-11 w-full rounded-2xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-neutral-800 outline-none transition focus:border-purple-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-200\"></textarea>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rounded-2xl bg-white/45 p-4\">\n        <p class=\"adt-body text-left font-medium text-neutral-900\"><span data-id=\"pg027_n0023\">&#xc7;far&#xeb; duhet t&#xeb; kemi parasysh q&#xeb; t&#x2019;i shmangim keqkuptimet?</span></p>\n        <label for=\"item-3\" class=\"sr-only\">&#xc7;far&#xeb; duhet t&#xeb; kemi parasysh q&#xeb; t&#x2019;i shmangim keqkuptimet?</label>\n        <textarea id=\"item-3\" data-activity-item=\"item-3\" aria-label=\"&#xc7;far&#xeb; duhet t&#xeb; kemi parasysh q&#xeb; t&#x2019;i shmangim keqkuptimet?\" class=\"mt-3 min-h-11 w-full rounded-2xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-neutral-800 outline-none transition focus:border-purple-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-200\"></textarea>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </aside>\n\n  <aside class=\"rounded-[2rem] border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white/45 p-6 shadow-sm\">\n    <p class=\"adt-body text-left italic leading-8 text-neutral-800\">\n      <span data-id=\"pg027_n0026\">T&#xeb; kesh mendim ndryshe prej t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;ve, rreth nj&#xeb; teme a &#xe7;&#xeb;shtjeje, &#xeb;sht&#xeb; krejt&#xeb;sisht e natyrshme, sepse njer&#xeb;zit zhvillohen ndryshe dhe kan&#xeb; kultura t&#xeb; ndryshme.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg027_n0027\">Nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;sit, p&#xeb;r shembull, duhet t&#xeb; jen&#xeb; pranues dhe jo diskriminues ndaj nj&#xeb;ri-tjetrit.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg027_n0028\">Ata duhet t&#xeb; mb&#xeb;shtetin bashk&#xeb;moshatar&#xeb;t e tyre, edhe pse mund t&#xeb; ken&#xeb; mendim ndryshe.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg027_n0029\">Z&#xeb;ri i t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; individ&#xeb;ve duhet d&#xeb;gjuar dhe vler&#xeb;suar.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg027_n0030\">Mendimi ndryshe nxit kreativitetin e konkurrenc&#xeb;n dhe ndihmon p&#xeb;r zgjidhjen m&#xeb; t&#xeb; shpejt&#xeb; t&#xeb; problemeve e krijimin e ideve t&#xeb; qarta p&#xeb;r zhvillim.</span>\n    </p>\n  </aside>\n</section></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg028_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg028_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"37\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container opacity-0\"><section data-section-type=\"text_and_images\" data-section-id=\"pg028_sec001\" class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 py-8 max-sm:px-5 bg-white text-slate-800\">\n  <div class=\"mb-8 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden bg-violet-200/40\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-stretch max-lg:flex-col\">\n      <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"bg-violet-500 w-36 min-h-[140px] flex items-center justify-center max-lg:w-full max-lg:min-h-[110px]\">\n        <div class=\"text-white\">&#x2764;</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex-1 bg-white px-6 py-6 border-t-8 border-violet-500\">\n        <h1 data-id=\"pg028_n0003\" class=\"adt-h2 text-left text-slate-800\">Shum&#xeb;llojshm&#xeb;ria fetare n&#xeb; vendin ton&#xeb;</h1>\n        <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-3 h-1 w-2/3 bg-violet-400 rounded-full\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mb-8 flex items-start gap-6 max-lg:flex-col max-lg:gap-4\">\n    <h3 data-id=\"pg028_n0004\" class=\"adt-h3 shrink-0 bg-green-400 text-slate-900 px-5 py-2 rounded-sm text-left\">Situata 1.</h3>\n    <p class=\"adt-body text-left leading-relaxed\">\n      <span data-id=\"pg028_n0006\">Zakonisht, n&#xeb; or&#xeb;t e mesdit&#xeb;s, d&#xeb;gjonim z&#xeb;ra q&#xeb; vinin nga minaret e xhamis&#xeb; dhe nga kambanat e kish&#xeb;s.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg028_n0007\">Prind&#xeb;rit m&#xeb; pan&#xeb; q&#xeb; isha habitur, andaj, kur dol&#xeb;m p&#xeb;r nj&#xeb; sh&#xeb;titje, ata m&#xeb; d&#xeb;rguan n&#xeb; nj&#xeb; vend ku i pash&#xeb; t&#xeb; dyja objektet bashk&#xeb;.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg028_n0008\">Ata ma shpjeguan q&#xeb; kjo ishte llojllojshm&#xeb;ria fetare dhe se &#xe7;do njeri duhet t&#xeb; respektoj&#xeb; p&#xeb;rkat&#xeb;sin&#xeb; fetare t&#xeb; njer&#xeb;zve t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg028_n0009\">T&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; jan&#xeb; t&#xeb; lir&#xeb; t&apos;i shprehin mendimet e tyre dhe t&#xeb; ndjekin &#xe7;far&#xeb;do besimi fetar q&#xeb; d&#xeb;shirojn&#xeb;.</span>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.05fr_1fr] gap-4 items-start max-lg:grid-cols-1 mb-10\">\n    <figure class=\"bg-stone-50 rounded-sm overflow-hidden shadow-sm\">\n      <img data-id=\"pg028_im002\" src=\"images/pg028_im002.png\" alt=\"Prishtin&#xeb;, viti 1930: kull&#xeb; kishe dhe xhami me minare pran&#xeb; nj&#xeb;ra-tjetr&#xeb;s, me banor&#xeb; n&#xeb; rrug&#xeb;.\" class=\"w-full h-auto block\">\n      <figcaption data-id=\"pg028_n0011\" class=\"adt-caption text-center text-slate-700 py-3\">Prishtin&#xeb;, viti 1930</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\">\n      <figure class=\"bg-stone-50 rounded-sm overflow-hidden shadow-sm\">\n        <img data-id=\"pg028_im003\" src=\"images/pg028_im003.png\" alt=\"Ferizaj: kish&#xeb; ortodokse, kambanore kishe dhe minaret e xhamis&#xeb; pran&#xeb; nj&#xeb;ra-tjetr&#xeb;s n&#xeb; qend&#xeb;r t&#xeb; qytetit.\" class=\"w-full h-auto block\">\n        <figcaption data-id=\"pg028_n0013\" class=\"adt-caption text-center text-slate-700 py-3\">Ferizaj</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n      <figure class=\"bg-stone-50 rounded-sm overflow-hidden shadow-sm\">\n        <img data-id=\"pg028_im004\" src=\"images/pg028_im004.png\" alt=\"Gjakov&#xeb;: kambanore kishe dhe minare xhamie ngrihen mbi qytetin e mbuluar me bor&#xeb;.\" class=\"w-full h-auto block\">\n        <figcaption data-id=\"pg028_n0015\" class=\"adt-caption text-center text-slate-700 py-3\">Gjakov&#xeb;</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <aside class=\"bg-violet-200 border-l-8 border-violet-500 rounded-r-2xl p-5\">\n    <div class=\"space-y-5\">\n      <div>\n        <p data-id=\"pg028_n0017\" class=\"adt-body text-left text-slate-800\">- Cilat komunitete fetare i njeh?</p>\n        <label for=\"item-1\" class=\"sr-only\">- Cilat komunitete fetare i njeh?</label>\n        <textarea id=\"item-1\" data-activity-item=\"item-1\" aria-label=\"- Cilat komunitete fetare i njeh?\" class=\"mt-2 w-full min-h-11 rounded-