-1\" class=\"sr-only\">- Pse duhet t&#x2019;i njohim kulturat e ndryshme?</label>\n            <textarea id=\"item-1\" data-activity-item=\"item-1\" aria-label=\"- Pse duhet t&#x2019;i njohim kulturat e ndryshme?\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-11 w-full rounded-lg border-2 border-[#a869b0] bg-white px-3 py-3 text-zinc-800 outline-none focus:border-[#7e4889]\" rows=\"3\"></textarea>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed\"><span data-id=\"pg029_n0013\">- Cila ka qen&#xeb; dhurata m&#xeb; e bukur q&#xeb; ke marr&#xeb; p&#xeb;r nj&#xeb; fest&#xeb;? Si je ndier?</span></p>\n            <label for=\"item-2\" class=\"sr-only\">- Cila ka qen&#xeb; dhurata m&#xeb; e bukur q&#xeb; ke marr&#xeb; p&#xeb;r nj&#xeb; fest&#xeb;? Si je ndier?</label>\n            <textarea id=\"item-2\" data-activity-item=\"item-2\" aria-label=\"- Cila ka qen&#xeb; dhurata m&#xeb; e bukur q&#xeb; ke marr&#xeb; p&#xeb;r nj&#xeb; fest&#xeb;? Si je ndier?\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-11 w-full rounded-lg border-2 border-[#a869b0] bg-white px-3 py-3 text-zinc-800 outline-none focus:border-[#7e4889]\" rows=\"3\"></textarea>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"relative mt-5 overflow-hidden border-2 border-[#c58bc8] bg-white p-4 pr-28 max-sm:pr-4\">\n        <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute right-0 top-0 h-20 w-20 bg-[#a869b0] max-sm:hidden\"></div>\n        <p class=\"adt-body relative z-10 text-left italic leading-relaxed text-zinc-800\">\n          <span data-id=\"pg029_n0016\">Zakonet, traditat dhe gjuha e &#xe7;do populli &#xeb;sht&#xeb; e ndryshme, prandaj dhe kulturat jan&#xeb; t&#xeb; shum&#xeb;llojshme.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg029_n0017\">Ruajtja e larmis&#xeb; kulturore konsiderohet vler&#xeb;.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg029_n0018\">Bashk&#xeb;jetes&#xeb; fetare n&#xeb; nj&#xeb; shtet kemi kur grupe t&#xeb; shumta fetare jetojn&#xeb; s&#xeb; bashku, duke i respektuar besimet e nj&#xeb;ri-tjetrit.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg029_n0019\">Mir&#xeb;kuptimi dhe toleranca midis njer&#xeb;zve q&#xeb; u p&#xeb;rkasin besimeve t&#xeb; ndryshme fetare, p&#xeb;rb&#xeb;n vler&#xeb; kulturore q&#xeb; siguron paqe mes tyre.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg029_n0020\">Shkolla luan rol t&#xeb; r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sish&#xeb;m n&#xeb; edukimin e nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;sve me paqe e dashuri.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg029_n0021\">Ajo krijon mjedis t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rshtatsh&#xeb;m ku respektohen besimet e ndryshme fetare dhe mbizot&#xeb;ron paqja dhe solidariteti.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg029_n0022\">Si &#xe7;do kultur&#xeb; tjet&#xeb;r, edhe kultura jon&#xeb; identifikohet me traditat, zakonet, vlerat, veshjet, ushqimet etj.</span>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"mt-8 flex items-baseline gap-2 text-left max-sm:block max-sm:space-y-1\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg029_n0024\" class=\"adt-body font-semibold text-zinc-900\">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e:</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg029_n0025\" class=\"adt-body text-zinc-800\">kultur&#xeb; fetare, tradit&#xeb;, zakon, vler&#xeb;.</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg030_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg030_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"39\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div class=\"container mx-auto max-w-5xl bg-white px-10 max-lg:px-8 max-sm:px-4 pt-8 pb-12 opacity-0\" id=\"content\"><section data-section-type=\"activity_open_ended_answer\" data-section-id=\"pg030_sec001\" role=\"region\" class=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl\"><div class=\"mb-8\"><div class=\"flex items-stretch max-sm:flex-col max-sm:gap-4\"><div class=\"w-40 max-lg:w-32 max-sm:w-full bg-purple-500 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-6\"><div class=\"text-white text-center\"><div class=\"mx-auto mb-2 h-16 w-16 max-lg:h-14 max-lg:w-14 rounded-full border-4 border-white/80\"></div></div></div><div class=\"flex-1 flex items-center bg-purple-500 rounded-r-2xl max-sm:rounded-2xl px-6 py-5\"><div class=\"h-4 w-full rounded bg-white/0\"></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-5\"><h1 class=\"adt-h2 text-neutral-800 mb-2\" data-id=\"pg030_n0003\">Vlerat</h1><div class=\"h-1 w-[58%] bg-purple-400 max-lg:w-1/2 max-sm:w-2/3\"></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-10\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6 max-sm:flex-col max-sm:gap-4\"><div class=\"shrink-0 bg-green-500 text-neutral-900 px-5 py-2 rounded-sm min-w-[122px] text-center\"><h3 class=\"adt-h3 leading-none\" data-id=\"pg030_n0005\">Situata 1.</h3></div><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed text-neutral-800\"><span data-id=\"pg030_n0007\">Motra e vog&#xeb;l e Dritanit po t&#xeb;rhiqte k&#xeb;mb&#xeb;t zvarr&#xeb; e nuk po na arrinte dot.</span> <span data-id=\"pg030_n0008\">M&#x2019;u duk sikur po qante.</span> <span data-id=\"pg030_n0009\">Un&#xeb; me Dritanin nxituam hapat dhe k&#xeb;shtu u larguam shum&#xeb; prej saj.</span> <span data-id=\"pg030_n0010\">Dikur, z&#xeb;ri i saj nuk d&#xeb;gjohej m&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id=\"pg030_n0011\">Ne nxituam p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; arritur n&#xeb; teatrin e kukullave, p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; siguruar orarin, por nuk kishim q&#xeb;llim ta linim jasht&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id=\"pg030_n0012\">Sapo arrit&#xeb;m te dera e teatrit, nj&#xeb; plak, i k&#xeb;rrusur, por energjik, po e sillte drejt nesh n&#xeb; krah&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id=\"pg030_n0013\">U ndiem n&#xeb; faj</span></p></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-8\"><img src=\"images/pg030_im001.png\" alt=\"Nj&#xeb; plak mban n&#xeb; krah&#xeb; nj&#xeb; vajz&#xeb; t&#xeb; vog&#xeb;l, nd&#xeb;rsa dy f&#xeb;mij&#xeb; e shikojn&#xeb; me shqet&#xeb;sim.\" data-id=\"pg030_im001\" class=\"w-full h-auto max-w-4xl mx-auto\"></div><div class=\"bg-purple-100/90 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"flex items-stretch max-sm:flex-col\"><div class=\"w-24 max-sm:w-full bg-purple-500 min-h-20\"></div><div class=\"flex-1 p-6 max-sm:p-4 space-y-6\"><div><p class=\"adt-body text-neutral-900 mb-2\"><span data-id=\"pg030_n0015\">- Vazhdoni dialogun me plakun.</span></p><label for=\"activity-item-1\" class=\"sr-only\">- Vazhdoni dialogun me plakun.</label><textarea id=\"activity-item-1\" data-activity-item=\"item-1\" aria-label=\"- Vazhdoni dialogun me plakun.\" class=\"w-full min-h-28 max-sm:min-h-24 rounded border border-gray-300 bg-white px-3 py-3 leading-8 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-400\"></textarea></div><div><p class=\"adt-body text-neutral-900 mb-2\"><span data-id=\"pg030_n0016\">- Vazhdoni dialogun me motr&#xeb;n.</span></p><label for=\"activity-item-2\" class=\"sr-only\">- Vazhdoni dialogun me motr&#xeb;n.</label><textarea id=\"activity-item-2\" data-activity-item=\"item-2\" aria-label=\"- Vazhdoni di