Solidariteti - vler&#xeb; njer&#xeb;zore</h1></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-8\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6 max-sm:flex-col max-sm:gap-3\"><div class=\"shrink-0 bg-green-500 px-5 py-2 min-w-56 max-sm:min-w-0 max-sm:w-full\"><h3 class=\"adt-h3 leading-none text-gray-900\" data-id=\"pg032_n0005\">Situata 1.</h3></div><p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed text-gray-800\"><span data-id=\"pg032_n0007\">N&#xeb; rrugic&#xeb;n ton&#xeb; jetonte nj&#xeb; plak i vetmuar.</span> <span data-id=\"pg032_n0008\">Ndihej i fuqish&#xeb;m dhe kryente vet&#xeb; aktivitetet e p&#xeb;rditshme.</span> <span data-id=\"pg032_n0009\">Ne luanim p&#xeb;rpara port&#xeb;s s&#xeb; tij t&#xeb; drunjt&#xeb; dhe ai shpesh b&#xeb;hej spektatori yn&#xeb; i vet&#xeb;m.</span> <span data-id=\"pg032_n0010\">Kishte dit&#xeb; q&#xeb; nuk e shihnim m&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id=\"pg032_n0011\">U b&#xeb;n&#xeb; jav&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id=\"pg032_n0012\">Nj&#xeb; pasdite pam&#xeb; nj&#xeb; infermiere q&#xeb; doli nga dera e drunjt&#xeb;</span></p></div></div><div class=\"mb-10\"><img src=\"images/pg032_im001.png\" alt=\"Infermierja del nga oborri i nj&#xeb; sht&#xeb;pie, nd&#xeb;rsa dy f&#xeb;mij&#xeb; e shikojn&#xeb; me shqet&#xeb;sim.\" data-id=\"pg032_im001\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-contain\"></div><div class=\"bg-purple-100\"><div class=\"flex items-start max-sm:flex-col\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex min-h-20 w-28 shrink-0 items-center justify-center bg-purple-500 max-sm:min-h-16 max-sm:w-full\"><div class=\"relative h-14 w-10\"><div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-8 w-8 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full border-4 border-white border-b-transparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-7 h-6 w-2 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-white\"></div><div class=\"absolute left-1/2 bottom-0 h-2 w-2 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-white\"></div></div></div><div class=\"flex-1 px-6 py-5 max-sm:px-4\"><div class=\"mb-6\"><p id=\"q1-label\" class=\"adt-body mb-3\"><span data-id=\"pg032_n0013\">Vazhdojeni tregimin, duke shprehur se si duhet t&#xeb; ndihmohen t&#xeb; s&#xeb;mur&#xeb;t e vetmuar.</span></p><label for=\"activity-item-1\" class=\"sr-only\">Vazhdojeni tregimin, duke shprehur se si duhet t&#xeb; ndihmohen t&#xeb; s&#xeb;mur&#xeb;t e vetmuar.</label><textarea id=\"activity-item-1\" data-activity-item=\"item-1\" aria-labelledby=\"q1-label\" class=\"min-h-44 w-full rounded border border-gray-400 bg-white px-3 py-3 resize-none leading-7\"></textarea></div><div class=\"mb-6\"><p id=\"q2-label\" class=\"adt-body mb-3\"><span data-id=\"pg032_n0014\">A kujdeset shteti p&#xeb;r njer&#xeb;zit e vetmuar?</span></p><label for=\"activity-item-2\" class=\"sr-only\">A kujdeset shteti p&#xeb;r njer&#xeb;zit e vetmuar?</label><textarea id=\"activity-item-2\" data-activity-item=\"item-2\" aria-labelledby=\"q2-label\" class=\"min-h-24 w-full rounded border border-gray-400 bg-white px-3 py-3 resize-none leading-7\"></textarea></div><div><p id=\"q3-label\" class=\"adt-body mb-3\"><span data-id=\"pg032_n0015\">&#xc7;far&#xeb; ndihme mund t&apos;u ofroj&#xeb; njer&#xeb;zve t&#xeb; vetmuar?</span></p><label for=\"activity-item-3\" class=\"sr-only\">&#xc7;far&#xeb; ndihme mund t&apos;u ofroj&#xeb; njer&#xeb;zve t&#xeb; vetmuar?</label><textarea id=\"activity-item-3\" data-activity-item=\"item-3\" aria-labelledby=\"q3-label\" class=\"min-h-28 w-full rounded border border-gray-400 bg-white px-3 py-3 resize-none leading-7\"></textarea></div></div></div></div></section></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg033_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg033_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"42\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container bg-white opacity-0\">\n  <section data-section-type=\"text_and_single_image\" data-section-id=\"pg033_sec001\" class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 py-8 max-sm:px-5\">\n    <div class=\"-mx-8 h-12 bg-purple-400 max-sm:-mx-5\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"mt-5 max-w-2xl border-b-4 border-purple-400 pb-3\">\n      <h1 class=\"adt-h2 text-left font-semibold text-slate-900\" data-id=\"pg033_n0003\">Solidariteti - vler&#xeb; njer&#xeb;zore</h1>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mt-8 text-left\">\n      <div class=\"inline-block border-b-4 border-purple-300 pb-1\">\n        <h3 class=\"adt-h3 inline-block bg-amber-300 px-4 py-1 font-medium text-slate-900\" data-id=\"pg033_n0005\">Situata 2.</h3>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"adt-body mt-6 text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-800\">\n      <span data-id=\"pg033_n0007\">N&#xeb; vitin 2020, nj&#xeb; virus i quajtur Korona u p&#xeb;rhap n&#xeb; shum&#xeb; vende t&#xeb; bot&#xeb;s dhe i frik&#xeb;soi t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb;.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg033_n0008\">Gjat&#xeb; asaj kohe, njer&#xeb;zit u mbyll&#xeb;n n&#xeb; sht&#xeb;pi p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; mos u s&#xeb;mur&#xeb; - kjo u quajt karantin&#xeb;.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg033_n0009\">Por edhe pse ishin t&#xeb; ndar&#xeb;, shum&#xeb; njer&#xeb;z ndihmuan nj&#xeb;ri-tjetrin.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg033_n0010\">Ata treguan mir&#xeb;si dhe solidaritet, duke ndihmuar ata q&#xeb; kishin m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; nevoj&#xeb;, si t&#xeb; moshuarit ose t&#xeb; s&#xeb;mur&#xeb;t.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg033_n0011\">Bota u bashkua p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; shp&#xeb;tuar jet&#xeb; dhe p&#xeb;r ta kaluar m&#xeb; leht&#xeb; k&#xeb;t&#xeb; koh&#xeb; t&#xeb; v&#xeb;shtir&#xeb;.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"mt-8 flex justify-center\">\n      <div class=\"w-full max-w-4xl rounded-[2rem] bg-amber-50 p-4 ring-1 ring-purple-100 max-sm:p-3\">\n        <img data-id=\"pg033_im002\" src=\"images/pg033_im002.png\" alt=\"Familje e ulur bashk&#xeb; n&#xeb; sht&#xeb;pi gjat&#xeb; pandemis&#xeb;, duke biseduar me shqet&#xeb;sim p&#xeb;r koronavirusin; pran&#xeb; tyre shihet nj&#xeb; djal&#xeb; n&#xeb; karroc&#xeb;, nd&#xeb;rsa n&#xeb; dritare dhe n&#xeb; dhom&#xeb; ka kafsh&#xeb; sht&#xeb;piake dhe bim&#xeb;.\" class=\"h-auto w-full rounded-2xl object-cover\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mt-8\">\n      <p class=\"adt-body text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-800\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg033_n0013\">Pun&#xeb; n&#xeb; grupe: Formohen tri grupe n&#xeb; klas&#xeb;, ku secili grup zgjedh nj&#xeb; aktivitet solidar.</span><br>\n        <span data-id=\"pg033_n0014\">Grupi 1: Grumbullimi i rrobave p&#xeb;r familjet q&#xeb; kan&#xeb; nevoj&#xeb;.</span><br>\n        <span data-id=\"pg033_n0015\">Grupi 2: Grumbullimi i lodrave p&#xeb;r familjet q&#xeb; kan&#xeb; nevoj&#xeb;.</span><br>\n        <span data-id=\"pg033_n0016\">Grupi 3: Vizatimi i kartolinave me mesazhe pozitive p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; moshuarit.</span>\n      </p>\n      <div class=\"mt-4 rounded-2xl border border-purple-200 bg-purple-50 p-4\">\n        <label for=\"activity-item-1\" class=\"sr-only\">Pun&#xeb; n&#xeb; grupe: Formohen tri grupe n&#xeb; klas&#xeb;, ku secili grup zgjedh nj&#xeb; aktivitet solidar.</label>\n        <textarea id=\"activity-item-1\" data-activity-item=\"item-1\" aria-label=\"Pun&#xeb; n&#xeb; grupe: Formohen tri grupe n&#xeb; klas&#xeb;, ku secili grup zgjedh nj&#xeb; aktivitet solidar.\" class=\"min-h-11 w-full rounded-xl border border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-slate-800 outline-none focus:border-purple-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-200\"></textarea>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mt-6 rounded-2xl bg-purple-100 p-5 ring-1 ring-purple-200\">\n      <ul class=\"space-y-5\">\n        <li>\n          <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-slate-800\">\n            <span data-id=\"pg033_n0020\">Sillni shembuj t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb; t&#xeb; solidaritetit.</span>\n          </p>\n          <label for=\"activity-item-2\" class=\"sr-only\">Sillni shembuj t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb; t&#xeb; solidaritetit.</label>\n          <textarea id=\"activity-item-2\" data-activity-item=\"item-2\" aria-label=\"Sillni shembuj t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb; t&#xeb; solidaritetit.\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-11 w-full rounded-xl border border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-slate-800 outline-none focus:border-purple-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-200\"></textarea>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-slate-800\">\n            <span data-id=\"pg033_n0022\">Cil&#xeb;t jan&#xeb; njer&#xeb;zit q&#xeb; kan&#xeb; nevoj&#xeb; p&#xeb;r mb&#xeb;shtetje?</span>\n          </p>\n          <label for=\"activity-item-3\" class=\"sr-only\">Cil&#xeb;t jan&#xeb; njer&#xeb;zit q&#xeb; kan&#xeb; nevoj&#xeb; p&#xeb;r mb&#xeb;shtetje?</label>\n          <textarea id=\"activity-item-3\" data-activity-item=\"item-3\" aria-label=\"Cil&#xeb;t jan&#xeb; njer&#xeb;zit q&#xeb; kan&#xeb; nevoj&#xeb; p&#xeb;r mb&#xeb;shtetje?\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-11 w-full rounded-xl border border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-slate-800 outline-none focus:border-purple-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-200\"></textarea>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-slate-800\">\n            <span data-id=\"pg033_n0024\">&#xc7;far&#xeb; kujdesi duhet treguar p&#xeb;r ta?</span>\n          </p>\n          <label for=\"activity-item-4\" class=\"sr-only\">&#xc7;far&#xeb; kujdesi duhet treguar p&#xeb;r ta?</label>\n          <textarea id=\"activity-item-4\" data-activity-item=\"item-4\" aria-label=\"&#xc7;far&#xeb; kujdesi duhet treguar p&#xeb;r ta?\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-11 w-full rounded-xl border border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-slate-800 outline-none focus:border-purple-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-200\"></textarea>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mt-6 border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm\">\n      <p class=\"adt-body text-left italic leading-relaxed text-slate-800\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg033_n0027\">Solidariteti do t&#xeb; thot&#xeb; t&#xeb; ndihmosh dhe t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rkrah&#xeb;sh t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;t, sidomos kur ata jan&#xeb; n&#xeb; v&#xeb;shtir&#xeb;si.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg033_n0028\">Kur jemi solidar&#xeb;, ne lidhemi me njer&#xeb;zit p&#xeb;rreth nesh dhe i kuptojm&#xeb; ndjenjat dhe nevojat e tyre.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg033_n0029\">Kjo na b&#xeb;n m&#xeb; t&#xeb; af&#xeb;rt dhe m&#xeb; t&#xeb; bashkuar si shoq&#xeb;ri dhe m&#xeb; t&#xeb; ndjesh&#xeb;m p&#xeb;r nevojat, t&#xeb; drejtat dhe v&#xeb;shtir&#xeb;sit&#xeb; e t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;ve.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg033_n0030\">Solidariteti &#xeb;sht&#xeb; m&#xeb;nyr&#xeb; jetese, p&#xeb;r t&#x2019;u ofruar mb&#xeb;shtetje njer&#xeb;zve n&#xeb; &#xe7;astet e v&#xeb;shtira.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg033_n0031\">T&#xeb; tregosh solidaritet do t&#xeb; thot&#xeb; t&#xeb; veprosh n&#xeb; t&#xeb; mir&#xeb; t&#xeb; nj&#xeb; personi apo grupi tjet&#xeb;r shoq&#xeb;ror.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg033_n0032\">Duke mbrojtur interesat e tyre, ne mbrojm&#xeb; interesat tan&#xeb;.</span>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"adt-body mt-5 text-left text-slate-900\">\n      <span data-id=\"pg033_n0034\" class=\"font-semibold\">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e:</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg033_n0035\">solidaritet, vler&#xeb; njer&#xeb;zore, mb&#xeb;shtetje, p&#xeb;rgjegj&#xeb;si e p&#xeb;rbashk&#xeb;t.</span>\n    </p>\n  </section>\n</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg034_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg034_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"43\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div class=\"container mx-auto max-w-5xl bg-white px-16 max-lg:px-10 max-sm:px-6 pt-10 pb-12 opacity-0\" id=\"content\"><section data-section-type=\"activity_open_ended_answer\" data-section-id=\"pg034_sec001\" class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl\"><h1 class=\"adt-h2 mb-4 text-amber-700 font-bold\" data-id=\"pg034_n0003\">Barazi p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb;</h1><h3 class=\"adt-h3 mb-5 text-black\" data-id=\"pg034_n0005\">Situata 1.</h3><div class=\"mb-8 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50 px-5 py-4\"><p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed text-gray-900\"><span data-id=\"pg034_n0007\">Aktiviteti fizik &#xeb;sht&#xeb; i sh&#xeb;ndetsh&#xeb;m p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id=\"pg034_n0008\">F&#xeb;mij&#xeb;t zakonisht p&#xeb;lqejn&#xeb; loj&#xeb;rat n&#xeb; natyr&#xeb;.</span></p><p class=\"adt-body mt-2 leading-relaxed text-gray-900\"><span data-id=\"pg034_n0009\">N&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb; do ta zhvillonim turneun e futbollit.</span> <span data-id=\"pg034_n0010\">Secili, sipas interesave, shprehu d&#xeb;shir&#xeb;n p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; qen&#xeb; pjes&#xeb;marr&#xeb;s n&#xeb; ekip.</span></p><p class=\"adt-body mt-2 leading-relaxed text-gray-900\"><span data-id=\"pg034_n0011\">Ne luanim shpesh futboll n&#xeb; koh&#xeb;n e lir&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id=\"pg034_n0012\">Blerta nuk u p&#xeb;rfshi n&#xeb; ekipin e shkoll&#xeb;s</span></p></div><div class=\"mb-0 overflow-hidden rounded-t-sm\"><img data-id=\"pg034_im001\" src=\"images/pg034_im001.png\" alt=\"Tre f&#xeb;mij&#xeb; luajn&#xeb; futboll n&#xeb; park, nd&#xeb;rsa nj&#xeb; vajz&#xeb; e ulur anash i shikon, e pap&#xeb;rfshir&#xeb; n&#xeb; loj&#xeb;.\" class=\"block w-full h-auto\"></div><div class=\"bg-purple-100 px-6 py-5 max-sm:px-4\"><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div><p class=\"adt-body mb-2 text-gray-900\"><span data-id=\"pg034_n0013\">Vazhdoni tregimin dhe b&#xeb;jeni nj&#xeb; zgjidhje t&#xeb; drejt&#xeb; p&#xeb;r Blert&#xeb;n.</span></p><label for=\"activity-item-1\" class=\"sr-only\">Vazhdoni tregimin dhe b&#xeb;jeni nj&#xeb; zgjidhje t&#xeb; drejt&#xeb; p&#xeb;r Blert&#xeb;n.</label><textarea id=\"activity-item-1\" data-activity-item=\"item-1\" aria-label=\"Vazhdoni tregimin dhe b&#xeb;jeni nj&#xeb; zgjidhje t&#xeb; drejt&#xeb; p&#xeb;r Blert&#xeb;n.\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 h-28 rounded border border-gray-400 bg-white px-3 py-3 resize-none\"></textarea></div><div><p class=\"adt-body mb-2 text-gray-900\"><span data-id=\"pg034_n0014\">Cilat mund t&#xeb; jen&#xeb; arsyet e mosp&#xeb;rfshirjes s&#xeb; Blert&#xeb;s n&#xeb; ekip?</span></p><label for=\"activity-item-2\" class=\"sr-only\">Cilat mund t&#xeb; jen&#xeb; arsyet e mosp&#xeb;rfshirjes s&#xeb; Blert&#xeb;s n&#xeb; ekip?</label><textarea id=\"activity-item-2\" data-activity-item=\"item-2\" aria-label=\"Cilat mund t&#xeb; jen&#xeb; arsyet e mosp&#xeb;rfshirjes s&#xeb; Blert&#xeb;s n&#xeb; ekip?\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 h-24 rounded border border-gray-400 bg-white px-3 py-3 resize-none\"></textarea></div><div><p class=\"adt-body mb-2 text-gray-900\"><span data-id=\"pg034_n0015\">Listoni nj&#xeb; s&#xeb;r&#xeb; veprimtarish q&#xeb; ju kufizojn&#xeb; t&#xeb; merrni pjes&#xeb;.</span></p><label for=\"activity-item-3\" class=\"sr-only\">Listoni nj&#xeb; s&#xeb;r&#xeb; veprimtarish q&#xeb; ju kufizojn&#xeb; t&#xeb; merrni pjes&#xeb;.</label><textarea id=\"activity-item-3\" data-activity-item=\"item-3\" aria-label=\"Listoni nj&#xeb; s&#xeb;r&#xeb; veprimtarish q&#xeb; ju kufizojn&#xeb; t&#xeb; merrni pjes&#xeb;.\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 h-28 rounded border border-gray-400 bg-white px-3 py-3 resize-none\"></textarea></div><div><p class=\"adt-body mb-2 text-gray-900\"><span data-id=\"pg034_n0016\">A duhet q&#xeb; edhe vler&#xeb;simi n&#xeb; m&#xeb;sime t&#xeb; b&#xeb;het mbi baz&#xeb;n e barazis&#xeb;?</span></p><label for=\"activity-item-4\" class=\"sr-only\">A duhet q&#xeb; edhe vler&#xeb;simi n&#xeb; m&#xeb;sime t&#xeb; b&#xeb;het mbi baz&#xeb;n e barazis&#xeb;?</label><textarea id=\"activity-item-4\" data-activity-item=\"item-4\" aria-label=\"A duhet q&#xeb; edhe vler&#xeb;simi n&#xeb; m&#xeb;sime t&#xeb; b&#xeb;het mbi baz&#xeb;n e barazis&#xeb;?\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 h-24 rounded border border-gray-400 bg-white px-3 py-3 resize-none\"></textarea></div></div></div></section></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg035_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg035_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"44\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container opacity-0\"><section data-section-type=\"text_and_images\" data-section-id=\"pg035_sec001\" class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl bg-white px-8 py-8 text-slate-800 max-sm:px-4\">\n  <div class=\"mb-8\">\n    <h1 data-id=\"pg035_n0003\" class=\"adt-h2 mb-2 inline-block border-b-4 border-purple-400 pb-2 font-semibold text-left text-slate-800\">Barazi p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb;</h1>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mb-8 rounded-2xl border border-amber-300 bg-amber-50/40 px-5 py-4 max-sm:px-4 max-sm:py-3\">\n    <p class=\"adt-body text-left leading-relaxed\">\n      <span data-id=\"pg035_n0005\" class=\"mr-3 inline-block rounded-md bg-amber-300 px-3 py-1 font-semibold text-slate-900\">Situata 2.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg035_n0006\">Asnj&#xeb;her&#xeb; nuk e kam par&#xeb; veten t&#xeb; pabarabart&#xeb; me shok&#xeb;t e shoqet, qofshin k&#xeb;ta djem, qofshin vajza.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg035_n0007\" class=\"ml-1\">N&#xeb; familjen ton&#xeb; kjo ndjenj&#xeb; ishte kultivuar q&#xeb; n&#xeb; f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;rin&#xeb; e hershme, ku prind&#xeb;rit nuk na ndanin pun&#xeb;t n&#xeb; pun&#xeb; djemsh apo pun&#xeb; vajzash.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg035_n0008\" class=\"ml-1\">N&#xeb;na dhe babai yn&#xeb; kujdeseshin p&#xeb;r ne pa dallim</span>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mb-10 grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-lg:grid-cols-1 max-lg:gap-6\">\n    <figure class=\"rounded-3xl bg-yellow-50 px-4 pt-4 pb-3 shadow-sm border border-yellow-100 max-sm:px-3 max-sm:pt-3\">\n      <img data-id=\"pg035_im001_seg001_v1\" src=\"images/pg035_im001_seg001_v1.png\" alt=\"Djal&#xeb; duke lar&#xeb; en&#xeb;t n&#xeb; lavaman, me pjata t&#xeb; grumbulluara dhe detergjent pran&#xeb;.\" class=\"block w-full h-auto rounded-2xl\">\n    </figure>\n    <figure class=\"rounded-3xl bg-yellow-50 px-4 pt-4 pb-3 shadow-sm border border-yellow-100 max-sm:px-3 max-sm:pt-3\">\n      <img data-id=\"pg035_im001_seg002_v1\" src=\"images/pg035_im001_seg002_v1.png\" alt=\"Vajz&#xeb; duke mbledhur dhe rregulluar lodrat n&#xeb; nj&#xeb; kuti kartoni.\" class=\"block w-full h-auto rounded-2xl\">\n    </figure>\n  </div>\n\n  <aside class=\"mb-10 rounded-none bg-purple-100 px-5 py-5 shadow-sm max-sm:rounded-3xl max-sm:border max-sm:border-purple-200 max-sm:px-4\">\n    <div class=\"space-y-5\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"adt-body mb-2 text-left leading-relaxed\"><span data-id=\"pg035_n0012\">&#xc7;far&#xeb; kujdesi kan&#xeb; treguar n&#xeb;na dhe babai?</span></p>\n        <label for=\"item-1\" class=\"sr-only\">&#xc7;far&#xeb; kujdesi kan&#xeb; treguar n&#xeb;na dhe babai?</label>\n        <textarea id=\"item-1\" data-activity-item=\"item-1\" aria-label=\"&#xc7;far&#xeb; kujdesi kan&#xeb; treguar n&#xeb;na dhe babai?\" class=\"min-h-11 w-full rounded-2xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-slate-800 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\" rows=\"3\"></textarea>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"adt-body mb-2 text-left leading-relaxed\"><span data-id=\"pg035_n0014\">&#xc7;far&#xeb; t&#xeb; mirash sjell n&#xeb; shoq&#xeb;ri trajtimi n&#xeb; m&#xeb;nyr&#xeb; t&#xeb; barabart&#xeb;?</span></p>\n        <label for=\"item-2\" class=\"sr-only\">&#xc7;far&#xeb; t&#xeb; mirash sjell n&#xeb; shoq&#xeb;ri trajtimi n&#xeb; m&#xeb;nyr&#xeb; t&#xeb; barabart&#xeb;?</label>\n        <textarea id=\"item-2\" data-activity-item=\"item-2\" aria-label=\"&#xc7;far&#xeb; t&#xeb; mirash sjell n&#xeb; shoq&#xeb;ri trajtimi n&#xeb; m&#xeb;nyr&#xeb; t&#xeb; barabart&#xeb;?\" class=\"min-h-11 w-full rounded-2xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-slate-800 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\" rows=\"3\"></textarea>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"adt-body mb-2 text-left leading-relaxed\"><span data-id=\"pg035_n0016\">Po m&#xeb;suesi/ja, si ju trajton n&#xeb; klas&#xeb;?</span></p>\n        <label for=\"item-3\" class=\"sr-only\">Po m&#xeb;suesi/ja, si ju trajton n&#xeb; klas&#xeb;?</label>\n        <textarea id=\"item-3\" data-activity-item=\"item-3\" aria-label=\"Po m&#xeb;suesi/ja, si ju trajton n&#xeb; klas&#xeb;?\" class=\"min-h-11 w-full rounded-2xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-slate-800 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\" rows=\"3\"></textarea>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"adt-body mb-2 text-left leading-relaxed\"><span data-id=\"pg035_n0018\">Tregoni raste n&#xeb;se jeni ndier t&#xeb; paragjykuar dhe jo t&#xeb; barabart&#xeb;.</span></p>\n        <label for=\"item-4\" class=\"sr-only\">Tregoni raste n&#xeb;se jeni ndier t&#xeb; paragjykuar dhe jo t&#xeb; barabart&#xeb;.</label>\n        <textarea id=\"item-4\" data-activity-item=\"item-4\" aria-label=\"Tregoni raste n&#xeb;se jeni ndier t&#xeb; paragjykuar dhe jo t&#xeb; barabart&#xeb;.\" class=\"min-h-11 w-full rounded-2xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-slate-800 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\" rows=\"3\"></textarea>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </aside>\n\n  <div class=\"mb-10 border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-5 py-4 shadow-sm max-sm:px-4\">\n    <p class=\"adt-body text-left italic leading-relaxed text-slate-700\">\n      <span data-id=\"pg035_n0021\">Barazia do t&#xeb; thot&#xeb; q&#xeb; t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; njer&#xeb;zit t&#xeb; trajtohen nj&#xeb;soj dhe t&#xeb; ken&#xeb; t&#xeb; nj&#xeb;jtat t&#xeb; drejta dhe mund&#xeb;si.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg035_n0022\" class=\"ml-1\">Sipas ligjit, vajzat dhe djemt&#xeb; kan&#xeb; t&#xeb; nj&#xeb;jtat t&#xeb; drejta.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg035_n0023\" class=\"ml-1\">Pra, askush nuk duhet t&#xeb; trajtohet m&#xeb; keq ose m&#xeb; mir&#xeb; vet&#xeb;m pse &#xeb;sht&#xeb; vajz&#xeb; apo djal&#xeb;.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg035_n0024\" class=\"ml-1\">Barazia nd&#xeb;rmjet vajzave dhe djemve &#xeb;sht&#xeb; shum&#xeb; e r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sishme p&#xeb;r nj&#xeb; shoq&#xeb;ri t&#xeb; drejt&#xeb;.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg035_n0025\" class=\"ml-1\">Nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;sit duhet t&#xeb; tregohen t&#xeb; kujdessh&#xeb;m dhe t&#xeb; reagojn&#xeb; kur shohin q&#xeb; dikujt po i b&#xeb;het padrejt&#xeb;si.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg035_n0026\" class=\"ml-1\">M&#xeb;suesit duhet t&#x2019;i trajtojn&#xeb; t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;t nj&#xeb;soj, pa dallim.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg035_n0027\" class=\"ml-1\">N&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;, f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;t m&#xeb;sojn&#xeb; t&#xeb; respektojn&#xeb; nj&#xeb;ri-tjetrin dhe t&#xeb; mos b&#xeb;jn&#xeb; dallime p&#xeb;r nga gjinia, ngjyra e l&#xeb;kur&#xeb;s, prejardhja apo kultura.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg035_n0028\" class=\"ml-1\">K&#xeb;shtu, nd&#xeb;rtojm&#xeb; nj&#xeb; shoq&#xeb;ri m&#xeb; t&#xeb; mir&#xeb;, ku t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; ndihen t&#xeb; barabart&#xeb; dhe t&#xeb; respektuar.</span>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"adt-body text-left\">\n    <span data-id=\"pg035_n0030\" class=\"font-semibold\">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e:</span>\n    <span data-id=\"pg035_n0031\" class=\"ml-1\">barazi, marr&#xeb;dh&#xeb;nie, diskriminim, respekt.</span>\n  </div>\n</section></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg036_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg036_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"45\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container opacity-0\">\n  <section data-section-type=\"text_and_single_image\" data-section-id=\"pg036_sec001\" class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 py-8 bg-white text-zinc-800\">\n    <div class=\"mb-8 overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-purple-200 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-500 via-purple-400 to-purple-300 shadow-sm\">\n      <div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-5xl items-center gap-4 px-8 py-5 max-sm:px-5\">\n        <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex h-20 w-20 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-white/20 text-white\">&#x1f91d;</div>\n        <div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\">\n          <h1 data-id=\"pg036_n0003\" class=\"adt-h2 font-semibold text-left text-white\">Toleranca dhe miq&#xeb;sia</h1>\n          <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-3 h-1 w-40 rounded-full bg-white/70\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mb-8 rounded-3xl bg-green-50 p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-green-100\">\n      <h3 data-id=\"pg036_n0005\" class=\"adt-h3 mb-4 inline-block rounded-xl bg-green-400 px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-left text-zinc-900\">Situata 1.</h3>\n      <p class=\"adt-body text-left leading-relaxed\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg036_n0007\">Vjosa vazhdonte klas&#xeb;n e kat&#xeb;rt, por pasi m&#xeb;simi ishte online, kishte v&#xeb;shtir&#xeb;si: kishte probleme me shikim dhe nuk i kishte pajisjet e nevojshme p&#xeb;r m&#xeb;sim online.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg036_n0008\">Edhe v&#xeb;llai i shokut t&#xeb; saj t&#xeb; klas&#xeb;s, Shpatit, kishte t&#xeb; nj&#xeb;jtat v&#xeb;shtir&#xeb;si.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg036_n0009\">Sa e admironte Shpati vullnetin e tij p&#xeb;r m&#xeb;sime.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg036_n0010\">Ai kishte dit&#xeb; q&#xeb; nuk e shihte Vjos&#xeb;n n&#xeb; m&#xeb;sim.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg036_n0011\">Ai bisedoi me v&#xeb;llan&#xeb; e madh, duke i th&#xeb;n&#xeb; se, meqen&#xeb;se prind&#xeb;rit i kishin bler&#xeb; nj&#xeb; pajisje t&#xeb; re p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; lexuar, t&#x2019;ia falte pajisjen e tij t&#xeb; vjet&#xeb;r Vjos&#xeb;s.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg036_n0012\">Ai pranoi me shum&#xeb; k&#xeb;naq&#xeb;si, pasi mendoi se kjo do ta ndihmonte Vjos&#xeb;n q&#xeb; t&#xeb; lexonte, duke qen&#xeb; se pajisja zmadhonte shkronjat n&#xeb; ekran.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg036_n0013\">Vjosa me siguri do t&#xeb; g&#xeb;zohej dhe do t&#xeb; ishte fal&#xeb;nderuese ndaj Shpatit.</span>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mb-8 overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] bg-gradient-to-b from-green-50 to-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-zinc-100\">\n      <img data-id=\"pg036_im001\" src=\"images/pg036_im001.png\" alt=\"Djaloshi me syze ia jep nj&#xeb; lup&#xeb; nj&#xeb; djali m&#xeb; t&#xeb; vog&#xeb;l p&#xeb;r ta ndihmuar t&#xeb; shoh&#xeb; dhe t&#xeb; lexoj&#xeb; m&#xeb; mir&#xeb;.\" class=\"block w-full h-auto\">\n    </div>\n\n    <aside class=\"mb-10 rounded-3xl bg-purple-100 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-purple-200 overflow-hidden\">\n      <div class=\"flex max-lg:flex-col\">\n        <div class=\"flex w-28 shrink-0 items-center justify-center bg-purple-500 p-6 max-lg:w-full\">\n          <div data-id=\"pg036_n0015\" class=\"adt-h3 z-10 font-bold text-white\">?</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex-1 p-6\">\n          <div class=\"space-y-5\">\n            <div class=\"rounded-2xl bg-white/70 p-4\">\n              <p class=\"adt-body text-left\"><span data-id=\"pg036_n0018\">Si i ndihmoni shoqet/shok&#xeb;t n&#xeb; nevoj&#xeb;?</span></p>\n              <label for=\"item-1\" class=\"sr-only\">Si i ndihmoni shoqet/shok&#xeb;t n&#xeb; nevoj&#xeb;?</label>\n              <textarea id=\"item-1\" data-activity-item=\"item-1\" aria-label=\"Si i ndihmoni shoqet/shok&#xeb;t n&#xeb; nevoj&#xeb;?\" class=\"mt-3 min-h-11 w-full rounded-xl border border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 