dhe nuk na p&#xeb;rsh&#xeb;ndeti si zakonisht.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg036_n0027\">Dukej i m&#xeb;rzitur dhe i lodhur, por nuk foli</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg036_n0028\">Jeta e ngacmoi me stilolaps nga pas.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg036_n0029\">Ai befas thirri:</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg036_n0030\">- &#xc7;far&#xeb; b&#xeb;n? Mos m&#xeb; ngacmo</span>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg037_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg037_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"46\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container opacity-0\"><section data-section-type=\"text_and_single_image\" data-section-id=\"pg037_sec001\" class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl bg-white px-8 py-8 text-zinc-800 max-sm:px-4\">\n  <div class=\"mb-5\">\n    <h1 class=\"adt-h2 mb-3 text-left font-semibold\" data-id=\"pg037_n0003\">Toleranca dhe miq&#xeb;sia</h1>\n    <div class=\"h-1 w-full bg-violet-400\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mb-6 rounded-[2rem] bg-amber-100 p-3 shadow-sm\">\n    <img data-id=\"pg037_im001_crop_v1\" src=\"images/pg037_im001_crop_v1.png\" alt=\"Dy nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;s t&#xeb; ulur n&#xeb; banka; vajza flet me laps n&#xeb; dor&#xeb;, nd&#xeb;rsa djali duket i m&#xeb;rzitur dhe i menduar.\" class=\"h-auto w-full rounded-[1.6rem] bg-white\">\n  </div>\n\n  <aside class=\"mb-10 bg-violet-200 px-4 py-5 max-sm:px-3\">\n    <ul class=\"space-y-4\">\n      <li>\n        <div class=\"adt-body text-left\"><span data-id=\"pg037_n0007\">A ishte i drejt&#xeb; veprimi i Jet&#xeb;s? Pse?</span></div>\n        <label for=\"item-1\" class=\"sr-only\">A ishte i drejt&#xeb; veprimi i Jet&#xeb;s? Pse?</label>\n        <textarea id=\"item-1\" data-activity-item=\"item-1\" aria-label=\"A ishte i drejt&#xeb; veprimi i Jet&#xeb;s? Pse?\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-11 w-full rounded-xl border-2 border-violet-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-violet-500\"></textarea>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <div class=\"adt-body text-left\"><span data-id=\"pg037_n0009\">Po reagimi i shokut? Pse?</span></div>\n        <label for=\"item-2\" class=\"sr-only\">Po reagimi i shokut? Pse?</label>\n        <textarea id=\"item-2\" data-activity-item=\"item-2\" aria-label=\"Po reagimi i shokut? Pse?\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-11 w-full rounded-xl border-2 border-violet-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-violet-500\"></textarea>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <div class=\"adt-body text-left\"><span data-id=\"pg037_n0011\">A jeni gjendur n&#xeb; nj&#xeb; situat&#xeb; t&#xeb; till&#xeb;?</span></div>\n        <label for=\"item-3\" class=\"sr-only\">A jeni gjendur n&#xeb; nj&#xeb; situat&#xeb; t&#xeb; till&#xeb;?</label>\n        <textarea id=\"item-3\" data-activity-item=\"item-3\" aria-label=\"A jeni gjendur n&#xeb; nj&#xeb; situat&#xeb; t&#xeb; till&#xeb;?\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-11 w-full rounded-xl border-2 border-violet-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-violet-500\"></textarea>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <div class=\"adt-body text-left\"><span data-id=\"pg037_n0013\">Si keni vepruar?</span></div>\n        <label for=\"item-4\" class=\"sr-only\">Si keni vepruar?</label>\n        <textarea id=\"item-4\" data-activity-item=\"item-4\" aria-label=\"Si keni vepruar?\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-11 w-full rounded-xl border-2 border-violet-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-violet-500\"></textarea>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n  </aside>\n\n  <div class=\"mb-8 border-2 border-violet-300 bg-white px-5 py-4 shadow-sm\">\n    <p class=\"adt-body text-left italic leading-relaxed\">\n      <span data-id=\"pg037_n0016\">T&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; jemi t&#xeb; barabart&#xeb;, prandaj duhet ta respektojm&#xeb; nj&#xeb;ri-tjetrin.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg037_n0017\">Kjo arrihet n&#xeb;p&#xeb;rmjet toleranc&#xeb;s.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg037_n0018\">T&#xeb; jesh tolerant do t&#xeb; thot&#xeb; ta vler&#xeb;sosh dhe ta pranosh tjetrin p&#xeb;r at&#xeb; q&#xeb; &#xeb;sht&#xeb;, pa e paragjykuar dhe pa e diskriminuar.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg037_n0019\">Toleranca sh&#xeb;rben p&#xeb;r vendosjen e paqes mes grupeve t&#xeb; ndryshme shoq&#xeb;rore, pasi pranon edhe di&#xe7;ka q&#xeb; nuk t&#xeb; p&#xeb;lqen.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg037_n0020\">Toleranca krijon mund&#xeb;sin&#xeb; e mir&#xeb;kuptimit dhe t&#xeb; bashk&#xeb;punimit mes njer&#xeb;zve.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg037_n0021\">Ne krijojm&#xeb; shoq&#xeb;ri me shum&#xeb; njer&#xeb;z n&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb; dhe n&#xeb; komunitet.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg037_n0022\">Me disa q&#xeb; i njohim m&#xeb; mir&#xeb; dhe kemi nj&#xeb; lidhje m&#xeb; t&#xeb; ngusht&#xeb;, krijojm&#xeb; miq&#xeb;si.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg037_n0023\">Miq&#xeb;sia &#xeb;sht&#xeb; lidhja m&#xeb; e gjat&#xeb; dhe m&#xeb; e r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sishme me tjetrin.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg037_n0024\">Ajo na v&#xeb; p&#xeb;rpara disa detyrave ndaj t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;ve.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg037_n0025\">Miq&#xeb;sia karakterizohet nga dashuria, besimi, ndershm&#xeb;ria, respekti, toleranca etj.</span>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <aside class=\"mb-8 bg-amber-100 px-5 py-4 shadow-sm\">\n    <h3 class=\"adt-h3 mb-3 text-left font-semibold\" data-id=\"pg037_n0027\">K&#xeb;shilla:</h3>\n    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-left\">\n      <li class=\"adt-body flex items-start gap-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">&#x2013;</span><span data-id=\"pg037_n0030\">Toleranca t&#xeb; m&#xeb;son t&#xeb; vler&#xeb;sosh njer&#xeb;zit q&#xeb; jan&#xeb; ndryshe nga ti, ndryshe n&#xeb; dukje, n&#xeb; bindje, n&#xeb; prejardhje etj.</span></li>\n      <li class=\"adt-body flex items-start gap-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">&#x2013;</span><span data-id=\"pg037_n0032\">Toleranca t&#xeb; m&#xeb;son t&#xeb; pranosh mendimin e tjetrit, edhe kur nuk &#xeb;sht&#xeb; i nj&#xeb;jt&#xeb; me mendimin t&#xeb;nd.</span></li>\n      <li class=\"adt-body flex items-start gap-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">&#x2013;</span><span data-id=\"pg037_n0034\">Toleranca krijon mund&#xeb;si dhe ura komunikimi.</span></li>\n      <li class=\"adt-body flex items-start gap-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">&#x2013;</span><span data-id=\"pg037_n0036\">Toleranca krijon hap&#xeb;sira p&#xeb;r nj&#xeb;ri-tjetrin.</span></li>\n      <li class=\"adt-body flex items-start gap-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">&#x2013;</span><span data-id=\"pg037_n0038\">Toleranca shmang mosmarr&#xeb;veshjet dhe keqkuptimet dhe nxit bashk&#xeb;punimin.</span></li>\n    </ul>\n  </aside>\n\n  <p class=\"adt-body text-left font-medium\"><span data-id=\"pg037_n0039\">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e: toleranc&#xeb;, miq&#xeb;si, mosmarr&#xeb;veshje, pranim.</span></p>\n</section></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg038_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg038_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"47\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div class=\"container mx-auto max-w-5xl bg-white rounded-lg px-24 max-lg:px-12 max-sm:px-6 pt-12 pb-12 opacity-0\" id=\"content\"><section data-section-type=\"activity_fill_in_the_blank\" data-section-id=\"pg038_sec001\" role=\"region\" class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"mb-10\"><div class=\"h-4 bg-purple-400 w-full mb-4\"></div><h1 class=\"adt-h2 text-left text-gray-900 border-b-4 border-purple-400 pb-3 inline-block\" data-id=\"pg038_n0003\">Mb&#xeb;shtesim nj&#xeb;ri-tjetrin</h1></div><div class=\"mb-8\"><h3 class=\"adt-h3 mb-5\"><span class=\"inline-block bg-green-400/80 text-gray-900 px-5 py-2\" data-id=\"pg038_n0004\">Situata 1.</span></h3><p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed text-left text-gray-900\"><span data-id=\"pg038_n0006\">N&#xeb; familje gjithkush jep kontributin e vet.</span> <span data-id=\"pg038_n0007\">Disa nga pjes&#xeb;tar&#xeb;t e familjes japin edhe kontribut financiar.</span> <span data-id=\"pg038_n0008\">V&#xeb;llai im i madh punon n&#xeb; nj&#xeb; televizion dhe paguhet sipas or&#xeb;ve q&#xeb; punon.</span> <span data-id=\"pg038_n0009\">Muajin e kaluar, ai ishte i ngarkuar me lyerjen e sht&#xeb;pis&#xeb; dhe pothuajse nuk punoi.</span> <span data-id=\"pg038_n0010\">E kuptova edhe nga frutat e zakonshme q&#xeb; m&#xeb; munguan.</span> <span data-id=\"pg038_n0011\">Kur ai paguhej, m&#xeb; blinte frutat e preferuara.</span> <span data-id=\"pg038_n0012\">Ndihej n&#xeb; siklet q&#xeb; nuk m&#x2019;i bleu, nd&#xeb;rkoh&#xeb; un&#xeb; b&#xeb;ra sikur harrova.</span> <span data-id=\"pg038_n0013\">N&#xeb; mbr&#xeb;mje n&#xeb;na erdhi n&#xeb; sht&#xeb;pi me disa fruta dhe nj&#xeb; &#xeb;mb&#xeb;lsir&#xeb; t&#xeb; madhe.</span> <span data-id=\"pg038_n0014\">&quot;K&#xeb;to i keni nga un&#xeb; sot&quot;, - tha duke buz&#xeb;qeshur.</span></p></div><div class=\"mb-0\"><img src=\"images/pg038_im001_crop_v1.png\" alt=\"N&#xeb; kuzhin&#xeb;, n&#xeb;na mban nj&#xeb; pjat&#xeb; me tort&#xeb;, vajza po merr nj&#xeb; cop&#xeb;, nd&#xeb;rsa v&#xeb;llai i madh q&#xeb;ndron pran&#xeb;; sken&#xeb; e mb&#xeb;shtetjes dhe ndarjes n&#xeb; familje.\" data-id=\"pg038_im001_crop_v1\" class=\"w-full h-auto mx-auto shadow-md\"></div><div class=\"bg-purple-200 mt-0 p-6 max-sm:p-4\"><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div><label for=\"activity-item-1\" class=\"block adt-body text-gray-900 mb-2\"><span data-id=\"pg038_n0016\">A kontribuuan t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; n&#xeb; familje?</span></label><textarea id=\"activity-item-1\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 h-24 rounded-xl border border-gray-400 bg-white/70 px-4 py-3 resize-none\" data-activity-item=\"item-1\" aria-label=\"A kontribuuan t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; n&#xeb; familje?\"></textarea></div><div><label for=\"activity-item-2\" class=\"block adt-body text-gray-900 mb-2\"><span data-id=\"pg038_n0017\">Cil&#xeb;t kontribuuan financiarisht?</span></label><textarea id=\"activity-item-2\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 h-24 rounded-xl border border-gray-400 bg-white/70 px-4 py-3 resize-none\" data-activity-item=\"item-2\" aria-label=\"Cil&#xeb;t kontribuuan financiarisht?\"></textarea></div><div><label for=\"activity-item-3\" class=\"block adt-body text-gray-900 mb-2\"><span data-id=\"pg038_n0018\">Po v&#xeb;llai i madh, si kontribuoi?</span></label><textarea id=\"activity-item-3\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 h-24 rounded-xl border border-gray-400 bg-white/70 px-4 py-3 resize-none\" data-activity-item=\"item-3\" aria-label=\"Po v&#xeb;llai i madh, si kontribuoi?\"></textarea></div></div></div></section></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{\"item-1\":\"pg038_sec001_ans_item-1\",\"item-2\":\"pg038_sec001_ans_item-2\",\"item-3\":\"pg038_sec001_ans_item-3\"}');\n    </script>\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.correctAnswers = JSON.parse('{\"item-1\":\"Po, të gjithë kontribuuan në familje.\",\"item-2\":\"Financiarisht kontribuuan nëna dhe vëllai i madh.\",\"item-3\":\"Vëllai i madh kontribuoi duke punuar në televizion dhe, kur paguhej, blinte frutat e mia të preferuara.\"}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg039_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg039_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"48\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container bg-white opacity-0\">\n  <section data-section-type=\"text_and_single_image\" data-section-id=\"pg039_sec001\" class=\"w-full overflow-hidden\">\n    <div class=\"w-full bg-white\">\n      <div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-4 pt-8 pb-4\">\n        <div class=\"relative\">\n          <div class=\"h-12 w-full bg-purple-500\"></div>\n          <div class=\"pt-5\">\n            <h1 data-id=\"pg039_n0004\" class=\"adt-h2 text-left font-bold text-gray-900 inline-block border-b-4 border-purple-400 pb-2\">Mb&#xeb;shtesim nj&#xeb;ri-tjetrin</h1>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-4 pb-8 space-y-6\">\n      <div class=\"bg-white rounded-[2rem] border border-purple-100 shadow-sm px-6 py-6 max-sm:px-4 max-sm:py-4\">\n        <div class=\"mb-3\">\n          <h3 data-id=\"pg039_n0006\" class=\"adt-h3 inline-block text-left font-bold text-gray-900 bg-yellow-300 px-4 py-2 leading-none\">Situata 2.</h3>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-gray-800 leading-relaxed\">\n          <span data-id=\"pg039_n0007\">Genti ishte nj&#xeb; lojtar futbolli shum&#xeb; i mir&#xeb;.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg039_n0008\">Ai st&#xeb;rvitej vazhdimisht me skuadr&#xeb;n e tij.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg039_n0009\">Shpesh, skuadra ishte fituese n&#xeb; kampionatet mes shkollave.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg039_n0010\">N&#xeb; kampionatin e radh&#xeb;s, skuadra e futbollit ku Genti ishte lojtar kishte v&#xeb;shtir&#xeb;si p&#xeb;r organizimin e loj&#xeb;s.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg039_n0011\">Ai mendoi t&apos;i k&#xeb;rkonte ndihm&#xeb; shokut t&#xeb; tij t&#xeb; f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;ris&#xeb;, i cili luante po aq mir&#xeb; sa Genti.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg039_n0012\">T&#xeb; dy s&#xeb; bashku do t&#xeb; ishin nj&#xeb; skuad&#xeb;r e fort&#xeb;</span>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"rounded-[2rem] overflow-hidden bg-white border border-amber-100 shadow-sm\">\n        <img data-id=\"pg039_im001_crop_v1\" src=\"images/pg039_im001_crop_v1.png\" alt=\"Dy djem bisedojn&#xeb; p&#xeb;rkrah nj&#xeb; topi futbolli, duke treguar mb&#xeb;shtetje dhe bashk&#xeb;punim mes shok&#xeb;ve.\" class=\"w-full h-auto block min-h-[260px] object-contain max-sm:min-h-0\">\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bg-purple-100 border border-purple-200 rounded-none px-6 py-5 max-sm:px-4 max-sm:py-4\">\n        <ul class=\"space-y-5 max-sm:space-y-4\">\n          <li class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n            <div class=\"adt-body text-left text-gray-900 flex items-start gap-2\">\n              <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-1 text-purple-700\">&#x2013;</span>\n              <span data-id=\"pg039_n0016\">Vazhdoje tregimin duke menduar nj&#xeb; zgjidhje p&#xeb;r t&#xeb;.</span>\n            </div>\n            <label for=\"item-1\" class=\"sr-only\">Vazhdoje tregimin duke menduar nj&#xeb; zgjidhje p&#xeb;r t&#xeb;.</label>\n            <textarea id=\"item-1\" data-activity-item=\"item-1\" aria-label=\"Vazhdoje tregimin duke menduar nj&#xeb; zgjidhje p&#xeb;r t&#xeb;.\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 rounded-2xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-gray-900 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\" rows=\"4\"></textarea>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n            <div class=\"adt-body text-left text-gray-900 flex items-start gap-2\">\n              <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-1 text-purple-700\">&#x2013;</span>\n              <span data-id=\"pg039_n0018\">Si e mb&#xeb;shtet ti shokun apo shoqen t&#xeb;nde?</span>\n            </div>\n            <label for=\"item-2\" class=\"sr-only\">Si e mb&#xeb;shtet ti shokun apo shoqen t&#xeb;nde?</label>\n            <textarea id=\"item-2\" data-activity-item=\"item-2\" aria-label=\"Si e mb&#xeb;shtet ti shokun apo shoqen t&#xeb;nde?\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 rounded-2xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-gray-900 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\" rows=\"3\"></textarea>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n            <div class=\"adt-body text-left text-gray-900 flex items-start gap-2\">\n              <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-1 text-purple-700\">&#x2013;</span>\n              <span data-id=\"pg039_n0020\">Si e mb&#xeb;shtet motr&#xeb;n apo v&#xeb;llan&#xeb;?</span>\n            </div>\n            <label for=\"item-3\" class=\"sr-only\">Si e mb&#xeb;shtet motr&#xeb;n apo v&#xeb;llan&#xeb;?</label>\n            <textarea id=\"item-3\" data-activity-item=\"item-3\" aria-label=\"Si e mb&#xeb;shtet motr&#xeb;n apo v&#xeb;llan&#xeb;?\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 rounded-2xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-gray-900 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\" rows=\"3\"></textarea>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n            <div class=\"adt-body text-left text-gray-900 flex items-start gap-2\">\n              <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-1 text-purple-700\">&#x2013;</span>\n              <span data-id=\"pg039_n0022\">&#xc7;far&#xeb; b&#xeb;n p&#xeb;r t&apos;u ndier mir&#xeb; shoqja apo shoku yt?</span>\n            </div>\n            <label for=\"item-4\" class=\"sr-only\">&#xc7;far&#xeb; b&#xeb;n p&#xeb;r t&apos;u ndier mir&#xeb; shoqja apo shoku yt?</label>\n            <textarea id=\"item-4\" data-activity-item=\"item-4\" aria-label=\"&#xc7;far&#xeb; b&#xeb;n p&#xeb;r t&apos;u ndier mir&#xeb; shoqja apo shoku yt?\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 rounded-2xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-gray-900 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\" rows=\"3\"></textarea>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n            <div class=\"adt-body text-left text-gray-900 flex items-start gap-2\">\n              <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-1 text-purple-700\">&#x2013;</span>\n              <span>\n                <span data-id=\"pg039_n0024\">Si ndihesh n&#xeb; nj&#xeb; rast kur shoqja apo shoku yt arrin sukses?</span>\n                <span data-id=\"pg039_n0025\">Po kur ai ndodhet n&#xeb; v&#xeb;shtir&#xeb;si?</span>\n              </span>\n            </div>\n            <label for=\"item-5\" class=\"sr-only\">Si ndihesh n&#xeb; nj&#xeb; rast kur shoqja apo shoku yt arrin sukses? Po kur ai ndodhet n&#xeb; v&#xeb;shtir&#xeb;si?</label>\n            <textarea id=\"item-5\" data-activity-item=\"item-5\" aria-label=\"Si ndihesh n&#xeb; nj&#xeb; rast kur shoqja apo shoku yt arrin sukses? Po kur ai ndodhet n&#xeb; v&#xeb;shtir&#xeb;si?\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 rounded-2xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-gray-900 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\" rows=\"3\"></textarea>\n          </li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bg-white border-2 border-purple-300 px-6 py-5 max-sm:px-4 max-sm:py-4 shadow-sm\">\n        <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-gray-800 leading-relaxed italic\">\n          <span data-id=\"pg039_n0028\">Njer&#xeb;zit formojn&#xeb; grupe shoq&#xeb;rore q&#xeb; jan&#xeb; pjes&#xeb; p&#xeb;rb&#xeb;r&#xeb;se e shoq&#xeb;ris&#xeb;.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg039_n0029\">Edhe pse jemi t&#xeb; pavarur, ne kemi nevoj&#xeb; p&#xeb;r ndihm&#xeb;n dhe mb&#xeb;shtetjen e nj&#xeb;ri-tjetrit.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg039_n0030\">Kjo e b&#xeb;n nj&#xeb; grup t&#xeb; vlefsh&#xeb;m dhe t&#xeb; fort&#xeb;.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg039_n0031\">Nj&#xeb; individ mund t&#xeb; marr&#xeb; pjes&#xeb; n&#xeb; m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; se nj&#xeb; grup.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg039_n0032\">Ai ka dhe aft&#xeb;si t&#xeb; ve&#xe7;anta q&#xeb; e b&#xeb;jn&#xeb; at&#xeb; pjes&#xeb; t&#xeb; grupeve t&#xeb; caktuara.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg039_n0033\">N&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;, &#xe7;do nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;s duhet t&#xeb; ndihet i mir&#xeb;pritur dhe i p&#xeb;rfshir&#xeb; n&#xeb; procesin m&#xeb;simor, duke u mb&#xeb;shtetur kur ka v&#xeb;shtir&#xeb;si.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg039_n0034\">N&#xeb; familje ne ndihmojm&#xeb; nj&#xeb;ri-tjetrin p&#xeb;r zgjidhjen e problemeve t&#xeb; ndryshme.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg039_n0035\">Kur ka bashk&#xeb;punim n&#xeb; familje, shkoll&#xeb; dhe komunitet, pun&#xeb;t shkojn&#xeb; m&#xeb; mir&#xeb;.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg039_n0036\">T&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; duhet t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rfshihen n&#xeb; veprimtari t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rbashk&#xeb;ta, pasi kjo rrit bashk&#xeb;punimin dhe forcon miq&#xeb;sin&#xeb;.</span>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"px-2 pt-1\">\n        <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-gray-900 font-medium\">\n          <span data-id=\"pg039_n0038\">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e:</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg039_n0039\">mb&#xeb;shtetje, interes, grup, individ, miq&#xeb;si.</span>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n  