4 h-14 rounded-full bg-white relative -ml-4 border-4 border-purple-500\">\n              <div class=\"absolute top-6 left-5 flex gap-1\">\n                <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-purple-400 rounded-full\"></span>\n                <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-purple-400 rounded-full\"></span>\n                <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-purple-400 rounded-full\"></span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"absolute -bottom-2 right-3 w-0 h-0 border-t-[12px] border-t-white border-l-[10px] border-l-transparent\"></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex-1 pt-6 max-sm:pt-0\">\n          <div class=\"bg-purple-500 text-white px-4 py-3\">\n            <h1 class=\"adt-h2 font-bold leading-tight\"><span data-id=\"pg044_n0002\">Mendime t&#xeb; ndryshme, vendime t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rbashk&#xeb;ta</span></h1>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"px-2 pt-3 border-b-4 border-purple-400 max-w-[30rem] max-sm:max-w-full\">\n            <h2 class=\"adt-h2 text-gray-900 font-normal pb-2\"><span data-id=\"pg044_n0004\">Respektoj mendimin e tjetrit</span></h2>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mb-10\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-start gap-5 max-sm:block mb-4\">\n        <div class=\"bg-green-500 text-gray-900 px-4 py-1 min-w-[10rem] text-right max-sm:inline-block max-sm:mb-3\">\n          <h3 class=\"adt-h3 font-normal\"><span data-id=\"pg044_n0006\">Situata 1.</span></h3>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex-1 adt-body leading-relaxed text-gray-900 space-y-1\">\n          <p>\n            <span data-id=\"pg044_n0008\">Sa her&#xeb; jemi gjendur p&#xeb;rball&#xeb; situatave t&#xeb; tilla</span>\n            <span data-id=\"pg044_n0009\">Shkaku ishte propozimi i m&#xeb;sueses p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; organizuar nj&#xeb; udh&#xeb;tim drejt qendrave historike e kulturore.</span>\n            <span data-id=\"pg044_n0010\">Dritani zgjodhi Kruj&#xeb;n, si vendin ku do t&#xeb; njihej me historin&#xeb; e Sk&#xeb;nderbeut, muzeun, rrug&#xeb;t e rrugicat e bukura t&#xeb; qytetit</span>\n            <span data-id=\"pg044_n0011\">Blerta u shpreh se e kishte vizituar.</span>\n            <span data-id=\"pg044_n0012\">I p&#xeb;lqente m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; Prizreni.</span>\n            <span data-id=\"pg044_n0013\">Aty zinte fill historia e Lidhjes s&#xeb; Prizrenit dhe e figurave t&#xeb; shquara t&#xeb; historis&#xeb; s&#xeb; shqiptar&#xeb;ve brenda e jasht&#xeb; trojeve</span>\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"mb-4\">\n        <img data-id=\"pg044_im002\" src=\"images/pg044_im002.png\" alt=\"M&#xeb;suesja q&#xeb;ndron mes dy nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;sve n&#xeb; banka dhe i nxit t&#xeb; shprehin mendime t&#xeb; ndryshme, me flluska mendimi mbi ta.\" class=\"w-full h-auto block\">\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 items-start max-sm:grid-cols-1 mb-8\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\">\n          <div class=\"w-full bg-white rounded-full px-3 py-2 text-center shadow-sm border border-gray-100\">\n            <span data-id=\"pg044_n0015\" class=\"adt-caption font-semibold text-gray-800\">Situata 1.</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\">\n          <img data-id=\"pg044_im003_crop_v1\" src=\"images/pg044_im003_crop_v1.png\" alt=\"Kalaja e Kruj&#xeb;s me flamurin shqiptar mbi nd&#xeb;rtesat historike dhe malet n&#xeb; sfond.\" class=\"w-full h-auto block rounded-md shadow-sm\">\n          <div class=\"mt-2 text-center\">\n            <span data-id=\"pg044_n0017\" class=\"adt-caption text-gray-900\">Kruja</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\">\n          <img data-id=\"pg044_im004_crop_v1\" src=\"images/pg044_im004_crop_v1.png\" alt=\"Monumenti i Sk&#xeb;nderbeut mbi kal&#xeb; pran&#xeb; nj&#xeb; flamuri t&#xeb; madh shqiptar, me male n&#xeb; sfond.\" class=\"w-full h-auto block rounded-md shadow-sm\">\n          <div class=\"mt-2 text-center\">\n            <span data-id=\"pg044_n0019\" class=\"adt-caption text-gray-900\">Prizreni / Sk&#xeb;nderbeu</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bg-purple-100 max-sm:bg-purple-50 p-4 pl-0 max-sm:pl-4\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-start max-sm:block\">\n          <div class=\"bg-purple-500 text-white w-28 min-h-20 flex items-center justify-center mr-4 max-sm:w-full max-sm:min-h-14 max-sm:mb-4 rounded-r-md max-sm:rounded-md\">\n            <span class=\"text-5xl leading-none font-bold\" aria-hidden=\"true\">?</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex-1 space-y-6\">\n            <div>\n              <p class=\"adt-body text-gray-900\"><span data-id=\"pg044_n0022\">Vazhdoni situat&#xeb;n, duke propozuar zgjidhje t&#xeb; tjera.</span></p>\n              <label for=\"activity-item-1\" class=\"sr-only\">Vazhdoni situat&#xeb;n, duke propozuar zgjidhje t&#xeb; tjera.</label>\n              <textarea id=\"activity-item-1\" data-activity-item=\"item-1\" aria-label=\"Vazhdoni situat&#xeb;n, duke propozuar zgjidhje t&#xeb; tjera.\" class=\"mt-2 w-full min-h-32 max-sm:min-h-28 rounded-md border border-purple-200 bg-white px-3 py-3 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-300\"></textarea>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <p class=\"adt-body text-gray-900\"><span data-id=\"pg044_n0024\">Listoni argumente ku t&#xeb; mb&#xeb;shtesni zgjedhjet tuaja.</span></p>\n              <label for=\"activity-item-2\" class=\"sr-only\">Listoni argumente ku t&#xeb; mb&#xeb;shtesni zgjedhjet tuaja.</label>\n              <textarea id=\"activity-item-2\" data-activity-item=\"item-2\" aria-label=\"Listoni argumente ku t&#xeb; mb&#xeb;shtesni zgjedhjet tuaja.\" class=\"mt-2 w-full min-h-32 max-sm:min-h-28 rounded-md border border-purple-200 bg-white px-3 py-3 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-300\"></textarea>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <p class=\"adt-body text-gray-900\"><span data-id=\"pg044_n0026\">N&#xeb; cil&#xeb;n m&#xeb;nyr&#xeb; mendoni se e respektoni mendimin e tjetrit?</span></p>\n              <label for=\"activity-item-3\" class=\"sr-only\">N&#xeb; cil&#xeb;n m&#xeb;nyr&#xeb; mendoni se e respektoni mendimin e tjetrit?</label>\n              <textarea id=\"activity-item-3\" data-activity-item=\"item-3\" aria-label=\"N&#xeb; cil&#xeb;n m&#xeb;nyr&#xeb; mendoni se e respektoni mendimin e tjetrit?\" class=\"mt-2 w-full min-h-32 max-sm:min-h-28 rounded-md border border-purple-200 bg-white px-3 py-3 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-300\"></textarea>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"flex items-start gap-5 max-sm:block mb-3\">\n        <div class=\"bg-yellow-300 text-gray-900 px-4 py-1 min-w-[10rem] text-right max-sm:inline-block max-sm:mb-3\">\n          <h3 class=\"adt-h3 font-normal\"><span data-id=\"pg044_n0027\">Situata 2.</span></h3>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex-1 adt-body leading-relaxed text-gray-900\">\n          <p>\n            <span data-id=\"pg044_n0029\">Shpesh, me prind&#xeb;rit diskutojm&#xeb; p&#xeb;r gj&#xeb;ra t&#xeb; ndryshme n&#xeb; familje, p.sh.:</span>\n            <span data-id=\"pg044_n0030\">si mund t&#x2019;i ndihmojm&#xeb; ata t&apos;i kalojn&#xeb; shqet&#xeb;simet q&#xeb; lidhen me pun&#xeb;t e sht&#xeb;pis&#xeb; ose kujdesin p&#xeb;r gjysh&#xeb;rit.</span>\n            <span data-id=\"pg044_n0031\">V&#xeb;llai i madh punon, pothuajse, gjith&#xeb; dit&#xeb;n dhe shpeshher&#xeb; nuk &#xeb;sht&#xeb; i pranish&#xeb;m n&#xeb; diskutimet tona</span>\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pl-[11.25rem] max-sm:pl-0\">\n        <label for=\"activity-item-4\" class=\"sr-only\">P&#xeb;rgjigjja p&#xeb;r Situata 2</label>\n        <textarea id=\"activity-item-4\" data-activity-item=\"item-4\" aria-label=\"P&#xeb;rgjigjja p&#xeb;r Situata 2\" class=\"w-full min-h-32 max-sm:min-h-28 rounded-md border border-yellow-300 bg-yellow-50 px-3 py-3 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-yellow-300\"></textarea>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg045_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg045_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"54\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container opacity-0\">\n  <section data-section-type=\"text_and_single_image\" data-section-id=\"pg045_sec001\" class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl bg-white px-8 py-8 text-zinc-800 max-sm:px-5\">\n    <div class=\"mb-6\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-stretch max-sm:flex-col\">\n        <div class=\"flex-1 bg-purple-500 px-8 py-5 text-white max-sm:px-5 max-sm:py-4\">\n          <h1 class=\"adt-h3 font-bold text-white\" data-id=\"pg045_n0002\">Mendime t&#xeb; ndryshme, vendime t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rbashk&#xeb;ta</h1>\n          <h2 class=\"adt-h2 mt-3 inline-block border-b-4 border-purple-300 pb-2 font-medium text-zinc-900\" data-id=\"pg045_n0003\">Respektoj mendimin e tjetrit</h2>\n        </div>\n        <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex w-36 shrink-0 items-center justify-center bg-purple-500 max-lg:w-28 max-sm:mt-0 max-sm:w-full max-sm:justify-start max-sm:px-5 max-sm:py-3\">\n          <div class=\"flex h-24 w-24 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-purple-400 shadow-sm max-lg:h-20 max-lg:w-20\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-white\">&#x1f4ac;</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mb-8\">\n      <img data-id=\"pg045_im001\" src=\"images/pg045_im001.png\" alt=\"Familja e ulur rreth tryez&#xeb;s bisedon dhe d&#xeb;gjon mendimet e nj&#xeb;ri-tjetrit.\" class=\"mx-auto w-full h-auto object-contain\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mb-10 bg-purple-100 px-4 py-4 max-sm:px-4 max-sm:py-4\">\n      <div class=\"space-y-5\">\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-zinc-900\"><span data-id=\"pg045_n0006\">- Si mendoni ta p&#xeb;rfshini edhe v&#xeb;llan&#xeb; m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; n&#xeb; diskutimet tuaja?</span></p>\n          <label for=\"item-1\" class=\"sr-only\">- Si mendoni ta p&#xeb;rfshini edhe v&#xeb;llan&#xeb; m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; n&#xeb; n&#xeb; diskutimet tuaja?</label>\n          <textarea id=\"item-1\" data-activity-item=\"item-1\" aria-label=\"- Si mendoni ta p&#xeb;rfshini edhe v&#xeb;llan&#xeb; m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; n&#xeb; diskutimet tuaja?\" class=\"mt-3 min-h-11 w-full rounded-xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\" rows=\"3\"></textarea>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-zinc-900\"><span data-id=\"pg045_n0007\">- Krijoni nj&#xeb; situat&#xeb; t&#xeb; ngjashme dhe merrni mendimin e tij.</span></p>\n          <label for=\"item-2\" class=\"sr-only\">- Krijoni nj&#xeb; situat&#xeb; t&#xeb; ngjashme dhe merrni mendimin e tij.</label>\n          <textarea id=\"item-2\" data-activity-item=\"item-2\" aria-label=\"- Krijoni nj&#xeb; situat&#xeb; t&#xeb; ngjashme dhe merrni mendimin e tij.\" class=\"mt-3 min-h-11 w-full rounded-xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\" rows=\"3\"></textarea>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mb-10 border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white p-4\">\n      <p class=\"adt-body text-left italic leading-relaxed text-zinc-800\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg045_n0010\">Njer&#xeb;zit kan&#xeb; mendime t&#xeb; ndryshme p&#xeb;r prejardhjen, ashtu edhe p&#xeb;r zgjidhjen e problemeve.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg045_n0011\">K&#xeb;to nuk duhet t&#xeb; ndikojn&#xeb; p&#xeb;r t&#x2019;i ndar&#xeb; ata nga nj&#xeb;ri-tjetri.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg045_n0012\">Ne duhet t&#xeb; d&#xeb;gjojm&#xeb; dhe ta respektojm&#xeb; mendimin ndryshe.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg045_n0013\">Ndaj t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;ve duhet t&#xeb; sillemi me toleranc&#xeb; dhe qytetari.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg045_n0014\">T&#xeb; d&#xeb;gjojm&#xeb; mendimin e gjithsecilit dhe t&#xeb; mendojm&#xeb; me kujdes p&#xeb;r at&#xeb; q&#xeb; thot&#xeb;.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg045_n0015\">N&#xeb; t&#xeb; kund&#xeb;rt, kjo mund t&#xeb; shkaktoj&#xeb; konflikte, t&#xeb; cilat i shmangim p&#xeb;rmes qet&#xeb;sis&#xeb; dhe toleranc&#xeb;s n&#xeb; komunikim.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg045_n0016\">Respektimi i mendimit t&#xeb; tjetrit &#xeb;sht&#xeb; baza e mir&#xeb;kuptimit dhe harmonis&#xeb; midis njer&#xeb;zve.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg045_n0017\">Njeriu duhet t&#xeb; respektoj&#xeb; dhe t&#xeb; ndihet i respektuar gjithmon&#xeb;.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg045_n0018\">Shkolla duhet t&#xeb; punoj&#xeb; q&#xeb; t&#xeb; siguroj&#xeb; mjedisin e duhur n&#xeb; klas&#xeb; p&#xeb;r mb&#xeb;shtetjen e nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;sve n&#xeb; procesin e t&#xeb; m&#xeb;suarit.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg045_n0019\">Ne kemi nevoj&#xeb; p&#xeb;r kultur&#xeb;n e bised&#xeb;s me nj&#xeb;ri-tjetrin.</span>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pt-2\">\n      <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-zinc-900\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg045_n0021\" class=\"font-semibold\">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e:</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg045_n0022\">mendim ndryshe, respekt, toleranc&#xeb;, mir&#xeb;kuptim.</span>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg046_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg046_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"55\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 bg-white opacity-0\">\n  <section data-section-type=\"text_and_single_image\" data-section-id=\"pg046_sec001\" class=\"pb-12 text-left text-zinc-800\">\n    <div class=\"mb-10 pt-6\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-stretch max-sm:flex-col max-sm:items-start\">\n        <div class=\"flex h-56 w-36 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-r-xl bg-purple-500 max-sm:h-28 max-sm:w-28 max-sm:rounded-2xl\">\n          <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative h-16 w-20\">\n            <div class=\"absolute left-0 top-2 h-10 w-10 rounded-full bg-white\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-1 left-2 h-0 w-0 border-l-[10px] border-r-[2px] border-t-[10px] border-l-transparent border-r-transparent border-t-white\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute right-0 top-4 h-10 w-10 rounded-full bg-white\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-2 h-0 w-0 border-l-[8px] border-r-[2px] border-t-[8px] border-l-transparent border-r-transparent border-t-white\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute right-5 top-8 flex gap-1\">\n              <span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-purple-400\"></span>\n              <span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-purple-400\"></span>\n              <span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-purple-400\"></span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col justify-center pt-16 max-sm:pt-4 max-sm:w-full\">\n          <div class=\"bg-purple-500 px-3 py-2\">\n            <h1 class=\"adt-h1 font-bold text-white\"><span data-id=\"pg046_n0002\">Mendime t&#xeb; ndryshme, vendime t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rbashk&#xeb;ta</span></h1>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"w-fit border-b-4 border-purple-400 pt-3 pb-2 pr-10 max-sm:pr-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"adt-h2 font-medium text-zinc-900\"><span data-id=\"pg046_n0003\">Hapat e vendimmarrjes</span></h2>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mb-8\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-start gap-6 max-sm:flex-col max-sm:gap-3\">\n        <div class=\"shrink-0 bg-green-400 px-5 py-2\">\n          <h3 class=\"adt-h3 font-medium text-zinc-900\"><span data-id=\"pg046_n0005\">Situata 1.</span></h3>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"adt-body flex-1 leading-relaxed text-zinc-800\">\n          <span data-id=\"pg046_n0007\">Sot edhe f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;t marrin pjes&#xeb; n&#xeb; vendime.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg046_n0008\">Ata mund t&#xeb; japin mendime dhe propozime p&#xeb;r aktivitetet q&#xeb; b&#xeb;hen n&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg046_n0009\">Shum&#xeb; nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;s ndihmojn&#xeb; p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; planifikuar loj&#xeb;ra, projekte apo veprime t&#xeb; tjera dhe din&#xeb; si t&#xeb; punojn&#xeb; n&#xeb; grupe, ku secili ka nj&#xeb; rol dhe nj&#xeb; detyr&#xeb; t&#xeb; ve&#xe7;ant&#xeb;.</span>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <figure class=\"mb-8 px-8 max-sm:px-0\">\n      <img data-id=\"pg046_im001\" src=\"images/pg046_im001.png\" alt=\"Pes&#xeb; nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;s t&#xeb; ulur rreth nj&#xeb; tavoline duke diskutuar s&#xeb; bashku; nj&#xeb;ri flet me dor&#xeb;n ngritur, nd&#xeb;rsa t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;t d&#xeb;gjojn&#xeb; dhe marrin pjes&#xeb; n&#xeb; vendimmarrje.\" class=\"mx-auto h-auto w-full max-w-4xl\">\n    </figure>\n\n    <aside class=\"mb-12 bg-purple-200/80 p-4 max-sm:p-4\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 max-sm:flex-col max-sm:gap-3\">\n        <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative flex h-20 w-20 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-none bg-purple-500 max-sm:h-16 max-sm:w-16 max-sm:rounded-xl\">\n          <span class=\"absolute h-10 w-3 rotate-45 rounded-full border-r-4 border-t-4 border-white\"></span>\n          <span class=\"absolute bottom-4 h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex-1 space-y-5\">\n          <div>\n            <p class=\"adt-body text-zinc-900\"><span data-id=\"pg046_n0011\">- Si p&#xeb;rfshiheni n&#xeb; vendimmarrje n&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;?</span></p>\n            <label for=\"item-1\" class=\"sr-only\">- Si p&#xeb;rfshiheni n&#xeb; vendimmarrje n&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;?</label>\n            <textarea id=\"item-1\" data-activity-item=\"item-1\" aria-label=\"- Si p&#xeb;rfshiheni n&#xeb; vendimmarrje n&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;?\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-11 w-full rounded-xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-zinc-900 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\"></textarea>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <p class=\"adt-body text-zinc-900\"><span data-id=\"pg046_n0012\">- &#xc7;far&#xeb; keni parasysh kur merrni vendime?</span></p>\n            <label for=\"item-2\" class=\"sr-only\">- &#xc7;far&#xeb; keni parasysh kur merrni vendime?</label>\n            <textarea id=\"item-2\" data-activity-item=\"item-2\" aria-label=\"- &#xc7;far&#xeb; keni parasysh kur merrni vendime?\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-11 w-full rounded-xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-zinc-900 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\"></textarea>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <p class=\"adt-body text-zinc-900\"><span data-id=\"pg046_n0013\">- Sa i r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sish&#xeb;m &#xeb;sht&#xeb; roli i nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;sve n&#xeb; vendimmarrjen p&#xeb;r procesin m&#xeb;simor e sa p&#xeb;r veprimtarit&#xeb;?</span></p>\n            <label for=\"item-3\" class=\"sr-only\">- Sa i r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sish&#xeb;m &#xeb;sht&#xeb; roli i nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;sve n&#xeb; vendimmarrjen p&#xeb;r procesin m&#xeb;simor e sa p&#xeb;r veprimtarit&#xeb;?</label>\n            <textarea id=\"item-3\" data-activity-item=\"item-3\" aria-label=\"- Sa i r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sish&#xeb;m &#xeb;sht&#xeb; roli i nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;sve n&#xeb; vendimmarrjen p&#xeb;r procesin m&#xeb;simor e sa p&#xeb;r veprimtarit&#xeb;?\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-11 w-full rounded-xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-zinc-900 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\"></textarea>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"flex items-start gap-6 max-sm:flex-col max-sm:gap-3\">\n        <div class=\"shrink-0 bg-amber-300 px-5 py-2\">\n          <h3 class=\"adt-h3 font-medium text-zinc-900\"><span data-id=\"pg046_n0015\">Situata 2.</span></h3>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"adt-body flex-1 leading-relaxed text-zinc-800\">\n          <span data-id=\"pg046_n0017\">Shkolla jon&#xeb; kishte filluar t&#xeb; rind&#xeb;rtohej.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg046_n0018\">F&#xeb;mij&#xeb;ve u p&#xeb;lqejn&#xeb; shum&#xeb; aktivitetet dhe loj&#xeb;rat.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg046_n0019\">Para shkoll&#xeb;s ishte vendosur projekti i nd&#xeb;rtimit.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg046_n0020\">Na p&#xeb;lqeu pamja e re q&#xeb; do t&#xeb; merrte nd&#xeb;rtesa, por kur v&#xeb;rejt&#xeb;m me kujdes, aty nuk ishte planifikuar palest&#xeb;r e sall&#xeb; loj&#xeb;rash.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg046_n0021\">Vendos&#xeb;m t&#xeb; bisedonim me m&#xeb;suesin e edukat&#xeb;s fizike fillimisht.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg046_n0022\">Pas diskutimeve, ai na tha se duhej t&#xeb; d&#xeb;rgonim nj&#xeb; k&#xeb;rkes&#xeb; me shkrim n&#xeb; drejtorin&#xeb; e shkoll&#xeb;s</span>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg047_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">