        <div class=\"mb-4 h-1 w-1/2 bg-[#b56abd] max-sm:w-2/3\"></div>\n        <div class=\"rounded-[1.5rem] border border-[#efd98e] bg-[#f9e8aa] p-3\">\n          <img data-id=\"pg047_im001_crop_v1\" src=\"images/pg047_im001_crop_v1.png\" alt=\"Tre nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;s duke diskutuar me m&#xeb;suesen para tabel&#xeb;s n&#xeb; klas&#xeb;.\" class=\"block w-full h-auto rounded-[1rem] bg-[#fbe59b]\">\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mt-6 rounded-[1.5rem] border border-[#cbb3d2] bg-[#d6c1dc] px-5 py-5\">\n      <ul class=\"space-y-5 list-none\">\n        <li class=\"adt-body text-slate-800\">\n          <span data-id=\"pg047_n0008\">Shkruani nj&#xeb; k&#xeb;rkes&#xeb;-propozim p&#xeb;r nd&#xeb;rtimin e nj&#xeb; palestre n&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;.</span>\n          <label for=\"item-1\" class=\"sr-only\">Shkruani nj&#xeb; k&#xeb;rkes&#xeb;-propozim p&#xeb;r nd&#xeb;rtimin e nj&#xeb; palestre n&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;.</label>\n          <textarea id=\"item-1\" data-activity-item=\"item-1\" aria-label=\"Shkruani nj&#xeb; k&#xeb;rkes&#xeb;-propozim p&#xeb;r nd&#xeb;rtimin e nj&#xeb; palestre n&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;.\" class=\"mt-3 w-full min-h-11 rounded-xl border-2 border-[#b56abd] bg-white px-4 py-3 text-slate-800 outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#a86bb0]\"></textarea>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"adt-body text-slate-800\">\n          <span data-id=\"pg047_n0010\">Kujt mendoni t&#x2019;ia d&#xeb;rgoni k&#xeb;rkes&#xeb;n?</span>\n          <label for=\"item-2\" class=\"sr-only\">Kujt mendoni t&#x2019;ia d&#xeb;rgoni k&#xeb;rkes&#xeb;n?</label>\n          <input id=\"item-2\" data-activity-item=\"item-2\" type=\"text\" aria-label=\"Kujt mendoni t&#x2019;ia d&#xeb;rgoni k&#xeb;rkes&#xeb;n?\" class=\"mt-3 w-full min-h-11 rounded-xl border-2 border-[#b56abd] bg-white px-4 py-3 text-slate-800 outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#a86bb0]\">\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"adt-body text-slate-800\">\n          <span data-id=\"pg047_n0012\">Si mendoni se do t&#xeb; ndikoj&#xeb; propozimi juaj?</span>\n          <label for=\"item-3\" class=\"sr-only\">Si mendoni se do t&#xeb; ndikoj&#xeb; propozimi juaj?</label>\n          <textarea id=\"item-3\" data-activity-item=\"item-3\" aria-label=\"Si mendoni se do t&#xeb; ndikoj&#xeb; propozimi juaj?\" class=\"mt-3 w-full min-h-11 rounded-xl border-2 border-[#b56abd] bg-white px-4 py-3 text-slate-800 outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#a86bb0]\"></textarea>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"adt-body text-slate-800\">\n          <span data-id=\"pg047_n0014\">Tregoni disa situata t&#xeb; ngjashme, n&#xeb; t&#xeb; cilat jeni t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rfshir&#xeb; n&#xeb; marrjen e vendimeve t&#xeb; r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sishme n&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;n apo klas&#xeb;n tuaj.</span>\n          <label for=\"item-4\" class=\"sr-only\">Tregoni disa situata t&#xeb; ngjashme, n&#xeb; t&#xeb; cilat jeni t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rfshir&#xeb; n&#xeb; marrjen e vendimeve t&#xeb; r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sishme n&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;n apo klas&#xeb;n tuaj.</label>\n          <textarea id=\"item-4\" data-activity-item=\"item-4\" aria-label=\"Tregoni disa situata t&#xeb; ngjashme, n&#xeb; t&#xeb; cilat jeni t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rfshir&#xeb; n&#xeb; marrjen e vendimeve t&#xeb; r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sishme n&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;n apo klas&#xeb;n tuaj.\" class=\"mt-3 w-full min-h-11 rounded-xl border-2 border-[#b56abd] bg-white px-4 py-3 text-slate-800 outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#a86bb0]\"></textarea>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mt-8 border-2 border-[#c98acb] bg-white px-5 py-5 shadow-sm\">\n      <p class=\"adt-body italic text-slate-800 leading-relaxed\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg047_n0017\">Procesi i vendimmarrjes k&#xeb;rkon njer&#xeb;z t&#xeb; vet&#xeb;dijsh&#xeb;m dhe t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rgjegjsh&#xeb;m p&#xeb;r at&#xeb; q&#xeb; b&#xeb;jn&#xeb;, sepse duhet t&#xeb; arrihen zgjidhje t&#xeb; k&#xeb;naqshme p&#xeb;r pal&#xeb;t pjes&#xeb;marr&#xeb;se.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg047_n0018\">Pra, vendimmarrja &#xeb;sht&#xeb; edhe proces i arritjes s&#xeb; kompromisit.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg047_n0019\">Por, para se t&#xeb; merren vendime, njer&#xeb;zit diskutojn&#xeb; me nj&#xeb;ri-tjetrin.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg047_n0020\">Nd&#xeb;rsa, diskutimi duhet t&#xeb; b&#xeb;het sipas disa rregullave.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg047_n0021\">Prandaj, p&#xeb;r t&#x2019;u marr&#xeb; vesh sa m&#xeb; mir&#xeb; me nj&#xeb;ri-tjetrin, hartohen rregulla q&#xeb; duhen zbatuar nga t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb;.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg047_n0022\">F&#xeb;mij&#xeb;t duhet t&#xeb; ndihen t&#xeb; pranuar, t&#xeb; respektuar, t&#xeb; mbrojtur, t&#xeb; barabart&#xeb; n&#xeb; ambientet brenda dhe jasht&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;s.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg047_n0023\">P&#xeb;rfshirja n&#xeb; vendimmarrje n&#xeb;nkupton pjes&#xeb;marrjen e f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;ve n&#xeb; planifikim, n&#xeb; ndarjen e p&#xeb;rgjegj&#xeb;sive, n&#xeb; aktivitetet e ndryshme etj.</span>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-[#f1cd73] bg-[#fbe09a] px-5 py-5\">\n      <h3 class=\"adt-h3 font-bold text-slate-800 mb-3\" data-id=\"pg047_n0025\">Mendime t&#xeb; ndryshme, vendime t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rbashk&#xeb;ta</h3>\n      <p class=\"adt-body text-slate-800 mb-4\"><span data-id=\"pg047_n0027\">Disa hapa q&#xeb; duhen pasur parasysh gjat&#xeb; marrjes s&#xeb; vendimit jan&#xeb;:</span></p>\n      <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-slate-800 list-none\">\n        <li class=\"adt-body\"><span data-id=\"pg047_n0030\">t&#xeb; sqarojm&#xeb; p&#xeb;r &#xe7;far&#xeb; po vendosim;</span></li>\n        <li class=\"adt-body\"><span data-id=\"pg047_n0032\">paraqiten fakte, materiale dhe informacione, q&#xeb; t&#xeb; kuptojm&#xeb; m&#xeb; mir&#xeb; problemin;</span></li>\n        <li class=\"adt-body\"><span data-id=\"pg047_n0034\">nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;sit japin zgjidhjet e tyre p&#xeb;r situat&#xeb;n;</span></li>\n        <li class=\"adt-body\"><span data-id=\"pg047_n0036\">shikojm&#xeb; an&#xeb;t e mira dhe t&#xeb; k&#xeb;qija t&#xeb; secil&#xeb;s zgjidhje t&#xeb; propozuar;</span></li>\n        <li class=\"adt-body\"><span data-id=\"pg047_n0038\">p&#xeb;rpiqemi t&#xeb; biem dakord p&#xeb;r zgjidhjen m&#xeb; t&#xeb; mir&#xeb;;</span></li>\n        <li class=\"adt-body\">\n          <span data-id=\"pg047_n0040\">n&#xeb;se nuk arrihet ajo, at&#xeb;her&#xeb; opsionet hidhen n&#xeb; votim.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg047_n0041\">Opsioni q&#xeb; merr m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; vota, fiton.</span>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"adt-body mt-8 text-slate-800 font-medium\">\n      <span data-id=\"pg047_n0042\">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e: vendimmarrje, propozim, diskutim, vendim.</span>\n    </p>\n  </section>\n</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg048_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg048_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"57\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\