 nj&#xeb; qytet tjet&#xeb;r.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg049_n0009\">Ne p&#xeb;rpiqeshim t&#xeb; ishim t&#xeb; dashur me t&#xeb;, por v&#xeb;rehej se Jet&#xeb;s di&#xe7;ka i mungonte.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg049_n0010\">M&#xeb;suesja na k&#xeb;shilloi t&#x2019;i q&#xeb;ndronim af&#xeb;r.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg049_n0011\">Nj&#xeb; dit&#xeb;, ajo erdhi von&#xeb; dhe e shqet&#xeb;suar.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg049_n0012\">Mor&#xeb;m vesh se jetonte me gjyshen e kujdesej p&#xeb;r t&#xeb;.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg049_n0013\">Prind&#xeb;rve u ishte dashur t&#xeb; shkonin n&#xeb; nj&#xeb; shtet tjet&#xeb;r p&#xeb;r pun&#xeb;.</span>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mb-4 flex justify-center\">\n      <img data-id=\"pg049_im001\" src=\"images/pg049_im001.png\" alt=\"Nj&#xeb; nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;s e ngush&#xeb;llon shoqen e trishtuar n&#xeb; klas&#xeb;, nd&#xeb;rsa t&#xeb; dy kan&#xeb; librat e hapur n&#xeb; bank&#xeb;.\" class=\"w-full max-w-xl max-lg:max-w-sm max-sm:max-w-[220px] h-auto\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mb-8 flex items-stretch max-sm:flex-col\">\n      <div class=\"flex-1 bg-purple-200 border-l-4 border-purple-500 px-5 py-4 max-sm:px-4 max-sm:py-3\">\n        <p data-id=\"pg049_n0015\" class=\"adt-body text-neutral-900 leading-relaxed\">- Si do ta ndihmonit Jet&#xeb;n q&#xeb; ajo ta p&#xeb;rballonte m&#xeb; leht&#xeb; munges&#xeb;n e p&#xeb;rkohshme t&#xeb; prind&#xeb;rve t&#xeb; saj?</p>\n        <div class=\"mt-3\">\n          <label for=\"activity-item-1\" class=\"sr-only\">- Si do ta ndihmonit Jet&#xeb;n q&#xeb; ajo ta p&#xeb;rballonte m&#xeb; leht&#xeb; munges&#xeb;n e p&#xeb;rkohshme t&#xeb; prind&#xeb;rve t&#xeb; saj?</label>\n          <textarea id=\"activity-item-1\" data-activity-item=\"item-1\" aria-label=\"- Si do ta ndihmonit Jet&#xeb;n q&#xeb; ajo ta p&#xeb;rballonte m&#xeb; leht&#xeb; munges&#xeb;n e p&#xeb;rkohshme t&#xeb; prind&#xeb;rve t&#xeb; saj?\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 rounded-2xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-neutral-900 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\" rows=\"3\"></textarea>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-24 max-sm:w-full max-sm:h-20 bg-purple-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n        <div class=\"relative w-12 h-12 max-sm:w-10 max-sm:h-10\">\n          <div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-0 -translate-x-1/2 w-6 h-6 max-sm:w-5 max-sm:h-5 rounded-full border-2 border-white\"></div>\n          <div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-5 max-sm:top-4 -translate-x-1/2 w-2 h-2 max-sm:w-1.5 max-sm:h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white\"></div>\n          <div class=\"absolute left-1/2 bottom-0 -translate-x-1/2 w-4 h-4 max-sm:w-3.5 max-sm:h-3.5 border-l-2 border-b-2 border-r-2 border-white rounded-b-full\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mb-10 flex items-start max-sm:flex-col\">\n      <div class=\"flex-1 border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-5 py-4 max-sm:px-4\">\n        <p class=\"adt-body text-neutral-800 italic leading-relaxed\">\n          <span data-id=\"pg049_n0018\">Shkolla duhet t&#x2019;u ofroj&#xeb; m&#xeb;suesve, prind&#xeb;rve dhe nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;sve mund&#xeb;sin&#xeb; p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; shprehur mendimin e tyre, mund&#xeb;sin&#xeb; p&#xeb;r pjes&#xeb;marrje dhe vendimmarrje.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg049_n0019\">Pjes&#xeb;marrja demokratike fillon n&#xeb; nivel klase.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg049_n0020\">&#xc7;do klas&#xeb; ka p&#xeb;rfaq&#xeb;suesin e saj, kryetarin e klas&#xeb;s, i cili p&#xeb;rfaq&#xeb;son klas&#xeb;n n&#xeb; k&#xeb;shillin e shkoll&#xeb;s.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg049_n0021\">Edhe prind&#xeb;rit zgjedhin p&#xeb;rfaq&#xeb;suesin e prind&#xeb;rve t&#xeb; klas&#xeb;s, i cili bashk&#xeb;punon me m&#xeb;suesin p&#xeb;r zgjidhjen e problemeve q&#xeb; mund t&#xeb; ken&#xeb; nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;sit.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg049_n0022\">Prind&#xeb;rit i k&#xeb;rkojn&#xeb; dhe i mbrojn&#xeb; t&#xeb; drejtat e f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;ve t&#xeb; tyre, n&#xeb;p&#xeb;rmjet pjes&#xeb;marrjes n&#xeb; vendimmarrje.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg049_n0023\">F&#xeb;mija duhet t&#xeb; jet&#xeb; n&#xeb; qend&#xeb;r t&#xeb; t&#xeb; gjitha marr&#xeb;dh&#xeb;nieve t&#xeb; krijuara.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg049_n0024\">N&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb; duhet t&#xeb; ekzistojn&#xeb; lidhje t&#xeb; ngushta m&#xeb;sues-nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;s.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg049_n0025\">Nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;sit duhet t&apos;i d&#xeb;gjohet fjala dhe t&#xeb; aktivizohet n&#xeb; vendimmarrje.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg049_n0026\">N&#xeb; mjedisin e shkoll&#xeb;s duhet t&#xeb; ekzistoj&#xeb; respekti i nd&#xeb;rsjell&#xeb; dhe toleranca.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg049_n0027\">K&#xeb;shtu nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;sit do t&#xeb; ndihen m&#xeb; t&#xeb; vler&#xeb;suar dhe m&#xeb; aktiv&#xeb; n&#xeb; marrjen e vendimeve.</span>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n      <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-24 max-sm:w-full max-sm:h-20 bg-purple-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 border-t-2 border-r-2 border-b-2 border-purple-300 max-sm:border-l-2 max-sm:border-t-0\">\n        <div class=\"relative w-10 h-12 max-sm:w-9 max-sm:h-11\">\n          <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-sm border-2 border-white\"></div>\n          <div class=\"absolute right-0 top-1 w-2 h-2 bg-purple-500 border-t-2 border-r-2 border-white\"></div>\n          <div class=\"absolute left-1 right-1 bottom-1 h-1 border-t-2 border-white\"></div>\n          <div class=\"absolute left-1 right-1 bottom-3 h-1 border-t-2 border-white\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <aside class=\"bg-green-100 px-5 py-4 max-sm:px-4\">\n      <h3 data-id=\"pg049_n0029\" class=\"adt-h3 font-medium text-neutral-900\">Klasa ndahet n&#xeb; dy grupe:</h3>\n\n      <div class=\"mt-5 space-y-6\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\">\n          <p class=\"adt-body text-neutral-900 leading-relaxed\">\n            <span data-id=\"pg049_n0031\" class=\"font-semibold\">Grupi I:</span>\n            <span data-id=\"pg049_n0032\">Tregoni nj&#xeb; rast q&#xeb; keni arritur vendimmarrjen e p&#xeb;rbashk&#xeb;t si klas&#xeb;.</span>\n            <span data-id=\"pg049_n0033\">Si u b&#xeb; e mundur nj&#xeb; gj&#xeb; e till&#xeb;?</span>\n          </p>\n          <div>\n            <label for=\"activity-item-2\" class=\"sr-only\">Grupi I: Tregoni nj&#xeb; rast q&#xeb; keni arritur vendimmarrjen e p&#xeb;rbashk&#xeb;t si klas&#xeb;. Si u b&#xeb; e mundur nj&#xeb; gj&#xeb; e till&#xeb;?</label>\n            <textarea id=\"activity-item-2\" data-activity-item=\"item-2\" aria-label=\"Grupi I: Tregoni nj&#xeb; rast q&#xeb; keni arritur vendimmarrjen e p&#xeb;rbashk&#xeb;t si klas&#xeb;. Si u b&#xeb; e mundur nj&#xeb; gj&#xeb; e till&#xeb;?\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 rounded-2xl border-2 border-green-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-neutral-900 outline-none focus:border-green-500\" rows=\"4\"></textarea>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\">\n          <p class=\"adt-body text-neutral-900 leading-relaxed\">\n            <span data-id=\"pg049_n0035\" class=\"font-semibold\">Grupi II:</span>\n            <span data-id=\"pg049_n0036\">Tregoni nj&#xeb; rast kur nuk keni arritur t&#xeb; merrni nj&#xeb; vendim t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rbashk&#xeb;t si klas&#xeb;.</span>\n            <span data-id=\"pg049_n0037\">Cilat ishin v&#xeb;shtir&#xeb;sit&#xeb; me t&#xeb; cilat u p&#xeb;rball&#xeb;t?</span>\n          </p>\n          <div>\n            <label for=\"activity-item-3\" class=\"sr-only\">Grupi II: Tregoni nj&#xeb; rast kur nuk keni arritur t&#xeb; merrni nj&#xeb; vendim t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rbashk&#xeb;t si klas&#xeb;. Cilat ishin v&#xeb;shtir&#xeb;sit&#xeb; me t&#xeb; cilat u p&#xeb;rball&#xeb;t?</label>\n            <textarea id=\"activity-item-3\" data-activity-item=\"item-3\" aria-label=\"Grupi II: Tregoni nj&#xeb; rast kur nuk keni arritur t&#xeb; merrni 