bsolute left-1 right-1 bottom-1 h-2 border-t-2 border-white\"></div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"adt-body p-4 pt-5 italic text-[#2f2f2f] leading-relaxed\">\n              <span data-id=\"pg051_n0009\">N&#xeb; familje kemi t&#xeb; drejta dhe p&#xeb;rgjegj&#xeb;si.</span> <span data-id=\"pg051_n0010\">Ne duhet t&#x2019;i respektojm&#xeb; mendimet e an&#xeb;tar&#xeb;ve t&#xeb; familjes, ta ndihmojm&#xeb; dhe ta mb&#xeb;shtesim nj&#xeb;ri-tjetrin.</span> <span data-id=\"pg051_n0011\">F&#xeb;mij&#xeb;t duhet t&#xeb; ken&#xeb; p&#xeb;rgjegj&#xeb;si, q&#xeb; u p&#xeb;rshtaten mosh&#xeb;s s&#xeb; tyre, sepse k&#xeb;shtu ata ndihen t&#xeb; plot&#xeb;suar dhe t&#xeb; r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sish&#xeb;m n&#xeb; familje.</span> <span data-id=\"pg051_n0012\">P&#xeb;rfshirja e f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;ve n&#xeb; jet&#xeb;n e familjes &#xeb;sht&#xeb; nj&#xeb; nga parimet e Konvent&#xeb;s mbi t&#xeb; Drejtat e F&#xeb;mij&#xeb;s.</span> <span data-id=\"pg051_n0013\">F&#xeb;mij&#xeb;t duhet t&#xeb; shprehin lirsh&#xeb;m mendimin q&#xeb; kan&#xeb;.</span>\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"mt-10 bg-[#fde9a3] p-5 max-sm:p-4\">\n            <p class=\"adt-body text-[#2f2f2f] mb-5\"><span data-id=\"pg051_n0015\">Ja disa k&#xeb;shilla q&#xeb; duhen pasur parasysh:</span></p>\n            <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-[#2f2f2f]\">\n              <li class=\"adt-body flex items-start gap-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">&#x2013;</span><span data-id=\"pg051_n0018\">k&#xeb;shillohu n&#xeb; familje p&#xeb;r problemet e ndryshme q&#xeb; mund t&#xeb; kesh;</span></li>\n              <li class=\"adt-body flex items-start gap-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">&#x2013;</span><span data-id=\"pg051_n0020\">mbaj nj&#xeb; kalendar p&#xeb;r festat m&#xeb; t&#xeb; r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sishme n&#xeb; familje;</span></li>\n              <li class=\"adt-body flex items-start gap-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">&#x2013;</span><span data-id=\"pg051_n0022\">d&#xeb;gjo me v&#xeb;mendje se &#xe7;far&#xeb; thon&#xeb; pjes&#xeb;tar&#xeb;t e tjer&#xeb; t&#xeb; familjes;</span></li>\n              <li class=\"adt-body flex items-start gap-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">&#x2013;</span><span data-id=\"pg051_n0024\">trego respekt p&#xeb;r mendimet e an&#xeb;tar&#xeb;ve t&#xeb; familjes;</span></li>\n              <li class=\"adt-body flex items-start gap-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">&#x2013;</span><span data-id=\"pg051_n0026\">gjej fjal&#xeb;t e duhura p&#xeb;r t&#x2019;i p&#xeb;rdorur n&#xeb; komunikim.</span></li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n\n          <p class=\"adt-body mt-10 text-[#2f2f2f]\"><span data-id=\"pg051_n0027\">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e: familje, pjes&#xeb;marrje, mendim i lir&#xeb;, k&#xeb;shill&#xeb;.</span></p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg052_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg052_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"62\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css