-sm:px-5\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-8 max-sm:flex-col max-sm:gap-4\"><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 pt-4\"><div class=\"flex items-stretch max-sm:flex-col max-sm:items-start\"><div class=\"flex-1 bg-purple-500 px-6 py-3 max-sm:w-full\"><h1 class=\"adt-h1 font-bold text-white text-center max-sm:text-left\" data-id=\"pg055_n0002\">Mendime t&#xeb; ndryshme, vendime t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rbashk&#xeb;ta</h1></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ml-0 flex h-56 w-36 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-b-md rounded-t-md bg-purple-400 max-sm:mt-4 max-sm:h-28 max-sm:w-36\"><div class=\"relative h-24 w-24 max-sm:h-20 max-sm:w-20\"><div class=\"absolute left-0 top-2 h-16 w-16 rounded-full bg-white max-sm:h-12 max-sm:w-12\"></div><div class=\"absolute right-0 top-5 h-16 w-16 rounded-full bg-white max-sm:h-12 max-sm:w-12\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-5 max-w-2xl\"><h2 class=\"adt-h2 text-neutral-900\" data-id=\"pg055_n0003\">Institucionet dhe vendimet</h2><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-3 h-1 w-80 bg-purple-400 max-sm:w-64\"></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 pb-8 max-sm:px-5\"><div class=\"mt-4 inline-block bg-yellow-300 px-4 py-1 shadow-sm\"><h3 class=\"adt-h3 text-neutral-900\" data-id=\"pg055_n0004\">Situata 2.</h3></div><p class=\"adt-body mt-4 leading-relaxed text-left\"><span data-id=\"pg055_n0006\">P&#xeb;rmes zgjedhjeve, zgjidhen p&#xeb;rfaq&#xeb;suesit e popullit - deputet&#xeb;t e parlamentit.</span> <span data-id=\"pg055_n0007\">Deputet&#xeb;t zgjedhin presidentin a presidenten, i cili/e cila ka funksion p&#xeb;rbashkues.</span> <span data-id=\"pg055_n0008\">Ata po ashtu formojn&#xeb; edhe qeverin&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id=\"pg055_n0009\">K&#xeb;shtu iu p&#xeb;rgjigj m&#xeb;suesi Andit, kur e pyeti p&#xeb;r deputet&#xeb;t dhe presidentin.</span></p><figure class=\"mt-5\"><img src=\"images/pg055_im001.png\" alt=\"Seanc&#xeb; n&#xeb; Kuvendin e Republik&#xeb;s s&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;s, me deputet&#xeb; t&#xeb; mbledhur n&#xeb; sall&#xeb; dhe foltoren n&#xeb; qend&#xeb;r.\" data-id=\"pg055_im001\" class=\"mx-auto w-full h-auto rounded-[2rem] border border-neutral-200 shadow-sm\"><figcaption class=\"adt-caption mt-2 text-center font-semibold text-neutral-800\" data-id=\"pg055_n0011\">Kuvendi i Republik&#xeb;s s&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;s</figcaption></figure><div class=\"mt-6 overflow-hidden rounded-sm border-l-4 border-purple-300 bg-purple-100\"><div class=\"flex items-stretch max-sm:flex-col\"><div class=\"flex-1 p-5 max-sm:p-4\"><ul class=\"m-0 list-none space-y-5 p-0\"><li><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-1 text-neutral-700\">&#x2013;</span><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"adt-body\" data-id=\"pg055_n0015\">Si zgjidhet presidenti?</p><label for=\"item-1\" class=\"sr-only\">Si zgjidhet presidenti?</label><textarea id=\"item-1\" data-activity-item=\"item-1\" aria-label=\"Si zgjidhet presidenti?\" class=\"mt-2 w-full min-h-11 rounded-xl border-2 border-purple-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\"></textarea></div></div></li><li><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-1 text-neutral-700\">&#x2013;</span><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"adt-body\"><span data-id=\"pg055_n0017\">Imagjinoni se klasa juaj po voton p&#xeb;r vendet q&#xeb; do t&#x2019;i vizitoni gjat&#xeb; ekskursionit.</span> <span data-id=\"pg055_n0018\">Organizoni votimin!</span></p><label for=\"item-2\" class=\"sr-only\">Imagjinoni se klasa juaj po voton p&#xeb;r vendet q&#xeb; do t&#x2019;i vizitoni gjat&#xeb; ekskursionit. Organizoni votimin!</label><textarea id=\"item-2\" data-activity-item=\"item-2\" aria-label=\"Imagjinoni se klasa juaj po voton p&#xeb;r vendet q&#xeb; do t&#x2019;i vizitoni gjat&#xeb; ekskursionit. Organizoni votimin!\" class=\"mt-2 w-full min-h-11 rounded-xl border-2 border-purple-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\"></textarea></div></div></li><li><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-1 text-neutral-700\">&#x2013;</span><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"adt-body\" data-id=\"pg055_n0020\">Pse duhet t&#xeb; respektojm&#xeb; rezultatin e votimit edhe n&#xeb;se nuk fiton zgjedhja jon&#xeb;?</p><label for=\"item-3\" class=\"sr-only\">Pse duhet t&#xeb; respektojm&#xeb; rezultatin e votimit edhe n&#xeb;se nuk fiton zgjedhja jon&#xeb;?</label><textarea id=\"item-3\" data-activity-item=\"item-3\" aria-label=\"Pse duhet t&#xeb; respektojm&#xeb; rezultatin e votimit edhe n&#xeb;se nuk fiton zgjedhja jon&#xeb;?\" class=\"mt-2 w-full min-h-11 rounded-xl border-2 border-purple-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\"></textarea></div></div></li></ul></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex w-24 shrink-0 items-start justify-center bg-purple-500 text-white max-sm:h-16 max-sm:w-full max-sm:items-center\"><div class=\"px-4 py-4 font-bold\">?</div></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-8 overflow-hidden border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white\"><div class=\"flex items-start max-sm:flex-col-reverse\"><div class=\"flex-1 p-4 pr-6 max-sm:p-4 max-sm:pr-4\"><p class=\"adt-body italic leading-relaxed\"><span data-id=\"pg055_n0023\">Njer&#xeb;zit jetojn&#xeb; s&#xeb; bashku dhe p&#xeb;r k&#xeb;t&#xeb; arsye kan&#xeb; nevoj&#xeb; p&#xeb;r rregulla.</span> <span data-id=\"pg055_n0024\">Ato mund t&#xeb; jen&#xeb; rregulla shoq&#xeb;rore, t&#xeb; cilat nuk jan&#xeb; t&#xeb; shkruara, dhe rregulla ligjore, t&#xeb; cilat jan&#xeb; t&#xeb; detyrueshme p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id=\"pg055_n0025\">Shteti rregullon jet&#xeb;n e banor&#xeb;ve t&#xeb; nj&#xeb; vendi.</span> <span data-id=\"pg055_n0026\">P&#xeb;r t&#xeb; b&#xeb;r&#xeb; sa m&#xeb; mir&#xeb; detyrat e tij, ekzistojn&#xeb; institucionet qendrore dhe ato lokale.</span> <span data-id=\"pg055_n0027\">Institucionet duhet t&#xeb; kujdesen q&#xeb; k&#xeb;to rregulla t&#xeb; zbatohen nga t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id=\"pg055_n0028\">Institucionet qendrore drejtojn&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; vendin, kurse institucionet lokale plot&#xeb;sojn&#xeb; nevojat e banor&#xeb;ve n&#xeb; komuna t&#xeb; ndryshme.</span> <span data-id=\"pg055_n0029\">T&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; njer&#xeb;zit mbi 18 vje&#xe7; kan&#xeb; t&#xeb; drejt&#xeb; t&#xeb; votojn&#xeb;, p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; zgjedhur p&#xeb;rfaq&#xeb;suesit e tyre n&#xeb; parlament dhe komun&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id=\"pg055_n0030\">Parlamenti nxjerr ligje p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; mir&#xeb;n e t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb;ve, zgjedh qeverin&#xeb; e po ashtu edhe presidentin.</span></p></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-20 w-24 shrink-0 bg-purple-400 max-sm:h-14 max-sm:w-full\"></div></div></div><p class=\"adt-body mt-10\"><span class=\"font-semibold\" data-id=\"pg055_n0032\">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e:</span> <span data-id=\"pg055_n0033\">institucion, vendim, rregull, ligj, komun&#xeb;.</span></p></div></section></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg056_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg056_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-