>N&#xeb; sht&#xeb;pin&#xeb; e Bledit kishin nisur nj&#xeb; diskutim interesant.</span> <span data-id=\"pg056_n0007\">T&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; pjes&#xeb;tar&#xeb;t e familjes ishin p&#xeb;rfshir&#xeb; n&#xeb; t&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id=\"pg056_n0008\">- Ne duam q&#xeb; t&#xeb; d&#xeb;gjohet z&#xeb;ri yn&#xeb; n&#xeb; familje, - thoshte Bledi.</span> <span data-id=\"pg056_n0009\">- Edhe pse ne jemi f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;, duhet t&#xeb; na k&#xeb;rkohet mendimi p&#xeb;r vendimet q&#xeb; merren n&#xeb; familje.</span> <span data-id=\"pg056_n0010\">- Kan&#xeb; ndryshuar gj&#xeb;rat, - iu drejtua babai Bledit.</span> <span data-id=\"pg056_n0011\">- Ne ju kemi marr&#xeb; mendimin juve.</span> <span data-id=\"pg056_n0012\">P&#xeb;r shum&#xeb; gj&#xeb;ra n&#xeb; familje, kemi vendosur s&#xeb; bashku.</span> <span data-id=\"pg056_n0013\">Kur un&#xeb; kam qen&#xeb; f&#xeb;mij&#xeb; si ti, - vazhdoi ai t&#xeb; fliste, - babai im nuk na pyeste fare, por vendoste vet&#xeb; p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; gjitha gj&#xeb;rat.</span> <span data-id=\"pg056_n0014\">Gjyshi yt, si kryefamiljar q&#xeb; ishte, i merrte t&#xeb; gjitha vendimet n&#xeb; familjen ton&#xeb;, por edhe gjyshi ndryshoi me kalimin e koh&#xeb;s.</span> <span data-id=\"pg056_n0015\">Sot, ai ndihet shum&#xeb; i lumtur kur d&#xeb;gjon nipat dhe mbesat e tij teksa shprehin mendimet e tyre lirsh&#xeb;m.</span> <span data-id=\"pg056_n0016\">Bledi u habit nga fjal&#xeb;t e babait.</span> <span data-id=\"pg056_n0017\">Ai donte t&#xeb; dinte m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; rreth asaj q&#xeb; i tha babai.</span> <span data-id=\"pg056_n0018\">Biseda e tyre vazhdoi.</span> <span data-id=\"pg056_n0019\">N&#xeb; fund, Bledi kuptoi se shum&#xeb; gj&#xeb;ra kishin ndryshuar p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; mir&#xeb; nga e kaluara.</span></p><div class=\"border-l-4 border-purple-400 bg-purple-50 px-5 py-4\"><p class=\"adt-body text-neutral-900\"><span data-id=\"pg056_n0022\">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e: vendimmarrje, dikur, sot, grup.</span></p></div></div></section></div>\n    </main>\n\