eb;.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg062_n0023\">Shteti yn&#xeb; krijoi simbolet shtet&#xeb;rore: flamurin, stem&#xeb;n dhe himnin shtet&#xeb;ror.</span>\n        </p>\n        <p class=\"mt-8 adt-body leading-relaxed text-left\">\n          <span data-id=\"pg062_n0025\">Flamuri i Kosov&#xeb;s ka ngjyr&#xeb;n e kalt&#xeb;r, mbi t&#xeb; &#xeb;sht&#xeb; v&#xeb;n&#xeb; nj&#xeb; hart&#xeb; e verdh&#xeb; e Kosov&#xeb;s dhe ka gjasht&#xeb; yje t&#xeb; bardha sip&#xeb;r saj.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg062_n0026\">Yjet n&#xeb;nkuptojn&#xeb; gjasht&#xeb; popujt &#x2013; komunitetet etnike q&#xeb; jetojn&#xeb; n&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;.</span>\n        </p>\n        <p class=\"mt-7 adt-body leading-relaxed text-left\">\n          <span data-id=\"pg062_n0028\">Stema e Kosov&#xeb;s &#xeb;sht&#xeb; simbol i Republik&#xeb;s s&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;s.</span>\n        </p>\n        <p class=\"mt-7 adt-body leading-relaxed text-left\">\n          <span data-id=\"pg062_n0030\">Himni &#xeb;sht&#xeb; nj&#xeb; k&#xeb;ng&#xeb; solemne, e cila ekzekutohet n&#xeb; ceremonit&#xeb; shtet&#xeb;rore, n&#xeb; &#xe7;do veprimtari nd&#xeb;rkomb&#xeb;tare, n&#xeb; ngjarjet sportive ku vendi yn&#xeb; &#xeb;sht&#xeb; pjes&#xeb;marr&#xeb;s, si dhe n&#xeb; raste t&#xeb; tjera t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rcaktuara me ligje p&#xeb;rkat&#xeb;se.</span>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <figure class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-zinc-300 shadow-lg\">\n      <img data-id=\"pg062_im001\" src=\"images/pg062_im001.png\" alt=\"Flamuri i Kosov&#xeb;s me sfond t&#xeb; kalt&#xeb;r, hart&#xeb;n e verdh&#xeb; t&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;s n&#xeb; qend&#xeb;r dhe gjasht&#xeb; yje t&#xeb; bardh&#xeb; sip&#xeb;r.\" class=\"block w-full h-auto object-cover\">\n    </figure>\n  </section>\n</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\">