lative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg063_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg063_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"78\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container opacity-0\"><section data-section-type=\"text_and_single_image\" data-section-id=\"pg063_sec001\" class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl bg-white px-8 py-8 text-zinc-800 max-sm:px-5\"><div class=\"mb-10 flex min-h-[92px] w-full items-center bg-purple-400 px-8 max-sm:min-h-[72px] max-sm:px-5\"><h1 data-id=\"pg063_n0002\" class=\"adt-h1 font-bold text-white\">Vendi ku jetoj</h1></div><div class=\"mb-10\"><h2 data-id=\"pg063_n0004\" class=\"adt-h2 mb-3 inline-block border-b-4 border-purple-400 pb-2 text-left font-semibold\">Rajonet e Kosov&#xeb;s</h2></div><div class=\"mb-5\"><h3 data-id=\"pg063_n0006\" class=\"adt-h3 inline-block rounded-sm bg-green-400 px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-zinc-900\">Situata 1.</h3><p class=\"adt-body mt-4 text-left leading-relaxed\"><span data-id=\"pg063_n0008\">Luna dhe Lisi jan&#xeb; shok&#xeb; t&#xeb; mir&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id=\"pg063_n0009\">Ata vendos&#xeb;n t&#xeb; m&#xeb;sonin m&#xeb;simin &#x201c;Rajonet e Kosov&#xeb;s&#x201d;, n&#xeb; sht&#xeb;pin&#xeb; e Lisit, sepse n&#xeb;na e tij &#xeb;sht&#xeb; m&#xeb;suese gjeografie.</span> <span data-id=\"pg063_n0010\">T&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;sit e duan shum&#xeb; m&#xeb;suesen Lirik&#xeb;, sepse ajo shpjegon m&#xeb;simin p&#xeb;rmes loj&#xeb;s.</span></p></div><p class=\"adt-body mb-5 text-left leading-relaxed\"><span data-id=\"pg063_n0012\">M&#xeb;suesja Lirik&#xeb; kishte p&#xeb;rgatitur hart&#xeb;n e Kosov&#xeb;s, ku nj&#xeb; pjes&#xeb; t&#xeb; saj e kishte ngjyrosur me t&#xeb; kalt&#xeb;r e nj&#xeb; pjes&#xeb; me t&#xeb; verdh&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id=\"pg063_n0013\">Ajo shpjegoi se Kosova &#xeb;sht&#xeb; e ndar&#xeb; n&#xeb; dy rajone: Fusha e Kosov&#xeb;s dhe Rrafshi i Dukagjinit.</span> <span data-id=\"pg063_n0014\">Ajo vazhdoi duke iu treguar se Kosova ka shtat&#xeb; qendra rajonale.</span> <span data-id=\"pg063_n0015\">Mori etiketat me emra dhe i vendosi tri n&#xeb; Rrafshin e Dukagjinit: Gjakova, Peja dhe Prizreni, kurse kat&#xeb;r t&#xeb; tjera n&#xeb; Fush&#xeb;n e Kosov&#xeb;s: Ferizaji, Gjilani, Mitrovica dhe Prishtina.</span> <span data-id=\"pg063_n0016\">Etiket&#xeb;n me emrin e Prishtin&#xeb;s e kishte me ngjyr&#xeb; t&#xeb; kuqe, q&#xeb; t&#xeb; dallohej nga qendrat e tjera rajonale, sepse Prishtina &#xeb;sht&#xeb; kryeqyteti i Kosov&#xeb;s.</span></p><p class=\"adt-body mb-10 text-left leading-relaxed\"><span data-id=\"pg063_n0018\">Luna dhe Lisi u k&#xeb;naq&#xeb;n shum&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id=\"pg063_n0019\">- Nuk do t&#x2019;i harrojm&#xeb; asnj&#xeb;her&#xeb; k&#xeb;to q&#xeb; m&#xeb;suam sot,</span> <span data-id=\"pg063_n0020\">- than&#xeb; ata.</span></p><figure class=\"mx-auto mt-2 w-full max-w-3xl overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-purple-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm max-sm:p-2\"><img data-id=\"pg063_im004\" src=\"images/pg063_im004.png\" alt=\"Harta e Kosov&#xeb;s e ndar&#xeb; n&#xeb; dy rajone: Rrafshi i Dukagjinit n&#xeb; t&#xeb; verdh&#xeb; dhe Fusha e Kosov&#xeb;s n&#xeb; t&#xeb; gjelb&#xeb;r, me qendrat rajonale Peja, Gjakova, Prizreni, Mitrovica, Prishtina, Gjilani dhe Ferizaj.\" class=\"block h-auto w-full object-contain\"><figcaption class=\"sr-only\"><span data-id=\"pg063_n0022\">Mitrovica</span> <span data-id=\"pg063_n0023\">Peja</span> <span data-id=\"pg063_n0024\">Prishtina</span> <span data-id=\"pg063_n0025\">Rrafshi i Dukagjinit</span> <span data-id=\"pg063_n0026\">Fusha e Kosov&#xeb;s</span> <span data-id=\"pg063_n0027\">Gjilani</span> <span data-id=\"pg063_n0028\">Gjakova</span> <span data-id=\"pg063_n0029\">Ferizaj</span> <span data-id=\"pg063_n0030\">Prizreni</span></figcaption></figure></section></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg063_sec002.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg063_sec002\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-sectio