; rajonet e Kosov&#xeb;s?\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 rounded-2xl border border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-400\"></textarea>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 max-lg:flex-col\">\n            <div class=\"flex-1 adt-body\" data-id=\"pg064_n0011\">Cilat jan&#xeb; qendrat rajonale t&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;s?</div>\n            <div class=\"w-64 max-lg:w-full\">\n              <label for=\"item-3\" class=\"sr-only\">Cilat jan&#xeb; qendrat rajonale t&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;s?</label>\n              <textarea id=\"item-3\" data-activity-item=\"item-3\" aria-label=\"Cilat jan&#xeb; qendrat rajonale t&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;s?\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 rounded-2xl border border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-400\"></textarea>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 max-lg:flex-col\">\n            <div class=\"flex-1 adt-body\" data-id=\"pg064_n0013\">N&#xeb; cilin rajon jetoni ju?</div>\n            <div class=\"w-64 max-lg:w-full\">\n              <label for=\"item-4\" class=\"sr-only\">N&#xeb; cilin rajon jetoni ju?</label>\n              <input id=\"item-4\" data-activity-item=\"item-4\" type=\"text\" aria-label=\"N&#xeb; cilin rajon jetoni ju?\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 rounded-2xl border border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-400\">\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 max-lg:flex-col\">\n            <div class=\"flex-1 adt-body\" data-id=\"pg064_n0015\">Cili &#xeb;sht&#xeb; kryeqyteti i Kosov&#xeb;s?</div>\n            <div class=\"w-64 max-lg:w-full\">\n              <label for=\"item-5\" class=\"sr-only\">Cili &#xeb;sht&#xeb; kryeqyteti i Kosov&#xeb;s?</label>\n              <input id=\"item-5\" data-activity-item=\"item-5\" type=\"text\" aria-label=\"Cili &#xeb;sht&#xeb; kryeqyteti i Kosov&#xeb;s?\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 rounded-2xl border border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-400\">\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 max-lg:flex-col\">\n            <div class=\"flex-1 adt-body\" data-id=\"pg064_n0017\">P&#xeb;rmend disa karakteristika t&#xeb; rajoneve t&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;s.</div>\n            <div class=\"w-64 max-lg:w-full\">\n              <label for=\"item-6\" class=\"sr-only\">P&#xeb;rmend disa karakteristika t&#xeb; rajoneve t&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;s.</label>\n              <textarea id=\"item-6\" data-activity-item=\"item-6\" aria-label=\"P&#xeb;rmend disa karakteristika t&#xeb; rajoneve t&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;s.\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 rounded-2xl border border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-400\"></textarea>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n\n    <p class=\"adt-body mb-6 leading-relaxed max-w-4xl\">\n      <span data-id=\"pg064_n0019\">Njihuni me disa nga vendet karakteristike t&#xeb; qendrave rajonale t&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;s.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"mb-10\">\n      <div class=\"flex gap-10 items-start max-lg:flex-col max-lg:gap-5\">\n        <div class=\"w-56 shrink-0 pt-72 max-lg:w-full max-lg:pt-0\">\n          <div class=\"rounded-full border-2 border-purple-400 bg-white px-8 py-12 text-center\">\n            <div data-id=\"pg064_n0021\" class=\"adt-body\">Rajonet e Kosov&#xeb;s</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex-1 space-y-3\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 max-lg:flex-col max-lg:items-stretch\">\n            <div class=\"w-52 max-lg:w-full rounded-full border-2 border-purple-400 bg-white px-6 py-4 text-center\"><div data-id=\"pg064_n0022\" class=\"adt-body\">Peja</div></div>\n            <div class=\"flex-1 rounded-3xl border-2 border-purple-400 bg-white px-4 py-3\"><div data-id=\"pg064_n0023\" class=\"adt-body\">Peja dallohet p&#xeb;r Gryk&#xeb;n e Rugov&#xeb;s dhe burimin e Drinit t&#xeb; Bardh&#xeb;.</div></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 max-lg:flex-col max-lg:items-stretch\">\n            <div class=\"w-52 max-lg:w-full rounded-full border-2 border-purple-400 bg-white px-6 py-4 text-center\"><div data-id=\"pg064_n0024\" class=\"adt-body\">Gjakova</div></div>\n            <div class=\"flex-1 rounded-3xl border-2 border-purple-400 bg-white px-4 py-3\"><div data-id=\"pg064_n0025\" class=\"adt-body\">Gjakova dallohet p&#xeb;r Kodr&#xeb;n e &#xc7;abratit, lumin Erenik dhe lumin Krena.</div></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 max-lg:flex-col max-lg:items-stretch\">\n            <div class=\"w-52 max-lg:w-full rounded-full border-2 border-purple-400 bg-white px-6 py-4 text-center\"><div data-id=\"pg064_n0026\" class=\"adt-body\">Prizreni</div></div>\n            <div class=\"flex-1 rounded-3xl border-2 border-purple-400 bg-white px-4 py-3\"><div data-id=\"pg064_n0027\" class=\"adt-body\">N&#xeb; Prizren gjendet nd&#xeb;rtesa e Lidhjes s&#xeb; Prizrenit dhe malet e Sharrit me bukurit&#xeb; magjeps&#xeb;se.</div></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 max-lg:flex-col max-lg:items-stretch\">\n            <div class=\"w-52 max-lg:w-full rounded-full border-2 border-purple-400 bg-white px-6 py-4 text-center\"><div data-id=\"pg064_n0028\" class=\"adt-body\">Ferizaj</div></div>\n            <div class=\"flex-1 rounded-3xl border-2 border-purple-400 bg-white px-4 py-3\"><div data-id=\"pg064_n0029\" class=\"adt-body\">N&#xeb; Ferizaj &#xeb;sht&#xeb; nd&#xeb;rtuar Kampi i Ushtris&#xeb; Amerikane.</div></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 max-lg:flex-col max-lg:items-stretch\">\n            <div class=\"w-52 max-lg:w-full rounded-full border-2 border-purple-400 bg-white px-6 py-4 text-center\"><div data-id=\"pg064_n0030\" class=\"adt-body\">Gjilani</div></div>\n            <div class=\"flex-1 rounded-3xl border-2 border-purple-400 bg-white px-4 py-3\"><div data-id=\"pg064_n0031\" class=\"adt-body\">Gjilani dallohet p&#xeb;r kalan&#xeb; mesjetare t&#xeb; Artan&#xeb;s (Novob&#xeb;rd&#xeb;s).</div></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 max-lg:flex-col max-lg:items-stretch\">\n            <div class=\"w-52 max-lg:w-full rounded-full border-2 border-purple-400 bg-white px-6 py-4 text-center\"><div data-id=\"pg064_n0032\" class=\"adt-body\">Mitrovica</div></div>\n            <div class=\"flex-1 rounded-3xl border-2 border-purple-400 bg-white px-4 py-3\"><div data-id=\"pg064_n0033\" class=\"adt-body\">N&#xeb; Mitrovic&#xeb; &#xeb;sht&#xeb; miniera e Trep&#xe7;&#xeb;s.</div></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 max-lg:flex-col max-lg:items-stretch\">\n            <div class=\"w-52 max-lg:w-full rounded-full border-2 border-purple-400 bg-white px-6 py-4 text-center\"><div data-id=\"pg064_n0034\" class=\"adt-body\">Prishtina</div></div>\n            <div class=\"flex-1 rounded-3xl border-2 border-purple-400 bg-white px-4 py-3\"><div data-id=\"pg064_n0035\" class=\"adt-body\">N&#xeb; Prishtin&#xeb; &#xeb;sht&#xeb; qyteti antik Ulpiana, Biblioteka Komb&#xeb;tare, Muzeu Komb&#xeb;tar, Muzeu Etnografik, Universiteti i Prishtin&#xeb;s etj.</div></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <aside class=\"mb-8 rounded-3xl border-2 border-purple-400 bg-white px-4 py-4\">\n      <p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg064_n0038\">Hulumto dhe gjej disa vende karakteristike t&#xeb; rajonit ku jeton dhe t&#xeb; rajoneve t&#xeb; tjera t&#xeb; vendit ton&#xeb;.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg064_n0039\">Prezanto para klas&#xeb;s pun&#xeb;n e b&#xeb;r&#xeb; dhe diskutoni rreth saj.</span>\n      </p>\n      <div>\n        <label for=\"item-7\" class=\"sr-only\">Hulumto dhe gjej disa vende karakteristike t&#xeb; rajonit ku jeton dhe t&#xeb; rajoneve t&#xeb; tjera t&#xeb; vendit ton&#xeb;. Prezanto para klas&#xeb;s pun&#xeb;n e b&#xeb;r&#xeb; dhe diskutoni rreth saj.</label>\n        <textarea id=\"item-7\" data-activity-item=\"item-7\" aria-label=\"Hulumto dhe gjej disa vende karakteristike t&#xeb; rajonit ku jeton dhe t&#xeb; rajoneve t&#xeb; tjera t&#xeb; vendit ton&#xeb;. Prezanto para klas&#xeb;s pun&#xeb;n e b&#xeb;r&#xeb; dhe diskutoni rreth saj.\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 rounded-2xl border border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-400\"></textarea>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n\n    <div class=\"border-l-4 border-purple-400 pl-4\">\n      <p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg064_n0042\" class=\"font-semibold\">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e:</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg064_n0043\">qend&#xeb;r rajonale, rajon, kryeqytet.</span>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg065_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg065_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"81\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container opacity-0\">\n  <section data-section-type=\"text_and_images\" data-section-id=\"pg065_sec001\" class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl bg-white px-8 py-8 text-zinc-800 max-sm:px-5\">\n    <div class=\"-mx-8 mb-8 max-sm:-mx-5\">\n      <div class=\"flex min-h-[128px] items-stretch bg-[#ad6bb0] max-sm:min-h-[120px]\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-1 items-end px-10 pb-5 pt-7 max-sm:px-5 max-sm:pb-4 max-sm:pt-5\">\n          <div class=\"w-full max-w-2xl\">\n            <h1 data-id=\"pg065_n0004\" class=\"adt-h2 text-left font-semibold text-white\">Komunitetet dhe ve&#xe7;orit&#xeb; e tyre</h1>\n            <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-3 h-1 w-80 bg-white/80 max-sm:w-48\"></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex w-[146px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center bg-[#a566ad] max-sm:w-[92px]\">\n          <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-24 w-24 bg-white [clip-path:polygon(49%_3%,59%_12%,70%_20%,79%_31%,88%_44%,82%_57%,72%_66%,62%_76%,51%_95%,42%_83%,30%_75%,21%_64%,15%_52%,18%_39%,26%_27%,37%_16%)] max-sm:h-14 max-sm:w-14\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mb-5 inline-block bg-[#6fbe7e] px-4 py-1 max-sm:px-3\">\n      <h3 data-id=\"pg065_n0006\" class=\"adt-h3 text-left font-semibold text-zinc-900\">Situata 1.</h3>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mb-6\">\n      <p class=\"adt-body max-w-[62ch] text-left leading-relaxed max-lg:max-w-none\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg065_n0008\">Gjyshja e Kleas ka shum&#xeb; d&#xeb;shir&#xeb; t&#xeb; q&#xeb;ndis&#xeb;.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg065_n0009\">Ajo i ka q&#xeb;ndisur Kleas shum&#xeb; fustane e triko dhe t&#xeb; gjitha shoqeve u p&#xeb;lqejn&#xeb;.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg065_n0010\">N&#xeb; veshjet e Kleas duket se po &#xe7;elin lulet shum&#xeb;ngyr&#xeb;she.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg065_n0011\">Nj&#xeb; dit&#xeb; gjyshja vendosi t&#xeb; q&#xeb;ndiste flamurin e Kosov&#xeb;s.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg065_n0012\">Punonte gjith&#xeb; dit&#xeb;n se kishte d&#xeb;shir&#xeb; ta kishte gati p&#xeb;r 17 Shkurtin - fest&#xeb;n e Pavar&#xeb;sis&#xeb; s&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;s.</span>\n      </p>\n\n      <p class=\"adt-body mt-5 max-w-[62ch] text-left leading-relaxed max-lg:max-w-none\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg065_n0014\">- Ke duar t&#xeb; arta, moj gjyshe!</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg065_n0015\">M&#xeb; dukesh si Marigona e Flamurit, - i tha Klea.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg065_n0016\">- Nuk kam par&#xeb; flamur m&#xeb; t&#xeb; bukur!</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg065_n0017\">Gjyshja po prekte me radh&#xeb; yjet n&#xeb; flamur dhe po tregonte di&#xe7;ka nga tradita e secilit popull q&#xeb; jeton n&#xeb; vendin ton&#xeb;.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg065_n0018\">- Secili popull q&#xeb; jeton n&#xeb; vendin ton&#xeb; ka zakonet e tij, kultur&#xeb;n e tij, q&#xeb; e karakterizon at&#xeb;.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg065_n0019\">&#xcb;sht&#xeb; e r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sishme q&#xeb; t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; popujt t&apos;i respektojn&#xeb; kulturat e nj&#xeb;ri-tjetrit dhe t&#xeb; jetojn&#xeb; n&#xeb; harmoni.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg065_n0020\">- Ti je si nj&#xeb; lib&#xeb;r historie, moj gjyshja ime e dashur, - tha Klea dhe e p&#xeb;rqafoi me shum&#xeb; dashuri.</span>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mb-6 flex justify-end max-lg:justify-center\">\n      <div class=\"w-full max-w-[470px] max-sm:max-w-full\">\n        <img data-id=\"pg065_im002\" src=\"images/pg065_im002.jpg\" alt=\"Gjyshja ulur n&#xeb; divan po qendis flamurin e Kosov&#xeb;s, nd&#xeb;rsa mbesa e saj bisedon me t&#xeb; e buz&#xeb;qeshur.\" class=\"h-auto w-full rounded-3xl bg-white shadow-md\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mb-8 flex justify-center\">\n      <div class=\"w-full max-w-[360px] max-sm:max-w-[260px]\">\n        <img data-id=\"pg065_im001\" src=\"images/pg065_im001.png\" alt=\"Dy f&#xeb;mij&#xeb; t&#xeb; buz&#xeb;qeshur mbajn&#xeb; flamurin e Kosov&#xeb;s; nj&#xeb;ri q&#xeb;ndron n&#xeb; k&#xeb;mb&#xeb;, nd&#xeb;rsa tjetri &#xeb;sht&#xeb; n&#xeb; karroc&#xeb;.\" class=\"h-auto w-full rounded-2xl bg-white shadow-md\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <aside class=\"mt-4 rounded-none bg-[#ead7ee] p-4 max-sm:p-3\">\n      <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-zinc-900\">\n            <span data-id=\"pg065_n0024\">P&#xeb;rmend popujt q&#xeb; jetojn&#xeb; n&#xeb; Republik&#xeb;n e Kosov&#xeb;s!</span>\n          </p>\n          <label for=\"item-1\" class=\"sr-only\">P&#xeb;rmend popujt q&#xeb; jetojn&#xeb; n&#xeb; Republik&#xeb;n e Kosov&#xeb;s!</label>\n          <textarea id=\"item-1\" data-activity-item=\"item-1\" aria-label=\"P&#xeb;rmend popujt q&#xeb; jetojn&#xeb; n&#xeb; Republik&#xeb;n e Kosov&#xeb;s!\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-11 w-full rounded-xl border-2 border-[#d7c3f2] bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-[#ad6bb0]\" rows=\"3\"></textarea>\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-zinc-900\">\n            <span data-id=\"pg065_n0026\">P&#xeb;rshkruaj t&#xeb; drejtat e komuniteteve etnike n&#xeb; Republik&#xeb;n e Kosov&#xeb;s!</span>\n          </p>\n          <label for=\"item-2\" class=\"sr-only\">P&#xeb;rshkruaj t&#xeb; drejtat e komuniteteve etnike n&#xeb; Republik&#xeb;n e Kosov&#xeb;s!</label>\n          <textarea id=\"item-2\" data-activity-item=\"item-2\" aria-label=\"P&#xeb;rshkruaj t&#xeb; drejtat e komuniteteve etnike n&#xeb; Republik&#xeb;n e Kosov&#xeb;s!\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-11 w-full rounded-xl border-2 border-[#d7c3f2] bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-[#ad6bb0]\" rows=\"3\"></textarea>\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-zinc-900\">\n            <span data-id=\"pg065_n0028\">Cilat gjuh&#xeb; zyrtare fliten n&#xeb; Republik&#xeb;n e Kosov&#xeb;s?</span>\n          </p>\n          <label for=\"item-3\" class=\"sr-only\">Cilat gjuh&#xeb; zyrtare fliten n&#xeb; Republik&#xeb;n e Kosov&#xeb;s?</label>\n          <input id=\"item-3\" data-activity-item=\"item-3\" type=\"text\" aria-label=\"Cilat gjuh&#xeb; zyrtare fliten n&#xeb; Republik&#xeb;n e Kosov&#xeb;s?\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-11 w-full rounded-xl border-2 border-[#d7c3f2] bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-[#ad6bb0]\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-zinc-900\">\n            <span data-id=\"pg065_n0030\">A i respekton secili komunitet n&#xeb; vendin ton&#xeb; traditat dhe zakonet e tij?</span>\n          </p>\n          <label for=\"item-4\" class=\"sr-only\">A i respekton secili komunitet n&#xeb; vendin ton&#xeb; traditat dhe zakonet e tij?</label>\n          <textarea id=\"item-4\" data-activity-item=\"item-4\" aria-label=\"A i respekton secili komunitet n&#xeb; vendin ton&#xeb; traditat dhe zakonet e tij?\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-11 w-full rounded-xl border-2 border-[#d7c3f2] bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-[#ad6bb0]\" rows=\"3\"></textarea>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n\n    <div class=\"mt-6 border-2 border-[#c58bcb] bg-white px-5 py-4 max-sm:px-4\">\n      <p class=\"adt-body text-left italic leading-relaxed text-zinc-800\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg065_n0033\">Flamuri i Kosov&#xeb;s ka gjasht&#xeb; yje t&#xeb; bardha.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg065_n0034\">Yjet zyrtarisht n&#xeb;nkuptojn&#xeb; gjasht&#xeb; popujt - komunitetet etnike q&#xeb; jetojn&#xeb; n&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;: shqiptar&#xeb;t, serb&#xeb;t, turqit, boshnjak&#xeb;t, rom&#xeb;t dhe goran&#xeb;t.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg065_n0035\">Gjuh&#xeb; zyrtare n&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb; jan&#xeb;: gjuha shqipe dhe gjuha serbe.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg065_n0036\">T&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; kan&#xeb; t&#xeb; drejt&#xeb; t&#xeb; flasin gjuh&#xeb;n e tyre, t&apos;i ndjekin zakonet, traditat, besimin fetar dhe t&#xeb; festojn&#xeb; festat e tyre.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg065_n0037\">Secili komunitet feston festat e veta, me veshjet, muzik&#xeb;n dhe ushqimet tradicionale t&#xeb; vendit t&#xeb; tyre.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg065_n0038\">Kjo tregon se t&#xeb; gjitha komunitetet n&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb; respektohen dhe kan&#xeb; t&#xeb; drejta t&#xeb; barabarta.</span>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mt-6 bg-[#fbf4dc] px-4 py-3\">\n      <p class=\"adt-body text-left\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg065_n0040\" class=\"font-semibold\">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e:</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg065_n0041\">komunitet etnik, pakic&#xeb; komb&#xeb;tare, gjuh&#xeb; zyrtare.</span>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg066_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg066_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and