arsim.\" class=\"w-full min-h-32 max-sm:min-h-28 rounded border border-gray-400 bg-white px-4 py-3 resize-y leading-8 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-300\"></textarea></div><div class=\"bg-purple-50 rounded-xl p-6 max-sm:p-5\"><p class=\"adt-body leading-snug mb-4\"><span data-id=\"pg076_n0026\">- Pse mendon se k&#xeb;ta njer&#xeb;z nuk duhet t&#xeb; harrohen? P&#xeb;rmend s&#xeb; paku tri arsye.</span></p><label for=\"activity-item-3\" class=\"sr-only\">- Pse mendon se k&#xeb;ta njer&#xeb;z nuk duhet t&#xeb; harrohen? P&#xeb;rmend s&#xeb; paku tri arsye.</label><textarea id=\"activity-item-3\" data-activity-item=\"item-3\" aria-label=\"- Pse mendon se k&#xeb;ta njer&#xeb;z nuk duhet t&#xeb; harrohen? P&#xeb;rmend s&#xeb; paku tri arsye.\" class=\"w-full min-h-48 max-sm:min-h-36 rounded border border-gray-400 bg-white px-4 py-3 resize-y leading-8 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-300\"></textarea></div></div></section></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg077_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg077_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"96\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 py-8 bg-white opacity-0\">\n  <section data-section-type=\"text_and_single_image\" data-section-id=\"pg077_sec001\" class=\"w-full text-left\">\n    <div class=\"mb-6\">\n      <h1 data-id=\"pg077_n0003\" class=\"adt-h2 font-bold text-neutral-800 mb-4 inline-block border-b-4 border-purple-400 pb-2\">Njer&#xeb;zit q&#xeb; nuk harrohen</h1>\n      <div class=\"mt-3\">\n        <h3 data-id=\"pg077_n0005\" class=\"adt-h3 inline-block bg-amber-300 text-neutral-900 font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-md shadow-sm\">Situata 2.</h3>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"flex flex-row gap-8 items-start max-lg:flex-col\">\n      <div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\">\n        <div class=\"adt-body text-neutral-800 leading-relaxed space-y-2\">\n          <p>\n            <span data-id=\"pg077_n0008\">Mali shkon rregullisht te dentisti.</span>\n            <span data-id=\"pg077_n0009\">Shum&#xeb; i p&#xeb;lqen kur i sheh gjith&#xeb; ato mjete, me t&#xeb; cilat ndreqen dh&#xeb;mb&#xeb;t.</span>\n            <span data-id=\"pg077_n0010\">Edhe but&#xeb;sia e dentistit ka b&#xeb;r&#xeb; q&#xeb; Mali t&#xeb; kujdeset p&#xeb;r sh&#xeb;ndetin e dh&#xeb;mb&#xeb;ve me shum&#xeb; d&#xeb;shir&#xeb;.</span>\n            <span data-id=\"pg077_n0011\">Nj&#xeb; dit&#xeb;, ai e pyeti gjyshin:</span>\n          </p>\n          <p>\n            <span data-id=\"pg077_n0012\">- Gjysh, si ka qen&#xeb; mjek&#xeb;sia n&#xeb; koh&#xeb;n t&#xeb;nde?</span>\n          </p>\n          <p>\n            <span data-id=\"pg077_n0013\">- N&#xeb; koh&#xeb;n time, - tha gjyshi, - nuk kishte shum&#xeb; mjek&#xeb;.</span>\n            <span data-id=\"pg077_n0014\">Mjek&#xeb;t duhej t&#xeb; shkolloheshin n&#xeb; vende t&#xeb; tjera, sepse te ne nuk kishte shkolla.</span>\n            <span data-id=\"pg077_n0015\">Ata ishin shum&#xeb; t&#xeb; kujdessh&#xeb;m dhe sh&#xeb;ronin shum&#xeb; njer&#xeb;z, edhe pse nuk kishin mjetet q&#xeb; jan&#xeb; sot.</span>\n            <span data-id=\"pg077_n0016\">E sot ka shum&#xeb; mjek&#xeb; p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; cil&#xeb;t duhet t&#xeb; flasim me respekt, pasi me pun&#xeb;n dhe kujdesin q&#xeb; tregojn&#xeb;, jan&#xeb; gjithmon&#xeb; n&#xeb; sh&#xeb;rbim t&#xeb; popullit.</span>\n          </p>\n          <p>\n            <span data-id=\"pg077_n0017\">Gjithmon&#xeb;, gjyshi &#xeb;sht&#xeb; i gatsh&#xeb;m ta shuaj&#xeb; kureshtjen e Malit p&#xeb;r pyetjet q&#xeb; i b&#xeb;n.</span>\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"w-[43%] max-lg:w-full shrink-0\">\n        <div class=\"rounded-[2rem] bg-amber-100 p-4 shadow-md\">\n          <img data-id=\"pg077_im001\" src=\"images/pg077_im001.jpg\" alt=\"Mali bisedon me gjyshin ulur n&#xeb; kolltuqe, nd&#xeb;rsa mendon p&#xeb;r vizit&#xeb;n te dentisti.\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-2xl object-contain bg-white\">\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <aside class=\"mt-8 border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white rounded-none p-5 shadow-sm\">\n      <p class=\"adt-body text-neutral-800 leading-relaxed italic\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg077_n0020\">Vendi yn&#xeb; ka arsim, sh&#xeb;ndet&#xeb;si e ekonomi, duke iu fal&#xeb;nderuar pun&#xeb;s s&#xeb; palodhshme t&#xeb; specialist&#xeb;ve t&#xeb; k&#xeb;tyre fushave, t&#xeb; cil&#xeb;t nuk ndalen asnj&#xeb;her&#xeb; p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; mir&#xeb;n e vendit ton&#xeb;.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg077_n0021\">Sot, n&#xeb; vendin ton&#xeb;, sa i p&#xeb;rket cil&#xeb;sis&#xeb;, m&#xeb;simdh&#xeb;nia bashk&#xeb;kohore ka dallime t&#xeb; m&#xeb;dha me at&#xeb; tradicionale.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg077_n0022\">M&#xeb;suesit luajn&#xeb; nj&#xeb; rol shum&#xeb; t&#xeb; r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sish&#xeb;m p&#xeb;r arsimin e vendit ton&#xeb;.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg077_n0023\">Mjek&#xeb;t jan&#xeb; t&#xeb; kualifikuar dhe t&#xeb; specializuar n&#xeb; drejtime t&#xeb; ndryshme.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg077_n0024\">P&#xeb;r dallim nga mjek&#xeb;t e dikursh&#xeb;m, sot ata shkollohen n&#xeb; vendin ton&#xeb;.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg077_n0025\">P&#xeb;r zhvillimin e vendit ndihmojn&#xeb; edhe ekonomist&#xeb;t, t&#xeb; cil&#xeb;t punojn&#xeb; q&#xeb; t&#xeb; kemi nj&#xeb; jet&#xeb; m&#xeb; t&#xeb; mir&#xeb;.</span>\n      </p>\n    </aside>\n\n    <div class=\"mt-10 pt-4 border-t border-neutral-200\">\n      <p class=\"adt-body text-neutral-900 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg077_n0027\">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e:</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg077_n0028\">arsim, sh&#xeb;ndet&#xeb;si, ekonomi, specialist, kontribut.</span>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg077_sec002.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg077_sec002\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and 