eft text-gray-900 leading-tight border-b-4 border-purple-400 inline-block pb-2 max-w-full\"><span data-id=\"pg081_n0004\">Takim: &#x201c;M&#xeb;sojm&#xeb; nga jeta e personaliteteve tona&#x201d;</span></h2>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bg-green-100 px-8 py-6 mb-8 max-sm:px-5 rounded-none\">\n      <p class=\"adt-body text-left mb-2 leading-relaxed\"><span data-id=\"pg081_n0007\">Bashk&#xeb; me m&#xeb;suesen/in ftoni n&#xeb; klas&#xeb; nj&#xeb; personalitet t&#xeb; njohur t&#xeb; qytetit/fshatit tuaj.</span></p>\n      <ul class=\"adt-body text-left ml-6 space-y-1 leading-relaxed\">\n        <li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">- </span><span data-id=\"pg081_n0010\">Mjek/e</span></li>\n        <li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">- </span><span data-id=\"pg081_n0012\">Ekonomist/e</span></li>\n        <li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">- </span><span data-id=\"pg081_n0014\">Biznesmen/e</span></li>\n        <li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">- </span><span data-id=\"pg081_n0016\">Sportist/e</span></li>\n        <li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">- </span><span data-id=\"pg081_n0018\">Muzikant/e</span></li>\n        <li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">- </span><span data-id=\"pg081_n0020\">Veteran/e arsimi ose njer&#xeb;z t&#xeb; suksessh&#xeb;m t&#xeb; ndonj&#xeb; fushe tjet&#xeb;r.</span></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mb-10 pl-6 max-sm:pl-2 space-y-1 text-left text-gray-900\">\n      <p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed\"><span data-id=\"pg081_n0022\">P&#xeb;rgatitni disa pyetje p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; intervistuar t&#xeb; ftuarin tuaj, q&#xeb; t&#xeb; njiheni me vepr&#xeb;n e tij.</span></p>\n      <p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed\"><span data-id=\"pg081_n0023\">P&#xeb;rmes pyetjeve, mundohuni t&#xeb; kuptoni jet&#xeb;n dhe pun&#xeb;n e tij.</span></p>\n      <p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed\"><span data-id=\"pg081_n0024\">Shkruani pyetjet p&#xeb;r intervist&#xeb;.</span></p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"space-y-5 pl-6 max-sm:pl-2\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"adt-b