 urim, g&#xeb;zim.</span></p>\n  </div>\n\n  <aside class=\"relative mt-8 ml-12 bg-purple-100 px-6 py-6 ring-1 ring-purple-200 max-sm:ml-0 max-sm:px-5 max-sm:py-5\">\n    <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute right-0 top-5 flex h-16 w-20 items-center justify-center bg-purple-500 font-bold text-white max-sm:top-auto max-sm:bottom-5 max-sm:left-5 max-sm:right-auto max-sm:h-14 max-sm:w-16\">?</div>\n    <div class=\"space-y-6 pr-28 max-sm:pr-0 max-sm:pb-20\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-gray-900\"><span data-id=\"pg089_n0010\">Pse &#xeb;sht&#xeb; e r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sishme t&#xeb; zbukurohet ambienti p&#xeb;r nj&#xeb; fest&#xeb; t&#xeb; caktuar?</span></p>\n        <label for=\"item-1\" class=\"sr-only\">Pse &#xeb;sht&#xeb; e r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sishme t&#xeb; zbukurohet ambienti p&#xeb;r nj&#xeb; fest&#xeb; t&#xeb; caktuar?</label>\n        <textarea id=\"item-1\" data-activity-item=\"item-1\" aria-label=\"Pse &#xeb;sht&#xeb; e r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sishme t&#xeb; zbukurohet ambienti p&#xeb;r nj&#xeb; fest&#xeb; t&#xeb; caktuar?\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-11 w-full rounded-2xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\"></textarea>\n      </div>\n\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-gray-900\"><span data-id=\"pg089_n0012\">Si duhet t&#xeb; veprojm&#xeb; gjat&#xeb; fest&#xeb;s, n&#xeb; t&#xeb; cil&#xeb;n jemi t&#xeb; ftuar?</span></p>\n        <label for=\"item-2\" class=\"sr-only\">Si duhet t&#xeb; veprojm&#xeb; gjat&#xeb; fest&#xeb;s, n&#xeb; t&#xeb; cil&#xeb;n jemi t&#xeb; ftuar?</label>\n        <textarea id=\"item-2\" data-activity-item=\"item-2\" aria-label=\"Si duhet t&#xeb; veprojm&#xeb; gjat&#xeb; fest&#xeb;s, n&#xeb; t&#xeb; cil&#xeb;n jemi t&#xeb; ftuar?\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-11 w-full rounded-2xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\"></textarea>\n      </div>\n\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-gray-900\"><span data-id=\"pg089_n0015\">Si duhet t&#xeb; veprojm&#xeb; gjat&#xeb; nj&#xeb; feste, n&#xeb; t&#xeb; cil&#xeb;n jemi mikprit&#xeb;sit?</span></p>\n        <label for=\"item-3\" class=\"sr-only\">Si duhet t&#xeb; veprojm&#xeb; gjat&#xeb; nj&#xeb; feste, n&#xeb; t&#xeb; cil&#xeb;n jemi mikprit&#xeb;sit?</label>\n        <textarea id=\"item-3\" data-activity-item=\"item-3\" aria-label=\"Si duhet t&#xeb; veprojm&#xeb; gjat&#xeb; nj&#xeb; feste, n&#xeb; t&#xeb; cil&#xeb;n jemi mikprit&#xeb;sit?\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-11 w-full rounded-2xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\"></textarea>\n      </div>\n\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-gray-900\"><span data-id=\"pg089_n0017\">Cila fest&#xeb; ju p&#xeb;lqen m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; dhe pse?</span></p>\n        <label for=\"item-4\" class=\"sr-only\">Cila fest&#xeb; ju p&#xeb;lqen m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; dhe pse?</label>\n        <textarea id=\"item-4\" data-activity-item=\"item-4\" aria-label=\"Cila fest&#xeb; ju p&#xeb;lqen m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; dhe pse?\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-11 w-full rounded-2xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\"></textarea>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </aside>\n</section></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg089_sec002.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg089_sec002\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"113\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <h1 class=\"sr-only\" id=\"page-heading\">Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</h1>\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 opacity-0\">\n  <section data-section-type=\"text_only\" data-section-id=\"pg089_sec002\" class=\"bg-white py-8\">\n    <div class=\"rounded-sm border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white shadow-sm overflow-hidden\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-stretch max-lg:flex-col\">\n        <div class=\"flex-1 p-6 max-sm:p-4\">\n          <p class=\"adt-body italic leading-relaxed text-gray-800\">\n            <span data-id=\"pg089_n0021\">Festa &#xeb;sht&#xeb; nj&#xeb; dit&#xeb; q&#xeb; ve&#xe7;ohet nga t&#xeb; tjerat, sepse lidhet me nj&#xeb; ngjarje t&#xeb; caktuar gazmore.</span>\n            <span data-id=\"pg089_n0022\">Dita e fest&#xeb;s dallon nga dit&#xeb;t e tjera sepse p&#xeb;rgatitet ushqim m&#xeb; i ve&#xe7;ant&#xeb;, veshjet dallojn&#xeb; nga ato t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rditshmet etj.</span>\n            <span data-id=\"pg089_n0023\">Gjat&#xeb; dit&#xeb;ve t&#xeb; festave, jemi t&#xeb; lumtur dhe festojm&#xeb; s&#xeb; bashku me prind&#xeb;rit, kush&#xeb;rinjt&#xeb;, miqt&#xeb; dhe shok&#xeb;t.</span>\n            <span data-id=\"pg089_n0024\">Zakonisht gjat&#xeb; festave marrim dhe japim dhurata, vall&#xeb;zojm&#xeb;, k&#xeb;ndojm&#xeb; etj.</span>\n          </p>\n\n          <p class=\"adt-body italic leading-relaxed text-gray-800 mt-4\">\n            <span data-id=\"pg089_n0026\">Festat mund t&#xeb; jen&#xeb; individuale, familjare, shtet&#xeb;rore, komb&#xeb;tare, nd&#xeb;rkomb&#xeb;tare, fetare etj.</span>\n            <span data-id=\"pg089_n0027\">Festat individuale jan&#xeb; festa q&#xeb; i takojn&#xeb; nj&#xeb; individi, p.sh., festa e dit&#xeb;lindjes.</span>\n            <span data-id=\"pg089_n0028\">Festat shtet&#xeb;rore jan&#xeb; festa q&#xeb; feston nj&#xeb; shtet, p.sh., Pavar&#xeb;sia e Kosov&#xeb;s.</span>\n            <span data-id=\"pg089_n0029\">Festa komb&#xeb;tare &#xeb;sht&#xeb; fest&#xeb; q&#xeb; feston nj&#xeb; komb, nj&#xeb; popull kudo q&#xeb; ndodhet, p.sh., t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; shqiptar&#xeb;t q&#xeb; jetojn&#xeb; n&#xeb;p&#xeb;r vende t&#xeb; ndryshme t&#xeb; bot&#xeb;s festojn&#xeb; Pavar&#xeb;sin&#xeb; e Shqip&#xeb;ris&#xeb;.</span>\n          </p>\n\n          <p class=\"adt-body italic leading-relaxed text-gray-800 mt-4\">\n            <span data-id=\"pg089_n0031\">Festa nd&#xeb;rkomb&#xeb;tare &#xeb;sht&#xeb; fest&#xeb; q&#xeb; festohet n&#xeb; t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; bot&#xeb;n, p.sh. Dita e Gruas.</span>\n          </p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"w-28 bg-purple-500 flex items-start justify-center pt-4 max-lg:w-full max-lg:h-20 max-lg:pt-0 max-lg:items-center\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <div class=\"h-14 w-10 rounded-sm border-2 border-white bg-white/90 shadow-md relative\">\n            <div class=\"absolute -right-1 top-2 h-0 w-0 border-y-[6px] border-l-[10px] border-y-transparent border-l-white\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-x-1 bottom-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-purple-200\"></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></di