e Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg092_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"117\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container opacity-0\">\n  <section data-section-type=\"text_and_images\" data-section-id=\"pg092_sec001\" class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 py-8 bg-white text-neutral-900\">\n    <div class=\"mb-6 border-b-4 border-fuchsia-400 pb-3\">\n      <h1 data-id=\"pg092_n0003\" class=\"adt-h2 font-bold text-left text-neutral-900\">Shfryt&#xeb;zimi i pasurive natyrore</h1>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3 data-id=\"pg092_n0004\" class=\"adt-h3 inline-block bg-green-400 px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-left text-neutral-900 rounded-sm mb-5\">Situata 1.</h3>\n\n    <p class=\"adt-body text-left leading-relaxed mb-8\">\n      <span data-id=\"pg092_n0006\">Buna: P&#xeb;rsh&#xeb;ndetje, Rita!</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg092_n0007\">M&#xeb; duhet t&#xeb; shkruaj nj&#xeb; artikull informues p&#xeb;r shfryt&#xeb;zimin e pasurive natyrore n&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb; dhe nuk kam asnj&#xeb; ide se &#xe7;far&#xeb; do t&#xeb; shkruaj.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg092_n0008\">A mund t&#xeb; m&#xeb; ndihmosh me ndonj&#xeb; informacion?</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg092_n0009\">Rita: Sigurisht.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg092_n0010\">At&#xeb;her&#xeb;, fillimisht duhet t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rmendet q&#xeb; Kosova ka pasuri natyrore t&#xeb; bollshme.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg092_n0011\">Ka pyje, lumenj, male, tok&#xeb; bujq&#xeb;sore dhe shum&#xeb; pasuri n&#xeb;ntok&#xeb;sore.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg092_n0012\">Kosova p&#xeb;r nga pasurit&#xeb; natyrore &#xeb;sht&#xeb; nd&#xeb;r vendet m&#xeb; t&#xeb; pasura n&#xeb; Evrop&#xeb;.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg092_n0013\">Pasurit&#xeb; natyrore ndahen n&#xeb;:</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"overflow-x-auto mb-10\">\n      <table class=\"w-full border-collapse table-fixed max-lg:table-auto\">\n        <tr>\n          <th class=\"w-1/2 border-4 border-white bg-green-400 px-4 py-3 align-top text-left max-lg:block max-lg:w-full\">\n            <h3 data-id=\"pg092_n0017\" class=\"adt-h3 font-bold text-neutral-900\">Pasuri mbitok&#xeb;sore</h3>\n          </th>\n          <th class=\"w-1/2 border-4 border-white bg-green-400 px-4 py-3 align-top text-left max-lg:block max-lg:w-full\">\n            <h3 data-id=\"pg092_n0019\" class=\"adt-h3 font-bold text-neutral-900\">Pasuri n&#xeb;ntok&#xeb;sore</h3>\n          </th>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"max-lg:block\">\n          <td class=\"w-1/2 align-top border-2 border-green-400 px-4 py-4 max-lg:block max-lg:w-full\">\n            <ul class=\"space-y-8\">\n              <li class=\"adt-body text-left leading-relaxed\"><span data-id=\"pg092_n0024\">1. Toka e punueshme, e cila shfryt&#xeb;zohet p&#xeb;r zhvillimin e bujq&#xeb;sis&#xeb;.</span></li>\n              <li class=\"adt-body text-left leading-relaxed\"><span data-id=\"pg092_n0026\">2. Lumenjt&#xeb;, t&#xeb; cil&#xeb;t i shfryt&#xeb;zojm&#xeb; p&#xeb;r uj&#xeb; t&#xeb; pijsh&#xeb;m apo ujitje.</span></li>\n              <li class=\"adt-body text-left leading-relaxed\"><span data-id=\"pg092_n0028\">3. Liqenet artificiale, t&#xeb; cilat shfryt&#xeb;zohen p&#xeb;r uj&#xeb; t&#xeb; pijsh&#xeb;m.</span></li>\n              <li class=\"adt-body text-left leading-relaxed\">\n                <span data-id=\"pg092_n0030\">4. Pyjet, drur&#xeb;t e t&#xeb; cilave shfryt&#xeb;zohen p&#xeb;r ngrohje apo p&#xeb;r prodhimin e gj&#xeb;sendeve t&#xeb; ndryshme.</span>\n                <span data-id=\"pg092_n0031\">Po ashtu, ato jan&#xeb; t&#xeb; r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sishme p&#xeb;r llojllojshm&#xeb;rin&#xeb; e bim&#xeb;ve.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"adt-body text-left leading-relaxed\"><span data-id=\"pg092_n0033\">5. Kosova &#xeb;sht&#xeb; e pasur me lloje t&#xeb; ndryshme bimore.</span></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"w-1/2 align-top border-2 border-green-400 px-4 py-4 max-lg:block max-lg:w-full\">\n            <ul class=\"space-y-8 mb-6\">\n              <li class=\"adt-body text-left leading-relaxed\"><span data-id=\"pg092_n0037\">1. Th&#xeb;ngjilli linjit, i cili shfryt&#xeb;zohet p&#xeb;r prodhimin e energjis&#xeb; elektrike n&#xeb; Termocentralin &#x201c;Kosova&#x201d;.</span></li>\n              <li class=\"adt-body text-left leading-relaxed\"><span data-id=\"pg092_n0039\">2. Ka shum&#xeb; minerale e m&#xeb; s&#xeb; shumti plumb, i cili nxirret nga minierat e Trep&#xe7;&#xeb;s n&#xeb; Mitrovic&#xeb;.</span></li>\n              <li class=\"adt-body text-left leading-relaxed\"><span data-id=\"pg092_n0041\">3. Xehe t&#xeb; shumta.</span></li>\n            </ul>\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 max-sm:grid-cols-1\">\n              <img data-id=\"pg092_im001\" src=\"images/pg092_im001.png\" alt=\"Termocentrali &#x201c;Kosova&#x201d; me oxhaqe t&#xeb; larta, ku shfryt&#xeb;zohet th&#xeb;ngjilli p&#xeb;r prodhimin e energjis&#xeb; elektrike.\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-sm shadow-sm object-cover\">\n              <img data-id=\"pg092_im002\" src=\"images/pg092_im002.png\" alt=\"Hyrja e nj&#xeb; miniere n&#xeb; Trep&#xe7;&#xeb;, q&#xeb; lidhet me nxjerrjen e mineraleve n&#xeb; Mitrovic&#xeb;.\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-sm shadow-sm object-cover\">\n            </div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"adt-body text-left leading-relaxed\">\n      <span data-id=\"pg092_n0043\">Buna: Uaaa, nuk e kam ditur q&#xeb; vendi yn&#xeb; ka kaq shum&#xeb; pasuri natyrore.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg092_n0044\">Faleminderit, Rita!</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg092_n0045\">Besoj q&#xeb; me k&#xeb;to informacione artikulli im do t&#xeb; informoj&#xeb; shum&#xeb; njer&#xeb;z p&#xeb;r pasurit&#xeb; tona natyrore!</span>\n    </p>\n  </section>\n</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg093_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg093_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"118\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 bg-white 