n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mt-5 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 gap-y-7 max-lg:grid-cols-1 max-lg:gap-5\">\n      <img data-id=\"pg093_im001\" src=\"images/pg093_im001.png\" alt=\"Uj&#xeb;var&#xeb; q&#xeb; derdhet n&#xeb; nj&#xeb; pellg t&#xeb; vog&#xeb;l mes shk&#xeb;mbinjve dhe pem&#xeb;ve.\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-sm object-cover shadow-sm\">\n      <img data-id=\"pg093_im002\" src=\"images/pg093_im002.png\" alt=\"Liqe i qet&#xeb; i rrethuar me kodra t&#xeb; gjelbra n&#xeb;n nj&#xeb; qiell me re.\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-sm object-cover shadow-sm self-start\">\n      <figure class=\"flex flex-col items-center\">\n        <img data-id=\"pg093_im004\" src=\"images/pg093_im004.png\" alt=\"Drini i Bardh&#xeb; duke rrjedhur me vrull mes shk&#xeb;mbinjve t&#xeb; mbuluar me myshk n&#xeb; pyll.\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-sm object-cover shadow-sm\">\n        <figcaption data-id=\"pg093_n0006\" class=\"adt-caption mt-2 text-center text-neutral-700\">Drini i Bardh&#xeb;</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n      <img data-id=\"pg093_im003\" src=\"images/pg093_im003.png\" alt=\"Platform&#xeb; druri p&#xeb;r peshkim mbi liqen, me kodra t&#xeb; pyll&#xeb;zuara n&#xeb; sfond.\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-sm object-cover shadow-sm self-start\">\n    </div>\n\n    <aside class=\"mt-10 relative bg-purple-200/90 overflow-hidden max-sm:mt-8 max-sm:pt-12\">\n      <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute right-0 top-0 h-full w-20 bg-purple-500 flex items-start justify-center pt-4 text-white max-sm:h-12 max-sm:w-full max-sm:justify-start max-sm:pl-4 max-sm:pt-3\">?</div>\n      <div class=\"p-4 pr-24 max-sm:p-4 max-sm:pr-4\">\n        <div class=\"space-y-4 max-sm:space-y-3\">\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"adt-body text-neutral-800\">\n              <span data-id=\"pg093_n0010\">Bisedoni rreth situat&#xeb;s s&#xeb; dh&#xeb;n&#xeb;.</span>\n            </div>\n            <label for=\"item-1\" class=\"sr-only\">Bisedoni rreth situat&#xeb;s s&#xeb; dh&#xeb;n&#xeb;.</label>\n            <textarea id=\"item-1\" data-activity-item=\"item-1\" aria-label=\"Bisedoni rreth situat&#xeb;s s&#xeb; dh&#xeb;n&#xeb;.\" class=\"mt-2 w-full min-h-11 rounded-lg border border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-neutral-800 outline-none focus:border-purple-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-200\"></textarea>\n          </div>\n\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"adt-body text-neutral-800\">\n              <span data-id=\"pg093_n0012\">Me &#xe7;far&#xeb; &#xeb;sht&#xeb; e pasur Kosova?</span>\n            </div>\n            <label for=\"item-2\" class=\"sr-only\">Me &#xe7;far&#xeb; &#xeb;sht&#xeb; e pasur Kosova?</label>\n            <input id=\"item-2\" data-activity-item=\"item-2\" type=\"text\" aria-label=\"Me &#xe7;far&#xeb; &#xeb;sht&#xeb; e pasur Kosova?\" class=\"mt-2 w-full min-h-11 rounded-lg border border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-neutral-800 outline-none focus:border-purple-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-200\">\n          </div>\n\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"adt-body text-neutral-800\">\n              <span data-id=\"pg093_n0014\">P&#xeb;rmendni lumin ose liqenin artificial q&#xeb; gjendet n&#xeb; rajonin ku jetoni ju.</span>\n            </div>\n            <label for=\"item-3\" class=\"sr-only\">P&#xeb;rmendni lumin ose liqenin artificial q&#xeb; gjendet n&#xeb; rajonin ku jetoni ju.</label>\n            <input id=\"item-3\" data-activity-item=\"item-3\" type=\"text\" aria-label=\"P&#xeb;rmendni lumin ose liqenin artificial q&#xeb; gjendet n&#xeb; rajonin ku jetoni ju.\" class=\"mt-2 w-full min-h-11 rounded-lg border border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-neutral-800 outline-none focus:border-purple-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-200\">\n          </div>\n\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"adt-body text-neutral-800\">\n              <span data-id=\"pg093_n0016\">Pse duhet t&#xeb; kemi kujdes p&#xeb;r ruajtjen e pasurive natyrore?</span>\n            </div>\n            <label for=\"item-4\" class=\"sr-only\">Pse duhet t&#xeb; kemi kujdes p&#xeb;r ruajtjen e pasurive natyrore?</label>\n            <textarea id=\"item-4\" data-activity-item=\"item-4\" aria-label=\"Pse duhet t&#xeb; kemi kujdes p&#xeb;r ruajtjen e pasurive natyrore?\" class=\"mt-2 w-full min-h-11 rounded-lg border border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-neutral-800 outline-none focus:border-purple-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-200\"></textarea>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n\n    <div class=\"mt-10 border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white relative max-sm:mt-8\">\n      <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute right-0 top-0 bg-purple-400 text-white px-5 py-3 max-sm:px-4\">&#x1f4d6;</div>\n      <p class=\"adt-body italic leading-relaxed text-neutral-800 p-5 pr-28 max-sm:pr-5\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg093_n0019\">Pasuri natyrore jan&#xeb; t&#xeb; mirat materiale q&#xeb; gjenden n&#xeb; natyr&#xeb; dhe q&#xeb; mund t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rdoren nga njeriu p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rmir&#xeb;suar jet&#xeb;n e tij.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg093_n0020\">Kosova, edhe pse &#xeb;sht&#xeb; nj&#xeb; vend me nj&#xeb; sip&#xeb;rfaqe t&#xeb; vog&#xeb;l, ka pasuri t&#xeb; shumta natyrore.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg093_n0021\">Nj&#xeb; pjes&#xeb; e tyre &#xeb;sht&#xeb; p&#xeb;rdorur p&#xeb;r zhvillimin ekonomik, kurse pjesa tjet&#xeb;r mund t&#xeb; shfryt&#xeb;zohet n&#xeb; t&#xeb; ardhmen.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg093_n0022\">Kosova &#xeb;sht&#xeb; e pasur me toka t&#xeb; punueshme, q&#xeb; shfryt&#xeb;zohen p&#xeb;r kultivimin e drith&#xeb;rave, t&#xeb; perimeve e t&#xeb; frutave.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg093_n0023\">Nd&#xeb;r pasurit&#xeb; e Kosov&#xeb;s jan&#xeb; edhe lumenjt&#xeb;, liqenet, pyjet dhe pasurit&#xeb; n&#xeb;ntok&#xeb;sore.</span>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"adt-body mt-3 text-neutral-800\">\n      <span data-id=\"pg093_n0024\">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e: pasuri natyrore, uj&#xeb;, lum&#xeb;, liqen, tok&#xeb;, pyll.</span>\n    </p>\n  </section>\n</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg094_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg094_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"119\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container opacity-0\"><section data-section-type=\"text_and_single_image\" data-section-id=\"pg094_sec001\" class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 py-8 bg-white text-neutral-800\">\n  <div class=\"w-full mb-10\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-start max-sm:block\">\n      <div class=\"w-36 min-h-40 rounded-l-2xl bg-purple-500 flex items-center justify-center max-lg:min-h-36 max-sm:w-full max-sm:min-h-24 max-sm:rounded-t-2xl max-sm:rounded-b-none\">\n        <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-bold leading-none text-white\">&#x2733;</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex-1 pt-4 max-sm:pt-0\">\n        <div class=\"h-12 bg-purple-500 rounded-r-2xl max-sm:rounded-t-none max-sm:rounded-r-none\"></div>\n        <div class=\"pt-5 pb-3 border-b-4 border-purple-400\">\n          <h1 class=\"adt-h2 font-semibold text-left\" data-id=\"pg094_n0003\">Shfryt&#xeb;zimi i pasurive n&#xeb;ntok&#xeb;sore</h1>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mb-8\">\n    <div class=\"mb-5\">\n      <h3 class=\"adt-h3 inline-block bg-green-400 px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-left\" data-id=\"pg094_n0005\">Situata 1.</h3>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed text-left mb-3\">\n      <span data-id=\"pg094_n0007\">Pas mb&#xeb;rritjes s&#xeb; fundit t&#xeb; turist&#xeb;ve, udh&#xeb;rr&#xeb;fyesi u drejtua p&#xeb;r te grupi japonez dhe filloi bisedimin me ta.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg094_n0008\">Ai nuk e dinte arsyen p&#xeb;rse ky grup kishte ardhur prej s&#xeb; largu n&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;, prandaj menj&#xeb;her&#xeb; u interesua q&#xeb; ta shuante k&#xeb;t&#xeb; kureshtje.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed text-left mb-3\">\n      <span data-id=\"pg094_n0010\">- P&#xeb;rsh&#xeb;ndetje dhe mir&#xeb; se erdh&#xeb;t n&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;!</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg094_n0011\">Jam i lumtur q&#xeb; keni ardhur n&#xeb; shtetin ton&#xeb;.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed text-left mb-3\">\n      <span data-id=\"pg094_n0013\">- Konnichiwa (p&#xeb;rsh&#xeb;ndetje), faleminderit shum&#xeb; p&#xeb;r mikpritjen!</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg094_n0014\">Shpresoj t&#xeb; kalojm&#xeb; mir&#xeb; s&#xeb; bashku!</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed text-left mb-3\">\n      <span data-id=\"pg094_n0016\">- Meq&#xeb; jemi duke biseduar, mund t&#x2019;ju pyes pse zgjodh&#xeb;t pik&#xeb;risht Kosov&#xeb;n p&#xeb;r ta vizituar?</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed text-left mb-3\">\n      <span data-id=\"pg094_n0018\">- Ne jemi duke b&#xeb;r&#xeb; disa hulumtime p&#xeb;r pasurit&#xeb; n&#xeb;ntok&#xeb;sore t&#xeb; vendeve t&#xeb; Evrop&#xeb;s dhe, nd&#xeb;r to, zgjodh&#xeb;m edhe Kosov&#xeb;n.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg094_n0019\">P&#xeb;r pasurit&#xeb; n&#xeb;ntok&#xeb;sore t&#xeb; vendit tuaj nuk kishte shum&#xeb; informacione n&#xeb; internet, prandaj ato q&#xeb; do t&#x2019;i m&#xeb;sojm&#xeb; gjat&#xeb; koh&#xeb;s sa jemi k&#xeb;tu do t&#x2019;i shfaqim n&#xeb; uebfaqe.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed text-left mb-3\">\n      <span data-id=\"pg094_n0021\">- Para se t&#x2019;i vizitojm&#xeb; vendet q&#xeb; ju nevojiten p&#xeb;r hulumtim, mund t&#x2019;ju tregoj n&#xeb; pika t&#xeb; shkurtra p&#xeb;r pasurit&#xeb; tona n&#xeb;ntok&#xeb;sore.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg094_n0022\">Kosova ka nj&#xeb; n&#xeb;ntok&#xeb; mjaft t&#xeb; pasur, duke filluar nga th&#xeb;ngjilli linjit - me sasi m&#xeb; t&#xeb; madhe, i cili shfryt&#xeb;zohet p&#xeb;r prodhimin e energjis&#xeb; elektrike n&#xeb; Termocentralin &#x201c;Kosova A&#x201d; dhe &#x201c;Kosova B&#x201d;, minerale t&#xeb; plumbit, t&#xeb; zinkut, t&#xeb; argjendit, t&#xeb; arit e shum&#xeb; t&#xeb; tjera.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg094_n0023\">Miniera m&#xeb; aktive &#xeb;sht&#xeb; &#x201c;Trep&#xe7;a&#x201d;, e cila ndodhet n&#xeb; Mitrovic&#xeb;.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed text-left mb-8\">\n      <span data-id=\"pg094_n0025\">- Sipas atyre q&#xeb; that&#xeb; ju, Kosova qenka mjaft e pasur me minerale.</span>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"clear-both\">\n    <img data-id=\"pg094_im001\" src=\"images/pg094_im001.png\" alt=\"Kat&#xeb;r turist&#xeb; t&#xeb; rinj, t&#xeb; veshur n&#xeb; m&#xeb;nyr&#xeb; formale, bisedojn&#xeb; t&#xeb; buz&#xeb;qeshur gjat&#xeb; nj&#xeb; vizite n&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;.\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n  </div>\n</section></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg095_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg095_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"120\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-4 py-8 bg-white opacity-0\">\n  <section data-section-type=\"text_and_single_image\" data-section-id=\"pg095_sec001\" class=\"space-y-8 text-left text-zinc-800\">\n    <div class=\"px-4\">\n      <div class=\"bg-purple-500/20 rounded-[1.75rem] border-l-8 border-purple-500 px-6 py-5 max-sm:px-5 max-sm:py-4 max-sm:max-w-[18rem]\">\n        <h1 data-id=\"pg095_n0003\" class=\"adt-h2 font-bold text-zinc-900\">Shfryt&#xeb;zimi i pasurive n&#xeb;ntok&#xeb;sore</h1>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mt-3 h-1 w-56 bg-purple-400 max-sm:w-40\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <aside class=\"mx-4 bg-purple-200/70 px-5 py-5 max-sm:px-4 rounded-none shadow-sm relative\">\n      <div class=\"absolute right-0 top-0 h-16 w-24 bg-purple-500/80 max-sm:w-20\"></div>\n      <div class=\"relative z-10 space-y-5\">\n        <ul class=\"space-y-5 list-none\">\n          <li>\n            <p class=\"adt-body\"><span data-id=\"pg095_n0007\">Bisedoni p&#xeb;r situat&#xeb;n e dh&#xeb;n&#xeb;.</span></p>\n            <label for=\"item-1\" class=\"sr-only\">Bisedoni p&#xeb;r situat&#xeb;n e dh&#xeb;n&#xeb;.</label>\n            <textarea id=\"item-1\" data-activity-item=\"item-1\" aria-label=\"Bisedoni p&#xeb;r situat&#xeb;n e dh&#xeb;n&#xeb;.\" class=\"mt-2 w-full min-h-11 h-24 rounded-xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white/95 px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\"></textarea>\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            <p class=\"adt-body\"><span data-id=\"pg095_n0009\">Cilat jan&#xeb; pasurit&#xeb; n&#xeb;ntok&#xeb;sore t&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;s?</span></p>\n            <label for=\"item-2\" class=\"sr-only\">Cilat jan&#xeb; pasurit&#xeb; n&#xeb;ntok&#xeb;sore t&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;s?</label>\n            <textarea id=\"item-2\" data-activity-item=\"item-2\" aria-label=\"Cilat jan&#xeb; pasurit&#xeb; n&#xeb;ntok&#xeb;sore t&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;s?\" class=\"mt-2 w-full min-h-11 h-24 rounded-xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white/95 px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\"></textarea>\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            <p class=\"adt-body\"><span data-id=\"pg095_n0011\">P&#xeb;rse p&#xeb;rdoren ato?</span></p>\n            <label for=\"item-3\" class=\"sr-only\">P&#xeb;rse p&#xeb;rdoren ato?</label>\n            <textarea id=\"item-3\" data-activity-item=\"item-3\" aria-label=\"P&#xeb;rse p&#xeb;rdoren ato?\" class=\"mt-2 w-full min-h-11 h-24 rounded-xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white/95 px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\"></textarea>\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            <p class=\"adt-body\"><span data-id=\"pg095_n0013\">A duhet t&#xeb; kemi kujdes n&#xeb; shfryt&#xeb;zimin e tyre?</span> <span data-id=\"pg095_n0014\">Pse?</span></p>\n            <label for=\"item-4\" class=\"sr-only\">A duhet t&#xeb; kemi kujdes n&#xeb; shfryt&#xeb;zimin e tyre? Pse?</label>\n            <textarea id=\"item-4\" data-activity-item=\"item-4\" aria-label=\"A duhet t&#xeb; kemi kujdes n&#xeb; shfryt&#xeb;zimin e tyre? Pse?\" class=\"mt-2 w-full min-h-11 h-24 rounded-xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white/95 px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\"></textarea>\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            <p class=\"adt-body\"><span data-id=\"pg095_n0016\">A mendon edhe ti se me gjith&#xeb; k&#xeb;to pasuri n&#xeb;ntok&#xeb;sore mund t&#xeb; zhvillohet m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; ekonomia e vendit ton&#xeb;?</span></p>\n            <label for=\"item-5\" class=\"sr-only\">A mendon edhe ti se me gjith&#xeb; k&#xeb;to pasuri n&#xeb;ntok&#xeb;sore mund t&#xeb; zhvillohet m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; ekonomia e vendit ton&#xeb;?</label>\n            <textarea id=\"item-5\" data-activity-item=\"item-5\" aria-label=\"A mendon edhe ti se me gjith&#xeb; k&#xeb;to pasuri n&#xeb;ntok&#xeb;sore mund t&#xeb; zhvillohet m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; ekonomia e vendit ton&#xeb;?\" class=\"mt-2 w-full min-h-11 h-24 rounded-xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white/95 px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\"></textarea>\n          </li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n\n    <div class=\"mx-3 border-2 border-purple-400 bg-white px-5 py-4 relative overflow-hidden\">\n      <div class=\"absolute right-0 top-0 h-16 w-28 bg-purple-500/80 z-0 max-sm:h-14 max-sm:w-20\"></div>\n      <p class=\"adt-body italic leading-relaxed text-zinc-800 relative z-10 pr-32 max-sm:pr-0 max-sm:pt-12\"><span data-id=\"pg095_n0019\">Kosova ka shum&#xeb; pasuri natyrore.</span> <span data-id=\"pg095_n0020\">Pasurit&#xeb; natyrore q&#xeb; nxirren nga toka quhen pasuri n&#xeb;ntok&#xeb;sore.</span> <span data-id=\"pg095_n0021\">Zbulimi, shfryt&#xeb;zimi dhe p&#xeb;rpunimi i tyre jan&#xeb; shum&#xeb; t&#xeb; r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sishme p&#xeb;r ekonomin&#xeb; e vendit.</span> <span data-id=\"pg095_n0022\">Pasurit&#xeb; n&#xeb;ntok&#xeb;sore jan&#xeb;: shk&#xeb;mbinjt&#xeb;, mineralet, xehet dhe l&#xeb;nd&#xeb;t djeg&#xeb;se.</span> <span data-id=\"pg095_n0023\">L&#xeb;nd&#xeb;t djeg&#xeb;se jan&#xeb;: th&#xeb;ngjilli, nafta dhe gazi natyror.</span> <span data-id=\"pg095_n0024\">Kosova &#xeb;sht&#xeb; e pasur me th&#xeb;ngjill, nga i cili prodhohet energjia elektrike n&#xeb; Termocentralin e Kosov&#xeb;s.</span> <span data-id=\"pg095_n0025\">Ka shum&#xeb; minerale e m&#xeb; s&#xeb; shumti plumb, q&#xeb; nxirret nga minierat e Trep&#xe7;&#xeb;s n&#xeb; Mitrovic&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id=\"pg095_n0026\">Tregohet interesim i madh p&#xeb;r gjetjen e gazit natyror n&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb; dhe shfryt&#xeb;zimin e tij p&#xeb;r prodhimin e energjis&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id=\"pg095_n0027\">K&#xeb;to pasuri duhen shfryt&#xeb;zuar sa m&#xeb; arsyesh&#xeb;m, sepse harxhimi i pakontrolluar i tyre shkakton humbje, duke qen&#xeb; se k&#xeb;to pasuri jan&#xeb; t&#xeb; parip&#xeb;rt&#xeb;ritshme.</span></p>\n    </div>\n\n    <figure class=\"space-y-0\">\n      <img data-id=\"pg095_im002\" src=\"images/pg095_im002.png\" alt=\"Termocentrali n&#xeb; Obiliq me oxhaqe t&#xeb; larta q&#xeb; nxjerrin tym gjat&#xeb; prodhimit t&#xeb; energjis&#xeb; elektrike nga th&#xeb;ngjilli.\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover\">\n      <figcaption data-id=\"pg095_n0029\" class=\"adt-caption bg-white/90 text-zinc-700 px-4 py-3\">Prodhimi i energjis&#xeb; elektrike me th&#xeb;ngjill n&#xeb; termocentrale, Obiliq</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n\n    <div class=\"px-4 pb-2\">\n      <p class=\"adt-body\"><span data-id=\"pg095_n0031\" class=\"font-semibold\">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e:</span> <span data-id=\"pg095_n0032\">pasuri n&#xeb;ntok&#xeb;sore, minerale, minier&#xeb;, l&#xeb;nd&#xeb; djeg&#xeb;se, th&#xeb;ngjill.</span></p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg096_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg096_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"121\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 py-8 bg-white opacity-0\">\n  <section data-section-type=\"text_only\" data-section-id=\"pg096_sec001\" class=\"w-full\">\n    <div class=\"mb-8 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-purple-200 bg-purple-100\">\n      <div class=\"bg-purple-500 px-6 py-4\">\n        <h1 class=\"adt-h2 font-semibold text-white\" data-id=\"pg096_n0003\">Shfryt&#xeb;zimi i pasurive mbitok&#xeb;sore</h1>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-b from-green-50 to-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-green-100\">\n      <div class=\"mb-5 inline-block rounded-xl bg-green-400 px-4 py-2\">\n        <h3 class=\"adt-h3 font-semibold text-slate-900\" data-id=\"pg096_n0005\">Situata 1.</h3>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"adt-body mb-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-800\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg096_n0006\">Nj&#xeb; dit&#xeb; Rona dhe Miri kishin m&#xeb;suar p&#xeb;r pasurit&#xeb; mbitok&#xeb;sore t&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;s.</span> <span data-id=\"pg096_n0007\">P&#xeb;r shkak se ishte shum&#xeb; i lodhur, Miri nuk e kishte kuptuar shum&#xeb; mir&#xeb; k&#xeb;t&#xeb; m&#xeb;sim.</span> <span data-id=\"pg096_n0008\">- Jo! Nuk arrij ta kuptoj dot! Rona, a mund t&#xeb; m&#x2019;i p&#xeb;rmend&#xeb;sh edhe nj&#xeb; her&#xeb; disa shembuj?</span> <span data-id=\"pg096_n0009\">- Po, sigurisht.</span> <span data-id=\"pg096_n0010\">Pasurit&#xeb; mbitok&#xeb;sore jan&#xeb; t&#xeb; gjitha pasurit&#xeb; q&#xeb; gjenden mbi sip&#xeb;rfaqen e tok&#xeb;s.</span>\n      </p>\n\n      <p class=\"adt-body mb-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-800\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg096_n0011\">Pjesa m&#xeb; e madhe e tok&#xeb;s n&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;, m&#xeb; tep&#xeb;r se gjysma e saj, &#xeb;sht&#xeb; tok&#xeb; e punueshme, nga e cila mund&#xeb;sohet zhvillimi i bujq&#xeb;sis&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id=\"pg096_n0012\">Pjesa tjet&#xeb;r &#xeb;sht&#xeb; tok&#xeb; pyjore me malet m&#xeb; t&#xeb; njohura q&#xeb; jan&#xeb;: Bjeshk&#xeb;t e Nemuna, malet e Sharrit, malet e Pashtrikut e shum&#xeb; male t&#xeb; tjera.</span>\n      </p>\n\n      <p class=\"adt-body mb-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-800\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg096_n0013\">- Rona, m&#xeb; duket se p&#xeb;rve&#xe7; tokave, p&#xeb;rmend&#xeb;m edhe faktor&#xeb; t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb; q&#xeb; pasurojn&#xeb; vendin ton&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id=\"pg096_n0014\">- Po, pasuri tjet&#xeb;r &#xeb;sht&#xeb; edhe druri.</span> <span data-id=\"pg096_n0015\">&#xcb;sht&#xeb; shum&#xeb; e r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sishme q&#xeb; prerja e drur&#xeb;ve t&#xeb; b&#xeb;het n&#xeb; m&#xeb;nyr&#xeb; t&#xeb; kontrolluar.</span>\n      </p>\n\n      <p class=\"adt-body mb-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-800\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg096_n0016\">- E m&#xeb; pas fol&#xeb;m p&#xeb;r pasurit&#xeb; ujore.</span> <span data-id=\"pg096_n0017\">- Aq sa di un&#xeb;, pasurit&#xeb; ujore p&#xeb;rfshijn&#xeb; liqenet, lumenjt&#xeb;, uj&#xeb;rat minerale dhe termike.</span> <span data-id=\"pg096_n0018\">- T&#xeb; lumt&#xeb;, Rona!</span>\n      </p>\n\n      <p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed text-slate-800\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg096_n0019\">- Cili &#xeb;sht&#xeb; lumi m&#xeb; i gjat&#xeb; nga k&#xeb;ta q&#xeb; p&#xeb;rmende?</span> <span data-id=\"pg096_n0020\">- Drini i Bardh&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id=\"pg096_n0021\">- Po uj&#xeb;rat minerale dhe termike?</span> <span data-id=\"pg096_n0022\">- Uj&#xeb;rat kryesore minerale dhe termike njihen si banja sh&#xeb;ruese, pasi p&#xeb;rmbajn&#xeb; minerale dhe shum&#xeb; njer&#xeb;z gjejn&#xeb; sh&#xeb;rim n&#xeb; k&#xeb;to uj&#xeb;ra.</span>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg096_sec002.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg096_sec002\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n   