&#xeb; vendit ton&#xeb;?</span>\n          </p>\n          <label for=\"activity-item-5\" class=\"sr-only\">- Cil&#xeb;t jan&#xeb; lumenjt&#xeb; m&#xeb; t&#xeb; m&#xeb;dhenj t&#xeb; vendit ton&#xeb;?</label>\n          <textarea id=\"activity-item-5\" data-activity-item=\"item-5\" aria-label=\"- Cil&#xeb;t jan&#xeb; lumenjt&#xeb; m&#xeb; t&#xeb; m&#xeb;dhenj t&#xeb; vendit ton&#xeb;?\" class=\"min-h-24 w-full rounded border border-[#c8b3cb] bg-white px-3 py-3 text-black outline-none min-h-11 focus:border-[#a966ad]\"></textarea>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n      </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg096_sec003.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg096_sec003\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"123\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <h1 class=\"sr-only\" id=\"page-heading\">Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</h1>\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container opacity-0\"><section data-section-type=\"boxed_text\" data-section-id=\"pg096_sec003\" class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-4 py-8 bg-white\"><div class=\"border-2 border-purple-400 bg-white overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"flex items-stretch max-sm:flex-col\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-44 max-lg:w-36 max-sm:w-full shrink-0 bg-purple-500 flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-5 max-sm:py-4\"><div class=\"h-16 w-16 max-sm:h-14 max-sm:w-14 rounded-sm border-2 border-white/80 bg-white/10\"></div></div><div class=\"flex-1 px-7 py-5 max-lg:px-5 max-lg:py-4 max-sm:px-4 max-sm:py-4\"><p class=\"adt-body text-left italic leading-relaxed text-gray-800\"><span data-id=\"pg096_n0031\">Pasurit&#xeb; mbitok&#xeb;sore jan&#xeb; t&#xeb; gjitha pasurit&#xeb; q&#xeb; gjenden mbi sip&#xeb;rfaqen e tok&#xeb;s.</span> <span data-id=\"pg096_n0032\">Pasuri mbitok&#xeb;sore jan&#xeb;: uj&#xeb;rat (lumenjt&#xeb;, liqenet, detet, oqeanet), fushat, malet, kafsh&#xeb;t e bim&#xeb;t.</span> <span data-id=\"pg096_n0033\">Pasurit&#xeb; mbitok&#xeb;sore jan&#xeb; pasuri q&#xeb; ndikojn&#xeb; n&#xeb; zhvillimin ekonomik t&#xeb; vendit.</span> <span data-id=\"pg096_n0034\">Druri karakterizohet si burim kryesor i ngrohjes dhe i prodhimit t&#xeb; shum&#xeb; sendeve n&#xeb; dobi t&#xeb; njeriut.</span> <span data-id=\"pg096_n0035\">Pasurit&#xeb; ujore p&#xeb;rfshijn&#xeb; liqenet, lumenjt&#xeb;, uj&#xeb;rat minerale dhe termike.</span> <span data-id=\"pg096_n0036\">Liqenet m&#xeb; t&#xeb; njohura jan&#xeb;: liqeni i Radoniqit, i Ujmanit, ai i Batllav&#xeb;s, i P&#xeb;rlepnic&#xeb;s dhe i Badovcit.</span> <span data-id=\"pg096_n0037\">Nd&#xeb;rsa, lumenjt&#xeb; kryesor&#xeb; jan&#xeb;: Drini i Bardh&#xeb;, Lepenci, Morava dhe Ibri.</span> <span data-id=\"pg096_n0038\">Uj&#xeb;rat kryesore minerale dhe termike jan&#xeb; Banja e Pej&#xeb;s, Banjska dhe Banja e Kllokotit.</span> <span data-id=\"pg096_n0039\">T&#xeb; gjitha k&#xeb;to njihen si banja termale sh&#xeb;ruese, t&#xeb; cilat shfryt&#xeb;zohen p&#xeb;r sh&#xeb;rimin e shum&#xeb; s&#xeb;mundjeve.</span></p></div></div></div></section></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg097_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg097_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"124\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container opacity-0\">\n  <section data-section-type=\"text_and_single_image\" data-section-id=\"pg097_sec001\" class=\"w-full bg-white\">\n    <div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-6 py-8 max-sm:px-5\">\n      <div class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-[#8ecbe6]\">\n        <figure 