 <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg102_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"131\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 bg-white opacity-0\">\n  <section data-section-type=\"text_and_single_image\" data-section-id=\"pg102_sec001\" class=\"py-8 max-sm:py-5\">\n    <div class=\"w-full overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-purple-300\">\n      <div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-5xl items-center gap-6 px-8 py-6 max-lg:flex-col max-lg:items-start max-sm:px-5 max-sm:py-5\">\n        <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex h-28 w-28 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-purple-500 text-white\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" class=\"h-16 w-16 fill-current\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <path d=\"M31 8c-2 4-3 8-3 12 0 2 0 4 1 6-4-5-9-8-15-10 1 5 5 9 12 12-6 0-11 1-16 4 4 4 9 6 16 6-6 2-10 5-13 10 6 1 11 0 17-4v12h2V44c6 4 11 5 17 4-3-5-7-8-13-10 7 0 12-2 16-6-5-3-10-4-16-4 7-3 11-7 12-12-6 2-11 5-15 10 1-2 1-4 1-6 0-4-1-8-3-12z\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex-1\">\n          <h1 data-id=\"pg102_n0003\" class=\"adt-h1 text-left font-bold text-white\">Resurset dhe trash&#xeb;gimia e vendit tim</h1>\n          <div class=\"mt-3 inline-block border-b-4 border-purple-400 bg-white/95 px-2 py-2\">\n            <h2 data-id=\"pg102_n0004\" class=\"adt-h2 text-left font-semibold text-gray-900\">Ruajm&#xeb; trash&#xeb;gimin&#xeb; kulturore</h2>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mt-10\">\n      <div class=\"mb-5 inline-block rounded-md bg-green-400 px-5 py-2 shadow-sm\">\n        <h3 data-id=\"pg102_n0005\" class=\"adt-h3 text-left font-semibold text-gray-900\">Situata 1.</h3>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"adt-body text-left leading-relaxed text-gray-800\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg102_n0007\">Familja Gashi kishte dal&#xeb; p&#xeb;r ta kaluar fundjav&#xeb;n n&#xeb; qytetin e Prizrenit.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg102_n0008\">H&#xeb;na, 10-vje&#xe7;are, po e shijonte shum&#xeb; at&#xeb; udh&#xeb;tim.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg102_n0009\">Kureshtja e saj u shtua kur pa gjith&#xeb; ato nd&#xeb;rtesa t&#xeb; vjetra: muze, kala dhe vende q&#xeb; p&#xeb;rfaq&#xeb;sonin denj&#xeb;sisht kultur&#xeb;n e vendit ton&#xeb;.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg102_n0010\">E kush tjet&#xeb;r do t&#xeb; mund t&#x2019;i jepte p&#xeb;rgjigje m&#xeb; t&#xeb; sakta sesa babai i saj, zejtar n&#xeb; qytetin e Gjakov&#xeb;s!</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg102_n0011\">- Babi, a mund t&#xeb; m&#xeb; tregosh prap&#xeb; se &#xe7;ka konsiderohet trash&#xeb;gimi kulturore?</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg102_n0012\">- Po, H&#xeb;na.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg102_n0013\">T&#xeb; gjitha parqet natyrore, galerit&#xeb; e artit, kalat&#xeb;, kullat, sht&#xeb;pit&#xeb; e vjetra, monumentet fetare, rrugicat e ngushta, shat&#xeb;rvan&#xeb;t dhe shum&#xeb; objekte t&#xeb; tjera jan&#xeb; elemente q&#xeb; kan&#xeb; r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;si t&#xeb; madhe p&#xeb;r ruajtjen e kultur&#xeb;s dhe t&#xeb; tradit&#xeb;s shqiptare.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg102_n0014\">- T&#xeb; gjitha k&#xeb;to q&#xeb; i p&#xeb;rmende qenkan objekte.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg102_n0015\">A ka edhe gj&#xeb;ra t&#xeb; tjera q&#xeb; p&#xeb;rfaq&#xeb;sojn&#xeb; trash&#xeb;gimin&#xeb; kulturore?</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg102_n0016\">- Po, sigurisht.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg102_n0017\">Trash&#xeb;gimia jomateriale p&#xeb;rfshin gjuh&#xeb;n dhe krijimtarit&#xeb; popullore.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg102_n0018\">- Cilat jan&#xeb; disa nga monumentet kryesore arkeologjike?</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg102_n0019\">- Mund t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rmendim qytetin e lasht&#xeb; t&#xeb; Ulpian&#xeb;s, Manastirin e De&#xe7;anit dhe Sht&#xeb;pin&#xeb; e Lidhjes s&#xeb; Prizrenit.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg102_n0020\">Kosova ka edhe shum&#xeb; muze.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg102_n0021\">Veshjet dhe gatimet tradicionale q&#xeb; p&#xeb;rcillen brez pas brezi jan&#xeb; mjaft unike.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg102_n0022\">- E mrekullueshme.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg102_n0023\">Mezi po pres q&#xeb; p&#xeb;r gj&#xeb;rat q&#xeb; m&#xeb;sova sot, t&#xeb; bisedoj me shok&#xeb;t dhe m&#xeb;suesen n&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;.</span>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <aside class=\"mt-8 rounded-2xl bg-purple-100 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-purple-200\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-stretch max-lg:flex-col\">\n        <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex w-24 items-center justify-center rounded-l-2xl bg-purple-500 font-bold text-white max-lg:w-full max-lg:rounded-t-2xl max-lg:rounded-l-none\">?</div>\n        <div class=\"flex-1 space-y-4 p-5\">\n          <div>\n            <p data-id=\"pg102_n0025\" class=\"adt-body text-left text-gray-900\">- Bisedoni p&#xeb;r situat&#xeb;n e dh&#xeb;n&#xeb;.</p>\n            <label for=\"activity-item-1\" class=\"sr-only\">- Bisedoni p&#xeb;r situat&#xeb;n e dh&#xeb;n&#xeb;.</label>\n            <textarea id=\"activity-item-1\" data-activity-item=\"item-1\" aria-label=\"- Bisedoni p&#xeb;r situat&#xeb;n e dh&#xeb;n&#xeb;.\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-11 w-full rounded-xl border border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-gray-900 outline-none ring-0 placeholder:text-gray-400 focus:border-purple-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-200\"></textarea>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <p data-id=\"pg102_n0026\" class=\"adt-body text-left text-gray-900\">- &#xc7;far&#xeb; e p&#xeb;rb&#xeb;n trash&#xeb;gimin&#xeb; kulturore materiale?</p>\n            <label for=\"activity-item-2\" class=\"sr-only\">- &#xc7;far&#xeb; e p&#xeb;rb&#xeb;n trash&#xeb;gimin&#xeb; kulturore materiale?</label>\n            <textarea id=\"activity-item-2\" data-activity-item=\"item-2\" aria-label=\"- &#xc7;far&#xeb; e p&#xeb;rb&#xeb;n trash&#xeb;gimin&#xeb; kulturore materiale?\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-11 w-full rounded-xl border border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-gray-900 outline-none ring-0 placeholder:text-gray-400 focus:border-purple-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-200\"></textarea>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n\n    <figure class=\"mt-8 clear-both overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-lg ring-1 ring-gray-200\">\n      <img data-id=\"pg102_im001\" src=\"images/pg102_im001.png\" alt=\"Pamje ajrore e nj&#xeb; kalaje t&#xeb; vjet&#xeb;r me mure guri n&#xeb; kod&#xeb;r, pran&#xeb; sht&#xeb;pive t&#xeb; qytetit, si pjes&#xeb; e trash&#xeb;gimis&#xeb; kulturore.\" class=\"block w-full h-auto\">\n    </figure>\n  </section>\n</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg103_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg103_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"132\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container opacity-0\"><section data-section-type=\"text_and_single_image\" data-section-id=\"pg103_sec001\" class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 py-8 bg-white text-slate-800\">\n  <div class=\"-mx-8 max-sm:-mx-5 bg-purple-500\">\n    <div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 py-6 flex items-center justify-between gap-6 max-lg:flex-col max-lg:items-start\">\n      <h1 class=\"adt-h1 font-bold text-white\" data-id=\"pg103_n0002\">Resurset dhe trash&#xeb;gimia e vendit tim</h1>\n      <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"shrink-0 w-24 h-24 rounded-2xl bg-purple-400/80 flex items-center justify-center text-white\">\n        <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&#x1f33e;</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-6\">\n    <h2 class=\"adt-h2 font-semibold text-slate-900 border-b-4 border-purple-400 pb-2 inline-block\" data-id=\"pg103_n0004\">Ruajm&#xeb; trash&#xeb;gimin&#xeb; kulturore</h2>\n  </div>\n\n  <aside class=\"mt-5 mb-6 rounded-2xl bg-purple-100 border border-purple-200 overflow-hidden shadow-sm\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-stretch\">\n      <div class=\"flex-1 p-5 max-sm:p-4\">\n        <ul class=\"space-y-3 list-none\">\n          <li class=\"adt-body flex items-start gap-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-purple-600\">&#x2013;</span><span data-id=\"pg103_n0008\">&#xc7;ka b&#xeb;n pjes&#xeb; n&#xeb; trash&#xeb;gimin&#xeb; kulturore jomateriale?</span></li>\n          <li class=\"adt-body flex items-start gap-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-purple-600\">&#x2013;</span><span data-id=\"pg103_n0010\">A duhet t&#xeb; krenohemi p&#xeb;r trash&#xeb;gimin&#xeb; kulturore t&#xeb; vendit ton&#xeb;? Pse?</span></li>\n          <li class=\"adt-body flex items-start gap-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-purple-600\">&#x2013;</span><span data-id=\"pg103_n0013\">Kur p&#xeb;rdoren m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; veshjet dhe gatimet tradicionale?</span></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-24 max-sm:w-20 bg-purple-400 flex items-center justify-center text-white\">\n        <span aria-hidden=\"true\">?</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </aside>\n\n  <div class=\"rounded-xl border-2 border-purple-300 p-5 pr-28 max-sm:pr-5 bg-white relative shadow-sm\">\n    <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-20 h-20 bg-purple-400 rounded-bl-2xl rounded-tr-xl flex items-center justify-center text-white max-sm:hidden\">&#x1f4d6;</div>\n    <p class=\"adt-body italic leading-relaxed text-slate-700\"><span data-id=\"pg103_n0016\">Kosova ka nj&#xeb; trash&#xeb;gimi kulturore t&#xeb; larmishme, e cila e b&#xeb;n nj&#xeb; vend t&#xeb;rheq&#xeb;s p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; vizitor&#xeb;t.</span> <span data-id=\"pg103_n0017\">&#xc7;do pjes&#xeb; e Kosov&#xeb;s ka nj&#xeb; trash&#xeb;gimi t&#xeb; pasur materiale me qendra arkeologjike, parqe natyrore, kala, kulla, monumente fetare, galeri t&#xeb; artit, rrug&#xeb; t&#xeb; ngushta me kalldr&#xeb;m, shat&#xeb;rvan&#xeb;, muze, sht&#xeb;pi t&#xeb; vjetra e objekte t&#xeb; tjera.</span></p>\n    <p class=\"adt-body italic leading-relaxed text-slate-700 mt-3\"><span data-id=\"pg103_n0019\">Kosova ka 7 muze aktiv&#xeb;, n&#xeb; t&#xeb; cil&#xeb;t ruhen shum&#xeb; monumente kulturore q&#xeb; tregojn&#xeb; p&#xeb;r historin&#xeb; e popullit ton&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id=\"pg103_n0020\">Nd&#xeb;r ta, vlen t&#xeb; theksohet Muzeu Historik Komb&#xeb;tar, Muzeu Etnologjik &#x201c;Emin Gjiku&#x201d;, Muzeu i Prizrenit, i cili fillimisht ka funksionuar si banj&#xeb; turke.</span> <span data-id=\"pg103_n0021\">Po ashtu, Kosova ka edhe Kompleksin Memorial &quot;Adem Jashari&#x201d;.</span></p>\n    <p class=\"adt-body italic leading-relaxed text-slate-700 mt-3\"><span data-id=\"pg103_n0023\">N&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb; ka edhe shum&#xeb; monumente t&#xeb; tjera.</span> <span data-id=\"pg103_n0024\">Shumica e monumenteve jan&#xeb; manastire, k&#xeb;shtjella, kisha dhe xhami.</span> <span data-id=\"pg103_n0025\">Nd&#xeb;r objektet arkeologjike vlen t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rmendet qyteti i lasht&#xeb; i Ulpian&#xeb;s.</span> <span data-id=\"pg103_n0026\">Gjithashtu, kemi Manastirin e De&#xe7;anit dhe Sht&#xeb;pin&#xeb; e Lidhjes s&#xeb; Prizrenit q&#xeb; p&#xeb;rb&#xeb;het nga kat&#xeb;r godina.</span></p>\n    <p class=\"adt-body italic leading-relaxed text-slate-700 mt-3\"><span data-id=\"pg103_n0028\">T&#xeb; gjitha k&#xeb;to objekte i takojn&#xeb; trash&#xeb;gimis&#xeb; kulturore materiale.</span> <span data-id=\"pg103_n0029\">K&#xeb;to objekte mbrohen me Ligjin p&#xeb;r Trash&#xeb;gimin&#xeb; Kulturore.</span></p>\n    <p class=\"adt-body italic leading-relaxed text-slate-700 mt-3\"><span data-id=\"pg103_n0031\">Trash&#xeb;gimia kulturore jomateriale p&#xeb;rfshin gjuh&#xeb;n, krijimtarit&#xeb; popullore, t&#xeb; cilat jan&#xeb; ruajtur dhe p&#xeb;rcjell&#xeb; nd&#xeb;r breza.</span></p>\n    <p class=\"adt-body italic leading-relaxed text-slate-700 mt-3\"><span data-id=\"pg103_n0033\">Nj&#xeb; vend t&#xeb; ve&#xe7;ant&#xeb; n&#xeb; trash&#xeb;gimin&#xeb; kulturore t&#xeb; vendit ton&#xeb; z&#xeb;n&#xeb; edhe veshjet dhe ushqimet tradicionale.</span></p>\n  </div>\n\n  <figure class=\"mt-8 relative\">\n    <img data-id=\"pg103_im001\" src=\"images/pg103_im001.png\" alt=\"Pamje ajrore e nj&#xeb; kalaje historike me mure guri dhe oborr t&#xeb; brendsh&#xeb;m, e rrethuar nga qyteti dhe nj&#xeb; xhami pran&#xeb; saj.\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-none shadow-md\">\n    <figcaption class=\"adt-caption absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-10 px-4 py-3 text-center text-white bg-black/45\"><span class=\"font-semibold\" data-id=\"pg103_n0035\">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e: trash&#xeb;gimi kulturore, objekt, muze, monument, veshje, ushqim.</span></figcaption>\n  </figure>\n</section></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg104_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg104_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"133\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container opacity-0\"><section data-section-type=\"text_and_single_image\" data-section-id=\"pg104_sec001\" class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl bg-white px-8 py-8 text-slate-900 max-lg:px-6 max-sm:px-5 max-sm:py-5\">\n  <div class=\"mb-10 flex items-start max-sm:flex-col max-sm:gap-0\">\n    <div class=\"flex w-36 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-l-2xl rounded-r-md bg-purple-500 py-10 max-lg:w-32 max-sm:w-full max-sm:rounded-3xl max-sm:py-6\">\n      <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative h-28 w-16\">\n        <span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-0.5 -translate-x-1/2 bg-white/90\"></span>\n        <span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-3 h-5 w-5 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full border-2 border-white\"></span>\n        <span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-7 h-4 w-8 -translate-x-[92%] rounded-full bg-white\"></span>\n        <span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-7 h-4 w-8 translate-x-[12%] rounded-full bg-white\"></span>\n        <span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-12 h-4 w-8 -translate-x-[92%] rounded-full bg-white\"></span>\n        <span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-12 h-4 w-8 translate-x-[12%] rounded-full bg-white\"></span>\n        <span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-[4.25rem] h-4 w-8 -translate-x-[92%] rounded-full bg-white\"></span>\n        <span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-[4.25rem] h-4 w-8 translate-x-[12%] rounded-full bg-white\"></span>\n        <span class=\"absolute left-1/2 bottom-3 h-4 w-8 -translate-x-[92%] rounded-full bg-white\"></span>\n        <span class=\"absolute left-1/2 bottom-3 h-4 w-8 translate-x-[12%] rounded-full bg-white\"></span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flex-1 pt-12 max-sm:w-full max-sm:pt-3\">\n      <div class=\"bg-purple-500 px-4 py-2 max-sm:rounded-t-xl max-sm:px-3\">\n        <h1 class=\"adt-h1 text-left font-bold text-white\" data-id=\"pg104_n0002\">Resurset dhe trash&#xeb;gimia e vendit tim</h1>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bg-white px-4 py-3 max-sm:border-x max-sm:border-b max-sm:border-purple-200 max-sm:rounded-b-xl max-sm:px-3\">\n        <h2 class=\"adt-h2 text-left font-medium text-slate-900\" data-id=\"pg104_n0003\">Kujdesi sh&#xeb;ndet&#xeb;sor</h2>\n        <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-3 h-1 w-3/5 bg-purple-400 max-lg:w-2/3 max-sm:w-3/4\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mb-8 overflow-hidden\">\n    <div class=\"float-left mr-6 mt-1 mb-2 max-w-[11rem] bg-green-400 px-4 py-2 max-sm:float-none max-sm:mr-0 max-sm:mb-4 max-sm:inline-block\">\n      <h3 class=\"adt-h3 text-left font-medium text-slate-900\" data-id=\"pg104_n0004\">Situata 1.</h3>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"adt-body text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-800\">\n      <span data-id=\"pg104_n0006\">Mali, &#xe7;do mbr&#xeb;mje, shkon n&#xeb; shtrat pasmesnate.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg104_n0007\">T&#xeb; nes&#xeb;rmen duhet t&#xeb; zgjohet n&#xeb; or&#xeb;n 07:00, p&#xeb;r t&#x2019;u p&#xeb;rgatitur p&#xeb;r shkoll&#xeb;.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg104_n0008\">Ai &#xe7;do mbr&#xeb;mje i l&#xeb; gati rrobat e shkoll&#xeb;s, k&#xeb;shtu q&#xeb; n&#xeb; m&#xeb;ngjes i vesh shpejt e shpejt, e shkon me vrap n&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg104_n0009\">Mali m&#xeb;ngjesin e ha n&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;, n&#xeb; or&#xeb;n 9 e 30 minuta.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg104_n0010\">Pas m&#xeb;simit, kthehet n&#xeb; sht&#xeb;pi i lodhur, ha drek&#xeb;n, l&#xeb;shon perdet e dritareve q&#xeb; t&#xeb; b&#xeb;het err&#xeb;sir&#xeb; dhe menj&#xeb;her&#xeb; shtrihet p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; b&#xeb;r&#xeb; gjumin e pasdites.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg104_n0011\">Shok&#xeb;t e th&#xeb;rrasin p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; luajtur futboll ose ndonj&#xeb; loj&#xeb; tjet&#xeb;r n&#xeb; aj&#xeb;r t&#xeb; past&#xeb;r, por ai asnj&#xeb;her&#xeb; nuk u bashkohet atyre, sepse i duhet t&#xeb; flej&#xeb;.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg104_n0012\">Pasi zgjohet, atij i p&#xeb;lqen t&#xeb; haj&#xeb; ushqime t&#xeb; shpejta dhe t&#xeb; pij&#xeb; pije t&#xeb; gazuara.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg104_n0013\">Nuk ha me orar dhe nuk pi mjaftuesh&#xeb;m uj&#xeb;.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg104_n0014\">T&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; jan&#xeb; t&#xeb; brengosur pse Mali &#xeb;sht&#xeb; shum&#xeb; i zbeht&#xeb; dhe nuk &#xeb;sht&#xeb; i sh&#xeb;ndetsh&#xeb;m.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg104_n0015\">Prind&#xeb;rit kan&#xeb; vendosur t&#xeb; nd&#xeb;rrojn&#xeb; shprehit&#xeb; e Malit, n&#xeb; m&#xeb;nyr&#xeb; q&#xeb; ai t&#xeb; b&#xeb;j&#xeb; nj&#xeb; jet&#xeb; m&#xeb; t&#xeb; sh&#xeb;ndetshme.</span>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-6 clear-both max-sm:mt-4\">\n    <img data-id=\"pg104_im001\" src=\"images/pg104_im001.png\" alt=\"Mali fle nat&#xeb;n n&#xeb; shtratin e tij, pran&#xeb; komodin&#xeb;s me or&#xeb; alarmi, nd&#xeb;rsa jasht&#xeb; dritares shihet h&#xeb;na dhe yjet.\" class=\"mx-auto block w-full h-auto max-w-[70rem]\">\n  </div>\n</section></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg105_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg105_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"134\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div class=\"container mx-auto max-w-5xl bg-white px-6 py-8 max-lg:px-6 max-sm:px-4 opacity-0\" id=\"content\"><section data-section-type=\"activity_open_ended_answer\" data-section-id=\"pg105_sec001\" class=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl\"><div class=\"mb-8\"><div class=\"flex items-stretch max-sm:block\"><div class=\"flex-1 bg-purple-500 px-6 py-4 text-white\"><h1 class=\"adt-h1 font-bold\" data-id=\"pg105_n0002\">Resurset dhe trash&#xeb;gimia e vendit tim</h1></div><div class=\"w-36 bg-purple-500 flex items-center justify-center max-sm:mt-3 max-sm:w-full max-sm:py-4\"><div class=\"text-white text-5xl leading-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#x273e;</div></div></div><div class=\"mt-5 ml-4 max-sm:ml-0\"><h2 class=\"adt-h2 text-gray-900\" data-id=\"pg105_n0004\">Kujdesi sh&#xeb;ndet&#xeb;sor</h2><div class=\"mt-2 h-1 w-96 bg-purple-400 max-sm:w-48\"></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-10 ml-4 mr-0 max-sm:ml-0\"><div class=\"flex overflow-hidden rounded-none bg-purple-100 border border-purple-100 max-sm:block\"><div class=\"flex-1 p-5\"><ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-800\"><li class=\"flex\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mr-2\">&#x2013;</span><span data-id=\"pg105_n0008\">Pse Mali &#xeb;sht&#xeb; i zbeht&#xeb; dhe nuk &#xeb;sht&#xeb; i sh&#xeb;ndetsh&#xeb;m?</span></li><li class=\"flex\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mr-2\">&#x2013;</span><span data-id=\"pg105_n0010\">&#xc7;far&#xeb; duhet t&#xeb; b&#xeb;jm&#xeb; q&#xeb; t&#xeb; jemi t&#xeb; sh&#xeb;ndetsh&#xeb;m?</span></li><li class=\"flex\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mr-2\">&#x2013;</span><span><span data-id=\"pg105_n0012\">Cili &#xeb;sht&#xeb; ushqimi yt m&#xeb; i p&#xeb;lqyer?</span> <span data-id=\"pg105_n0013\">A mendon se &#xeb;sht&#xeb; i sh&#xeb;ndetsh&#xeb;m?</span> <span data-id=\"pg105_n0014\">Pse?</span></span></li><li class=\"flex\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mr-2\">&#x2013;</span><span data-id=\"pg105_n0016\">Si mund ta p&#xeb;rmir&#xeb;sosh t&#xeb; ushqyerit t&#xeb;nd?</span></li><li class=\"flex\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mr-2\">&#x2013;</span><span data-id=\"pg105_n0018\">Sa &#xeb;sht&#xeb; i r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sish&#xeb;m sporti p&#xeb;r ty?</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"w-28 bg-purple-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-6xl leading-none max-sm:w-full max-sm:h-24\" aria-hidden=\"true\">?</div></div></div><div class=\"mb-8 ml-4 max-sm:ml-0\"><p class=\"adt-body mb-1 text-gray-900\"><span data-id=\"pg105_n0020\">Shkruaj nj&#xeb; k&#xeb;shill&#xeb; p&#xeb;r Malin.</span></p><p class=\"adt-body text-gray-900\"><span data-id=\"pg105_n0021\">Tregoji atij se &#xe7;far&#xeb; duhet t&#xeb; b&#xeb;j&#xeb; p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; qen&#xeb; i sh&#xeb;ndetsh&#xeb;m.</span></p></div><div class=\"mb-10 ml-4 max-sm:ml-0\"><div class=\"border-2 border-green-400 p-3 max-sm:p-2\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div><span class=\"sr-only\" data-id=\"pg105_n0022\"></span><label for=\"activity-item-1\" class=\"sr-only\">Shkruaj nj&#xeb; k&#xeb;shill&#xeb; p&#xeb;r Malin, rreshti 1</label><input id=\"activity-item-1\" data-activity-item=\"item-1\" type=\"text\" aria-label=\"Shkruaj nj&#xeb; k&#xeb;shill&#xeb; p&#xeb;r Malin, rreshti 1\" class=\"min-h-11 w-full border-0 border-b-2 border-green-400 bg-transparent px-2 py-3 outline-none focus:ring-0\"></div><div><span class=\"sr-only\" data-id=\"pg105_n0023\"></span><label for=\"activity-item-2\" class=\"sr-only\">Shkruaj nj&#xeb; k&#xeb;shill&#xeb; p&#xeb;r Malin, rreshti 2</label><input id=\"activity-item-2\" data-activity-item=\"item-2\" type=\"text\" aria-label=\"Shkruaj nj&#xeb; k&#xeb;shill&#xeb; p&#xeb;r Malin, rreshti 2\" class=\"min-h-11 w-full border-0 border-b-2 border-green-400 bg-transparent px-2 py-3 outline-none foc