personale, t&#xeb; marrim ushqime t&#xeb; sh&#xeb;ndetshme, t&#xeb; merremi me aktivitete fizike, me sporte t&#xeb; ndryshme dhe t&#xeb; b&#xeb;jm&#xeb; sh&#xeb;titje n&#xeb; aj&#xeb;r t&#xeb; past&#xeb;r, pasi t&#xeb; gjitha k&#xeb;to forcojn&#xeb; trupin dhe mendjen.</span></p><p class=\"mb-3\"><span data-id=\"pg105_n0033\">Q&#xeb; t&#xeb; jemi t&#xeb; aft&#xeb; t&#xeb; kryejm&#xeb; t&#xeb; gjitha aktivitetet ditore, duhet t&#xeb; b&#xeb;jm&#xeb; s&#xeb; paku tet&#xeb; or&#xeb; gjum&#xeb; gjat&#xeb; nat&#xeb;s.</span></p><p class=\"mb-3\"><span data-id=\"pg105_n0035\">Duhen b&#xeb;r&#xeb; vizita t&#xeb; vazhdueshme te stomatologu dhe te mjeku i familjes.</span></p><p><span data-id=\"pg105_n0037\">Shprehit&#xeb; p&#xeb;r kujdesin sh&#xeb;ndet&#xeb;sor krijohen qysh n&#xeb; f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;ri t&#xeb; hershme dhe zbatohen gjat&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; jet&#xeb;s.</span></p></div><div class=\"w-44 bg-purple-500 flex items-start justify-center p-3 text-white text-5xl leading-none max-sm:w-full max-sm:justify-end\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#x1f4d6;</div></div></div><div class=\"ml-4 max-sm:ml-0 adt-body text-gray-900\"><span class=\"font-bold\" data-id=\"pg105_n0039\">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e:</span> <span data-id=\"pg105_n0040\">kujdes sh&#xeb;ndet&#xeb;sor, higjien&#xeb;, sport, ushqim i sh&#xeb;ndetsh&#xeb;m, vizit&#xeb; mjek&#xeb;sore.</span></div></section></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg106_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg106_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"135\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container mx-auto opacity-0\">\n  <section data-section-type=\"text_and_single_image\" data-section-id=\"pg106_sec001\" class=\"bg-[#f3cfb1]\">\n    <div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 pt-8 pb-2\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-start gap-0 max-sm:flex-col max-sm:gap-4\">\n        <div class=\"shrink-0 w-36 h-56 max-sm:w-28 max-sm:h-32 bg-[#a96bb1] rounded-tl-xl rounded-bl-xl rounded-br-xl flex items-center justify-center max-sm:rounded-xl\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" class=\"w-16 h-16 fill-white max-sm:w-12 max-sm:h-12\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <path d=\"M31 10c3 4 5 9 5 15s-2 11-5 15c-3-4-5-9-5-15s2-11 5-15Zm0 30c3 3 5 7 5 12s-2 9-5 12c-3-3-5-7-5-12s2-9 5-12Zm-9-19c-4 0-9-2-14-7 5-2 10-2 14 0 4 2 7 6 9 11-4 0-7-1-9-4Zm18 0c4 0 9-2 14-7-5-2-10-2-14 0-4 2-7 6-9 11 4 0 7-1 9-4ZM22 33c-4 0-9-2-14-7 5-2 10-2 14 0 4 2 7 6 9 11-4 0-7-1-9-4Zm18 0c4 0 9-2 14-7-5-2-10-2-14 0-4 2-7 6-9 11 4 0 7-1 9-4ZM22 45c-4 0-9-2-14-7 5-2 10-2 14 0 4 2 7 6 9 11-4 0-7-1-9-4Zm18 0c4 0 9-2 14-7-5-2-10-2-14 0-4 2-7 6-9 11 4 0 7-1 9-4Z\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex-1 pt-14 max-sm:pt-0\">\n          <div class=\"bg-[#a96bb1] px-6 py-3 w-[calc(100%+5rem)] -ml-2 max-sm:w-full max-sm:ml-0 max-sm:px-4 max-sm:py-3\">\n            <h1 class=\"adt-h1 font-bold text-white leading-tight\"><span data-id=\"pg106_n0002\">Resurset dhe trash&#xeb;gimia e vendit tim</span></h1>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"pt-4 max-sm:pt-3\">\n            <h2 class=\"adt-h2 text-[#2d2a2e] font-semibold inline-block border-b-4 border-[#a96bb1] pb-2 pr-20 max-sm:pr-0\"><span data-id=\"pg106_n0003\">Ndihmojm&#xeb; p&#xeb;r nj&#xeb; mjedis t&#xeb; past&#xeb;r</span></h2>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 pt-4 pb-0\">\n      <h3 class=\"adt-h3 inline-block bg-[#63b96e] text-[#1d1d1d] font-semibold px-5 py-2 mb-6\"><span data-id=\"pg106_n0004\">Situata 1.</span></h3>\n\n      <p class=\"adt-body text-[#3a2a22] leading-relaxed text-left\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg106_n0006\">M&#xeb;suesi: Nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;s, sot do t&#xeb; flasim p&#xeb;r ambientin, pandaj ajo &#xe7;ka k&#xeb;rkoj nga ju &#xeb;sht&#xeb; q&#xeb; secili nga ju t&#xeb; tregoni se si mund t&#xeb; ndihmoni p&#xeb;r nj&#xeb; mjedis t&#xeb; past&#xeb;r.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg106_n0007\">Arsimi: M&#xeb;sues, duke qen&#xeb; se makinat ndotin ajrin, n&#xeb;p&#xeb;r qytet duhet t&#xeb; ecim, t&#xeb; shfryt&#xeb;zojm&#xeb; bi&#xe7;iklet&#xeb;n ose transportin publik - autobusin.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg106_n0008\">Ema: P&#xeb;r jet&#xeb; t&#xeb; sh&#xeb;ndetshme n&#xeb; planetin ton&#xeb;, n&#xeb; t&#xeb; ardhmen, nj&#xeb; rol t&#xeb; r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sish&#xeb;m do t&#xeb; luaj&#xeb; menaxhimi i mbeturinave.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg106_n0009\">Ato duhet t&#xeb; riciklohen.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg106_n0010\">Riciklimi i tyre &#xeb;sht&#xeb; shum&#xeb; i r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sish&#xeb;m.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg106_n0011\">Prodhimi i sendeve nga riciklimi i mbeturinave harxhon m&#xeb; pak energji se prodhimi i tyre nga materiale t&#xeb; reja.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg106_n0012\">Mbeturinat nuk duhet t&#xeb; hidhen n&#xeb; tok&#xeb;, por n&#xeb; shportat p&#xeb;rkat&#xeb;se.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg106_n0013\">Dea: Uji &#xeb;sht&#xeb; i &#xe7;muesh&#xeb;m, k&#xeb;shtu q&#xeb; duhet ta ruajm&#xeb;.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg106_n0014\">T&#xeb; mos hedhim mbeturina n&#xeb; lumenj!</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg106_n0015\">T&#xeb; mos e l&#xeb;m&#xeb; &#xe7;ezm&#xeb;n hapur pa nevoj&#xeb;!</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg106_n0016\">T&#xeb; kujdesemi p&#xeb;r ruajtjen e energjis&#xeb;.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg106_n0017\">Mali: Ne mund t&#xeb; mbjellim drur&#xeb;, shum&#xeb; drur&#xeb;, s&#xeb; paku nj&#xeb; gjat&#xeb; jet&#xeb;s son&#xeb;.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg106_n0018\">Ne s&#xeb; bashku mund ta b&#xeb;jm&#xeb; ndryshimin p&#xeb;r nj&#xeb; ambient sa m&#xeb; t&#xeb; past&#xeb;r dhe nj&#xeb; jet&#xeb; t&#xeb; sh&#xeb;ndetshme.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg106_n0019\">M&#xeb;suesi: Ju lumt&#xeb;, nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;s!</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg106_n0020\">Ne duhet t&#xeb; kujdesemi p&#xeb;r ambientin, q&#xeb; edhe vet&#xeb; t&#xeb; jemi t&#xeb; sh&#xeb;ndetsh&#xeb;m.</span>\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"mt-8 max-sm:mt-6 rounded-t-3xl overflow-hidden bg-[#efc9a9]\">\n        <img data-id=\"pg106_im001\" src=\"images/pg106_im001.png\" alt=\"M&#xeb;suesi po u shpjegon nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;sve n&#xeb; klas&#xeb; p&#xeb;r kujdesin ndaj ambientit, pran&#xeb; tabel&#xeb;s me nj&#xeb; pamje t&#xeb; natyr&#xeb;s.\" class=\"w-full h-auto block\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"