&#xeb;r shembull, kur hedhim mbeturina n&#xeb; det apo breg, ne p&#xeb;rve&#xe7;q&#xeb; e ndotim nj&#xeb; peizazh aq mahnit&#xeb;s, edhe shkat&#xeb;rrojm&#xeb; jet&#xeb;n e shum&#xeb; gjallesave t&#xeb; detit.</span> <span data-id=\"pg110_n0012\">Pse i b&#xeb;jm&#xeb; k&#xeb;to veprime ne njer&#xeb;zit?</span> <span data-id=\"pg110_n0013\">Pse duhet t&#xeb; hedhim mbeturina n&#xeb; tok&#xeb;, n&#xeb; vend q&#xeb; t&#x2019;i mbajm&#xeb; ato dhe t&#x2019;i hedhim n&#xeb; shport&#xeb;n e mbeturinave?</span> <span data-id=\"pg110_n0014\">Pse t&#xeb; mos mbjellim drur&#xeb; p&#xeb;r gjelb&#xeb;rimin e mjedisit, por i presim ata?</span> <span data-id=\"pg110_n0015\">Sa kushton t&#xeb; hedhim shishet e plastik&#xeb;s n&#xeb; shport&#xeb;n p&#xeb;r riciklim?</span></p><p class=\"adt-body mb-5 leading-relaxed max-sm:mb-4\"><span data-id=\"pg110_n0017\">Dua t&#xeb; b&#xeb;j nj&#xeb; prezantim p&#xeb;r mbrojtjen e natyr&#xeb;s para shoqeve dhe shok&#xeb;ve t&#xeb; klas&#xeb;s, - mendoi Era, e shqet&#xeb;suar p&#xeb;r gjendjen e natyr&#xeb;s n&#xeb; vendin ton&#xeb;.</span></p></div><div class=\"-mx-8 mt-0 max-sm:-mx-5\"><img data-id=\"pg110_im001\" src=\"images/pg110_im001.png\" alt=\"Vajza e ulur n&#xeb; stol lexon nj&#xeb; lib&#xeb;r n&#xeb; park, nd&#xeb;rsa pran&#xeb; saj nj&#xeb; burr&#xeb; sh&#xeb;tit qenin mes pem&#xeb;ve.\" class=\"block h-auto w-full object-cover object-top\"></div></section></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg111_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewpor