abel>\n              <input id=\"activity-item-6\" type=\"text\" data-activity-item=\"item-6\" aria-label=\"Shkruaj emrin e mbeturinave p&#xeb;r shport&#xeb;n blu\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 rounded-md border border-blue-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-center\">\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-6 border-2 border-[#b86bb8] bg-transparent px-4 py-4 text-neutral-800 relative overflow-visible\">\n      <div class=\"absolute right-0 top-0 -translate-y-1/2 translate-x-1/2 bg-[#a86aae] text-white w-24 h-20 flex items-center justify-center text-4xl max-lg:w-20 max-lg:h-16 max-sm:hidden\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#x1f4d6;</div>\n      <p class=\"adt-body italic leading-relaxed\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg111_n0010\">Ndotja e mjedisit natyror me ndot&#xeb;s t&#xeb; ndrysh&#xeb;m shkakton ndryshime t&#xeb; shumta n&#xeb; tok&#xeb;, uj&#xeb; dhe aj&#xeb;r, t&#xeb; cil&#xeb;t drejtp&#xeb;rdrejt ndikojn&#xeb; edhe n&#xeb; jet&#xeb;n e qenieve t&#xeb; gjalla.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg111_n0011\">Njeriu ka p&#xeb;r detyr&#xeb; t&#xeb; mbroj&#xeb; mjedisin n&#xeb; t&#xeb; cilin jeton dhe vepron.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg111_n0012\">Ky kujdes ndaj natyr&#xeb;s duhet t&#xeb; jet&#xeb; i vazhduesh&#xeb;m dhe i p&#xeb;rhersh&#xeb;m, n&#xeb; m&#xeb;nyr&#xeb; individuale dhe grupore.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg111_n0013\">Njeriu &#xe7;do dit&#xeb; duhet ta mbroj&#xeb; natyr&#xeb;n.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg111_n0014\">Ndotja e natyr&#xeb;s shkat&#xeb;rron edhe jet&#xeb;n e qenieve t&#xeb; gjalla n&#xeb; planetin ton&#xeb;.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg111_n0015\">P&#xeb;r nj&#xeb; jet&#xeb; t&#xeb; sh&#xeb;ndetshme, duhet t&#xeb; kemi nj&#xeb; mjedis t&#xeb; past&#xeb;r.</span>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto relative\">\n      <img src=\"images/pg111_im001.png\" alt=\"Kat&#xeb;r shporta ricikluese me ngjyra t&#xeb; kuqe, t&#xeb; gjelb&#xeb;r, t&#xeb; verdh&#xeb; dhe blu n&#xeb; nj&#xeb; park, nd&#xeb;rsa nj&#xeb; f&#xeb;mij&#xeb; ec&#xeb;n pran&#xeb; tyre mes pem&#xeb;ve.\" data-id=\"pg111_im001\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-md object-cover max-sm:min-h-[280px]\">\n      <div class=\"mt-4 max-sm:mt-3 px-2\">\n        <span class=\"adt-body inline-block text-neutral-800\" data-id=\"pg111_n0016\">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e: natyr&#xeb;, gjelb&#xeb;rim, kujdes, riciklim, mjedis.</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.correctAnswers = JSON.parse('{\"item-1\":\"\",\"item-2\":\"\",\"item-3\":\"\",\"item-4\":\"\",\"item-5\":\"\",\"item-6\":\"\"}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg112_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg112_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"143\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container opacity-0\"><section data-section-type=\"text_only\" data-section-id=\"pg112_sec001\" class=\"bg-white text-zinc-800\"><div class=\"w-full bg-purple-500\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 py-8\"><div class=\"flex items-end gap-6 max-sm:gap-4\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex h-24 w-24 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-purple-400 text-white shadow-sm max-sm:h-20 max-sm:w-20\">&#x1f343;</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><h1 data-id=\"pg112_n0002\" class=\"adt-h1 font-bold text-white\">Mjedisi i vendit tim</h1><h2 data-id=\"pg112_n0003\" class=\"adt-h2 mt-3 border-b-4 border-purple-200 pb-2 font-semibold text-white\">Ndotja e uj&#xeb;rave</h2></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 py-10\"><p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed text-left\"><span data-id=\"pg112_n0005\">Mali vizitonte dajat e tij &#xe7;do pushim pranveror.</span> <span data-id=\"pg112_n0006\">Aq shum&#xeb; e donte natyr&#xeb;n e fshatit, saq&#xeb; nuk pranonte kurrsesi t&#xeb; kalonte diku tjet&#xeb;r pushimet.</span> <span data-id=\"pg112_n0007\">&#xc7;do gj&#xeb; i dukej e mrekullueshme n&#xeb; fshat: relievi, harmonia e njer&#xeb;zve, lidhja e tyre me natyr&#xeb;n, m&#xeb;nyra se si e punonin tok&#xeb;n, produktet q&#xeb; merrnin nga toka.</span> <span data-id=\"pg112_n0008\">E vetmja gj&#xeb; q&#xeb; e shqet&#xeb;sonte ishte lumi i fshatit.</span> <span data-id=\"pg112_n0009\" class=\"italic\">Pse banor&#xeb;t hidhnin mbeturina n&#xeb; lum&#xeb;?</span> <span data-id=\"pg112_n0010\" class=\"italic\">Pse banor&#xeb;t nuk pastronin lumin nj&#xeb;her&#xeb; e p&#xeb;rgjithmon&#xeb;?</span> <span data-id=\"pg112_n0011\" class=\"italic\">Pse fshatar&#xeb;t nuk shp&#xeb;tonin nga kund&#xeb;rmimi i er&#xeb;s s&#xeb; keqe q&#xeb; shkaktonin mbeturinat?</span> <span data-id=\"pg112_n0012\">Mali e kishte kuptuar se tanim&#xeb; nuk ishte i vog&#xeb;l p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; b&#xeb;r&#xeb; gj&#xeb;ra t&#xeb; m&#xeb;dha.</span> <span data-id=\"pg112_n0013\">Ai kishte plot shok&#xeb; n&#xeb; fshat me t&#xeb; cil&#xeb;t luante.</span> <span data-id=\"pg112_n0014\">Mali dha iden&#xeb; i pari q&#xeb; t&#xeb; shkonin s&#xeb; bashku me shok&#xeb;t p&#xeb;r t&#x2019;i larguar t&#xeb; gjitha letrat q&#xeb; ishin af&#xeb;r lumit.</span> <span data-id=\"pg112_n0015\" class=\"italic\">Po sikur t&#xeb; k&#xeb;rkojm&#xeb; ndihm&#xeb; nga t&#xeb; rriturit p&#xeb;r k&#xeb;t&#xeb; gj&#xeb;, &#xe7;far&#xeb; do t&#xeb; na thoshin?</span> <span data-id=\"pg112_n0016\">F&#xeb;mij&#xeb;t, q&#xeb; mezi prisnin t&#xeb; kalonin koh&#xeb;n s&#xeb; bashku, than&#xeb; t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; nj&#xeb;z&#xeb;ri: &#x201c;Le ta provojm&#xeb;!&#x201d;.</span> <span data-id=\"pg112_n0017\">Mali me shoqen e tij, Er&#xeb;n, nd&#xeb;rkoh&#xeb; q&#xeb; po mblidhnin mbeturinat bashk&#xeb; me fshatar&#xeb;t, po bisedonin se sa keq ishin ndier kur kishin kaluar pushimet n&#xeb; det vitin e kaluar.</span> <span data-id=\"pg112_n0018\">Ata kishin par&#xeb; q&#xeb; deti ishte i mbushur me qeska najloni e mbetje ushqimesh.</span> <span data-id=\"pg112_n0019\">Nuk arrinin t&#xeb; gjenin dot nj&#xeb; p&#xeb;rgjigje p&#xeb;r k&#xeb;to veprime.</span> <span data-id=\"pg112_n0020\">Uji, elementi ky&#xe7; i jet&#xeb;s s&#xeb; gjallesave, a mos &#xeb;sht&#xeb; duke u ndotur shum&#xeb; nga njeriu?</span> <span data-id=\"pg112_n0021\" class=\"italic\">&quot;Njeriu duhet t&#xeb; ndaloj&#xeb; s&#xeb; b&#xeb;ri k&#xeb;to veprime t&#xeb; d&#xeb;mshme&quot;, - ishin fjal&#xeb;t e Yllit, i cili nd&#xeb;rpreu bised&#xeb;n e Malit dhe t&#xeb; Er&#xeb;s.</span></p></div></section></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg112_sec002.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg112_sec002\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"144\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <h1 class=\"sr-only\" id=\"page-heading\">Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</h1>\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 opacity-0\"><section data-section-type=\"boxed_text\" data-section-id=\"pg112_sec002\" class=\"py-8\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl\"><div class=\"flex items-stretch max-sm:flex-col\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex w-24 shrink-0 items-center justify-center bg-purple-500 text-white max-sm:w-full max-sm:min-h-16\"><div class=\"adt-h3 font-bold leading-none\">?</div></div><div class=\"flex-1 border-2 border-purple-200 bg-purple-100 p-6 max-sm:p-4\"><div class=\"space-y-5\"><div><div class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed text-slate-800\"><span data-id=\"pg112_n0023\">- &#xc7;far&#xeb; i b&#xeb;nte p&#xeb;rshtypje Malit n&#xeb; fshat?</span></div><