oje ti nga njer&#xeb;zit q&#xeb; t&#xeb; mbajn&#xeb; lumin t&#xeb; past&#xeb;r?</span></div><label for=\"item-4\" class=\"sr-only\">- Imagjino se ti je nj&#xeb; pik&#xeb; uji n&#xeb; lum&#xeb;. &#xc7;far&#xeb; do t&#xeb; d&#xeb;shiroje ti nga njer&#xeb;zit q&#xeb; t&#xeb; mbajn&#xeb; lumin t&#xeb; past&#xeb;r?</label><textarea id=\"item-4\" data-activity-item=\"item-4\" aria-label=\"- Imagjino se ti je nj&#xeb; pik&#xeb; uji n&#xeb; lum&#xeb;. &#xc7;far&#xeb; do t&#xeb; d&#xeb;shiroje ti nga njer&#xeb;zit q&#xeb; t&#xeb; mbajn&#xeb; lumin t&#xeb; past&#xeb;r?\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-24 w-full rounded-2xl border-2 border-purple-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-slate-800 outline-none focus:border-purple-400 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-200\"></textarea></div></div></div></div></div></section></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg112_sec003.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg112_sec003\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"145\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <h1 class=\"sr-only\" id=\"page-heading\">Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</h1>\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container opacity-0\"><section data-section-type=\"boxed_text\" data-section-id=\"pg112_sec003\" class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 py-8 bg-white text-slate-800\"><div class=\"border-2 border-purple-300 bg-purple-50 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex max-lg:flex-col\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-24 max-lg:w-full bg-purple-500\"></div><div class=\"flex-1 p-6 max-sm:p-4\"><p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed italic\"><span data-id=\"pg112_n0030\">Uji &#xeb;sht&#xeb; i domosdosh&#xeb;m p&#xeb;r jet&#xeb;n e qenieve t&#xeb; gjalla.</span> <span data-id=\"pg112_n0031\">Prandaj njeriu duhet t&#xeb; tregoj&#xeb; kujdes t&#xeb; ve&#xe7;ant&#xeb; p&#xeb;r uj&#xeb;rat n&#xeb; mjedisin ku jeton.</span> <span data-id=\"pg112_n0032\">Njeriu duhet t&#xeb; kujdeset q&#xeb; t&#xeb; mos keqp&#xeb;rdor&#xeb; apo ndot&#xeb; ujin e pijsh&#xeb;m dhe uj&#xeb;rat e tjera.</span> <span data-id=\"pg112_n0033\">Ndotja e ujit &#xeb;sht&#xeb; ndotja e t&#xeb; gjitha uj&#xeb;rave n&#xeb; tok&#xeb;, liqene, lumenj, oqeane, rrjedhje dhe uj&#xeb;ra n&#xeb;ntok&#xeb;sore.</span> <span data-id=\"pg112_n0034\">Ndotja e ujit ndodh kur ndot&#xeb;sit hidhen n&#xeb; uj&#xeb;, pa treguar kujdes p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; hequr p&#xeb;rb&#xeb;rjet e d&#xeb;mshme.</span> <span data-id=\"pg112_n0035\">Ndotja e ujit prek bim&#xeb;t dhe organizmat q&#xeb; jetojn&#xeb; n&#xeb; k&#xeb;to uj&#xeb;ra dhe shkakton efekte t&#xeb; d&#xeb;mshme n&#xeb; to.</span> <span data-id=\"pg112_n0036\">Ndot&#xeb;sit kryesor&#xeb; dhe shkaktar&#xeb; t&#xeb; s&#xeb;mundjeve t&#xeb; shumta infektive jan&#xeb; uj&#xeb;rat e zeza.</span> <span data-id=\"pg112_n0037\">Secili vend duhet t&#xeb; ket&#xeb; kujdes p&#xeb;r nd&#xeb;rtimin e sistemit t&#xeb; derdhjes s&#xeb; uj&#xeb;rave t&#xeb; zeza.</span></p></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-8 border-l-4 border-purple-300 pl-4\"><p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed\"><span data-id=\"pg112_n0040\" class=\"font-semibold\">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e:</span> <span data-id=\"pg112_n0041\">uj&#xeb;, lum&#xeb;, ndotje, kursim, jetes&#xeb;.</span></p></div></section></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg113_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg113_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"146\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container opacity-0\"><section data-section-type=\"separator\" data-section-id=\"pg113_sec001\" class=\"w-full bg-sky-200 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-8 py-8 max-lg:px-4 max-lg:py-8 max-sm:px-0 max-sm:py-0\"><div class=\"relative\"><img data-id=\"pg113_im001\" src=\"images/pg113_im001.png\" alt=\"Tre f&#xeb;mij&#xeb; pran&#xeb; nj&#xeb; lumi pastrojn&#xeb; bregun duke mbledhur shishe plastike dhe mbeturina n&#xeb; nj&#xeb; qese t&#xeb; madhe, me fusha dhe sht&#xeb;pi n&#xeb; sfond.\" class=\"w-full h-auto block\"><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 z-10 px-8 pt-8 max-lg:px-8 max-lg:pt-8 max-sm:px-5 max-sm:pt-5\"><div class=\"w-full max-w-5xl bg-purple-500/90 px-6 py-4 max-sm:px-4 max-sm:py-3\"><h1 class=\"adt-h1 font-bold text-white\" data-id=\"pg113_n0003\">Mjedisi i vendit tim</h1></div><div class=\"mt-5 ml-6 max-w-xl max-sm:ml-0 max-sm:mt-4\"><h2 class=\"adt-h2 inline-block border-b-4 border-purple-400 pb-2 text-slate-900\" data-id=\"pg113_n0005\">Ndotja e uj&#xeb;rave</h2></div></div></div></div></section></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg114_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg114_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"147\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container bg-[#f6efe3] opacity-0\">\n  <section data-section-type=\"text_and_single_image\" data-section-id=\"pg114_sec001\" class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 py-8 max-sm:px-5\">\n    <div class=\"mb-8 flex items-start max-sm:flex-col max-sm:items-stretch\">\n      <div class=\"flex h-44 w-36 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#a567ad] max-sm:h-28 max-sm:w-full max-sm:rounded-b-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-4\">\n          <div class=\"h-12 w-12 rounded-full border-4 border-white/90\"></div>\n          <div class=\"h-5 w-16 rounded-full border-4 border-white/90 border-t-0\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex-1 pt-14 -ml-1 max-sm:ml-0 max-sm:pt-0\">\n        <div class=\"bg-[#a567ad] px-4 py-3 text-white\">\n          <h1 data-id=\"pg114_n0002\" class=\"adt-h1 font-bold\">Mjedisi i vendit tim</h1>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"inline-block border-b-4 border-[#a567ad] px-2 py-3 min-w-[52%] max-sm:min-w-0\">\n          <h2 data-id=\"pg114_n0003\" class=\"adt-h2 text-[#2b2525]\">Ndotja e tok&#xeb;s</h2>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"space-y-5 text-left text-[#3a2f2a]\">\n      <p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg114_n0005\">M&#xeb;suesja u dha detyr&#xeb; nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;sve q&#xeb; t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rgatitnin nj&#xeb; projekt me tem&#xeb; sipas d&#xeb;shir&#xeb;s.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg114_n0006\">Disa nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;s mor&#xeb;n p&#xeb;r tem&#xeb; instrumentin m&#xeb; t&#xeb; p&#xeb;lqyer, disa p&#xeb;rgatit&#xeb;n projekt p&#xeb;r kafsh&#xeb;n e dashur e disa p&#xeb;r bim&#xeb;t.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg114_n0007\">H&#xeb;na po mendonte se cil&#xeb;n tem&#xeb; ta merrte.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg114_n0008\">D&#xeb;shironte q&#xeb; t&#xeb; hulumtonte nj&#xeb; tem&#xeb; p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; cil&#xeb;n nuk kishte shum&#xeb; informata, por q&#xeb; do t&#xeb; ishte e dobishme p&#xeb;r t&#xeb;.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg114_n0009\">Ishte n&#xeb; mes t&#xeb; kafsh&#xeb;s m&#xeb; t&#xeb; p&#xeb;lqyer, bim&#xeb;s m&#xeb; interesante apo trupit t&#xeb; njeriut.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg114_n0010\">Nd&#xeb;rkoh&#xeb; q&#xeb; po mendonte, iu kujtua se k&#xeb;to tri gjallesa kan&#xeb; di&#xe7;ka t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rbashk&#xeb;t.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg114_n0011\">Q&#xeb; t&#xeb; tria jetojn&#xeb; n&#xeb; Tok&#xeb;, prandaj ajo mendoi q&#xeb; t&#xeb; hulumtonte p&#xeb;r Tok&#xeb;n.</span>\n      </p>\n      <p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg114_n0013\">Nd&#xeb;rkoh&#xeb; q&#xeb; po mblidhte informacione p&#xeb;r form&#xeb;n e Tok&#xeb;s, origjin&#xeb;n e emrit e karakteristika t&#xeb; tjera, asaj i t&#xeb;rhoqi v&#xeb;mendjen fjalia:</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg114_n0014\">&quot;N&#xeb; Sistemin Diellor ka tet&#xeb; planet&#xeb; dhe VET&#xcb;M n&#xeb; planetin Tok&#xeb; &#xeb;sht&#xeb; e mundshme jeta p&#xeb;r gjallesat&quot;.</span>\n      </p>\n      <p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg114_n0016\">Fakte, si: sa ka uj&#xeb; n&#xeb; Tok&#xeb;, p&#xeb;rb&#xeb;rja e ajrit, sateliti natyral i Tok&#xeb;s etj., po i b&#xeb;nin p&#xeb;rshtypje H&#xeb;n&#xeb;s.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg114_n0017\">Ajo mendoi q&#xeb; t&#xeb; ndryshonte tem&#xeb;n e projektit, do t&apos;u tregonte shok&#xeb;ve dhe shoqeve t&#xeb; klas&#xeb;s p&#xeb;r r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sin&#xeb; e planetit Tok&#xeb;.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg114_n0018\">- Un&#xeb; mund t&#xeb; b&#xeb;j gj&#xeb;ra t&#xeb; vogla me dashuri t&#xeb; madhe p&#xeb;r planetin tim, - mendoi ajo.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg114_n0019\">H&#xeb;na u p&#xeb;rqendrua te veprimet e d&#xeb;mshme q&#xeb; mund t&#xeb; b&#xeb;jn&#xeb; f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;t ndaj tok&#xeb;s.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg114_n0020\">Ne hedhim mbeturina n&#xeb; tok&#xeb;.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg114_n0021\">Ne shpenzojm&#xeb; shum&#xeb; uj&#xeb; pa nevoj&#xeb;.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg114_n0022\">Ne nuk riciklojm&#xeb;.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg114_n0023\">Ne d&#xeb;mtojm&#xeb; hap&#xeb;sirat e gjelb&#xeb;ruara kur ecim n&#xeb; bar e jo n&#xeb; rrug&#xeb;n e shtruar.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg114_n0024\">Ne d&#xeb;mtojm&#xeb; lulet nd&#xeb;rkoh&#xeb; q&#xeb; duhet t&#xeb; kujdesemi p&#xeb;r to.</span>\n      </p>\n      <p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg114_n0026\">N&#xeb; fund t&#xeb; prezantimit t&#xeb; projektit, ajo k&#xeb;rkoi nga shoqet dhe shok&#xeb;t e klas&#xeb;s q&#xeb; t&#xeb; vizatonin di&#xe7;ka q&#xeb; ata mund t&#xeb; b&#xeb;nin ndryshe p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; mir&#xeb;n e planetit.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg114_n0027\">H&#xeb;na e p&#xeb;rmbylli prezantimin duke th&#xeb;n&#xeb; me z&#xeb; t&#xeb; lart&#xeb;: &quot;&#xcb;sht&#xeb; e mira jon&#xeb; e p&#xeb;rbashk&#xeb;t, prandaj duhet ta ruajm&#xeb; me &#xe7;do kusht!&quot;.</span>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mt-6 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl ring-2 ring-white/70\">\n      <img data-id=\"pg114_im001\" src=\"images/pg114_im001.png\" alt=\"Tre nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;s t&#xeb; ulur n&#xeb; banka p&#xeb;rball&#xeb; nj&#xeb; tabele t&#xeb; gjelb&#xeb;r n&#xeb; klas&#xeb;, me or&#xeb; muri, vizatime dhe nj&#xeb; poster t&#xeb; sistemit diellor n&#xeb; mur.\" class=\"block h-auto w-full\">\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg115_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg115_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"148\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container opacity-0\"><section data-section-type=\"boxed_text\" data-section-id=\"pg115_sec001\" class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl overflow-hidden bg-sky-100 px-8 max-sm:px-5\">\n  <div class=\"-mx-8 max-sm:-mx-5 bg-sky-200 px-8 pb-8 pt-8 max-sm:px-5\">\n    <div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-stretch justify-between gap-6 max-sm:flex-col\">\n        <div class=\"flex-1 pt-10 max-sm:pt-0\">\n          <div class=\"-ml-8 mr-0 bg-purple-500 px-8 py-3 text-white max-sm:-mx-5 max-sm:px-5\">\n            <h1 data-id=\"pg115_n0002\" class=\"adt-h1 font-bold text-left\">Mjedisi i vendit tim</h1>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"pt-5 pl-0\">\n            <h2 data-id=\"pg115_n0003\" class=\"adt-h2 text-left text-slate-900\">Ndotja e tok&#xeb;s</h2>\n            <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-4 h-1 w-64 bg-purple-400 max-sm:w-40\"></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex w-36 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-purple-500 text-white max-sm:w-20 max-sm:self-start\">\n          <div class=\"rounded-lg bg-purple-400/70 px-4 py-10 max-sm:px-3 max-sm:py-5\">&#x1f343;</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"space-y-8 py-10\">\n    <aside class=\"border border-purple-300 bg-purple-200/75 px-4 py-5 max-sm:px-4 max-sm:py-4\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-start gap-5 max-lg:flex-col\">\n        <div class=\"flex-1 space-y-4\">\n          <div>\n            <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-slate-900\"><span data-id=\"pg115_n0007\">&#xc7;far&#xeb; e dallon Tok&#xeb;n nga planet&#xeb;t e tjer&#xeb;?</span></p>\n            <label for=\"activity-item-1\" class=\"sr-only\">&#xc7;far&#xeb; e dallon Tok&#xeb;n nga planet&#xeb;t e tjer&#xeb;?</label>\n            <textarea id=\"activity-item-1\" data-activity-item=\"item-1\" aria-label=\"&#xc7;far&#xeb; e dallon Tok&#xeb;n nga planet&#xeb;t e tjer&#xeb;?\" class=\"mt-2 w-full min-h-11 rounded-xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-slate-900 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\"></textarea>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-slate-900\"><span data-id=\"pg115_n0009\">&#xc7;far&#xeb; mund t&#xeb; mbjellim n&#xeb; tok&#xeb;?</span></p>\n            <label for=\"activity-item-2\" class=\"sr-only\">&#xc7;far&#xeb; mund t&#xeb; mbjellim n&#xeb; tok&#xeb;?</label>\n            <input id=\"activity-item-2\" data-activity-item=\"item-2\" type=\"text\" aria-label=\"&#xc7;far&#xeb; mund t&#xeb; mbjellim n&#xeb; tok&#xeb;?\" class=\"mt-2 w-full min-h-11 rounded-xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-slate-900 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\">\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-slate-900\"><span data-id=\"pg115_n0011\">Cili mund t&#xeb; jet&#xeb; kontributi yn&#xeb; p&#xeb;r Tok&#xeb;n?</span></p>\n            <label for=\"activity-item-3\" class=\"sr-only\">Cili mund t&#xeb; jet&#xeb; kontributi yn&#xeb; p&#xeb;r Tok&#xeb;n?</label>\n            <textarea id=\"activity-item-3\" data-activity-item=\"item-3\" aria-label=\"Cili mund t&#xeb; jet&#xeb; kontributi yn&#xeb; p&#xeb;r Tok&#xeb;n?\" class=\"mt-2 w-full min-h-11 rounded-xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-slate-900 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\"></textarea>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-slate-900\"><span data-id=\"pg115_n0013\">P&#xeb;rmend nj&#xeb; veprim q&#xeb; shkakton ndotjen e tok&#xeb;s.</span></p>\n            <label for=\"activity-item-4\" class=\"sr-only\">P&#xeb;rmend nj&#xeb; veprim q&#xeb; shkakton ndotjen e tok&#xeb;s.</label>\n            <input id=\"activity-item-4\" data-activity-item=\"item-4\" type=\"text\" aria-label=\"P&#xeb;rmend nj&#xeb; veprim q&#xeb; shkakton ndotjen e tok&#xeb;s.\" class=\"mt-2 w-full min-h-11 rounded-xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-slate-900 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\">\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-slate-900\"><span data-id=\"pg115_n0015\">Ndahuni n&#xeb; grupe dhe planifikoni pastrimin e oborrit t&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;s.</span></p>\n            <label for=\"activity-item-5\" class=\"sr-only\">Ndahuni n&#xeb; grupe dhe planifikoni pastrimin e oborrit t&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;s.</label>\n            <textarea id=\"activity-item-5\" data-activity-item=\"item-5\" aria-label=\"Ndahuni n&#xeb; grupe dhe planifikoni pastrimin e oborrit t&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;s.\" class=\"mt-2 w-full min-h-11 rounded-xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-slate-900 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\"></textarea>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"shrink-0 self-start bg-purple-500 px-6 py-5 text-white leading-none max-lg:self-end\">?</div>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n\n    <aside class=\"border-2 border-purple-300 bg-sky-100/70 px-4 py-3 max-sm:px-4 max-sm:py-4\">\n      <div class=\"float-right mb-3 ml-6 w-28 max-lg:w-24 max-sm:float-none max-sm:ml-0 max-sm:mb-4 max-sm:w-full\">\n        <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex h-20 items-center justify-center bg-purple-500 text-white max-sm:h-14\">&#x1f4d6;</div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"adt-body text-left italic text-slate-800\"><span data-id=\"pg115_n0018\">Toka &#xeb;sht&#xeb; i vetmi planet n&#xeb; Sistemin Diellor, n&#xeb; t&#xeb; cilin zhvillohet jeta.</span> <span data-id=\"pg115_n0019\">Njeriu duhet t&#xeb; kujdeset n&#xeb; m&#xeb;nyr&#xeb; t&#xeb; vazhdueshme p&#xeb;r tok&#xeb;n, duke mbjell&#xeb; bim&#xeb; dhe fidan&#xeb; t&#xeb; ndrysh&#xeb;m, duke ricikluar dhe duke hedhur mbeturinat n&#xeb; vendin e duhur.</span> <span data-id=\"pg115_n0020\">Ndotja e vazhdueshme e tok&#xeb;s shkakton d&#xeb;mtime t&#xeb; drejtp&#xeb;rdrejta t&#xeb; mjedisit, t&#xeb; pjes&#xeb;ve t&#xeb; natyr&#xeb;s, t&#xeb; qenieve t&#xeb; gjalla dhe t&#xeb; sh&#xeb;ndetit t&#xeb; njeriut.</span> <span data-id=\"pg115_n0021\">Ndotja k&#xeb;rkohet t&#xeb; parandalohet duke kontrolluar burimet e ndot&#xeb;sve.</span> <span data-id=\"pg115_n0022\">Veprimet e pap&#xeb;rgjegjshme t&#xeb; njeriut rrezikojn&#xeb; dhe ndotin tok&#xeb;n.</span></p>\n      <div class=\"clear-both\"></div>\n    </aside>\n\n    <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative min-h-[620px] overflow-hidden bg-sky-100 max-lg:min-h-[420px] max-sm:min-h-[260px]\">\n      <div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-32 bg-amber-100 max-sm:h-20\"></div>\n      <div class=\"absolute -left-8 bottom-32 h-[360px] w-[250px] rounded-tr-[120px] rounded-br-[80px] border-r-2 border-t-2 border-slate-500 bg-gradient-to-br from-lime-100 to-