g117_n0006\">&#x2013; Si t&#x2019;u duk mendimi i Malit p&#xeb;r xhaxhan&#xeb;?</div>\n          <label for=\"item-2\" class=\"sr-only\">&#x2013; Si t&#x2019;u duk mendimi i Malit p&#xeb;r xhaxhan&#xeb;?</label>\n          <input id=\"item-2\" type=\"text\" data-activity-item=\"item-2\" aria-label=\"&#x2013; Si t&#x2019;u duk mendimi i Malit p&#xeb;r xhaxhan&#xeb;?\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 rounded-2xl border-2 border-[#b36bb5] bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#a968ad]\">\n\n          <div class=\"adt-body\"><span data-id=\"pg117_n0007\">&#x2013; Po ty, si t&#x2019;u duk veprimi i xhaxhait?</span> <span data-id=\"pg117_n0008\">Po p&#xeb;rgjigjja e m&#xeb;sueses?</span></div>\n          <label for=\"item-3\" class=\"sr-only\">&#x2013; Po ty, si t&#x2019;u duk veprimi i xhaxhait? Po p&#xeb;rgjigjja e m&#xeb;sueses?</label>\n          <textarea id=\"item-3\" data-activity-item=\"item-3\" aria-label=\"&#x2013; Po ty, si t&#x2019;u duk veprimi i xhaxhait? Po p&#xeb;rgjigjja e m&#xeb;sueses?\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 rounded-2xl border-2 border-[#b36bb5] bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#a968ad]\"></textarea>\n\n          <div class=\"adt-body\" data-id=\"pg117_n0009\">Mendoje nj&#xeb; zgjidhje tjet&#xeb;r t&#xeb; k&#xeb;tij problemi!</div>\n          <label for=\"item-4\" class=\"sr-only\">Mendoje nj&#xeb; zgjidhje tjet&#xeb;r t&#xeb; k&#xeb;tij problemi!</label>\n          <textarea id=\"item-4\" data-activity-item=\"item-4\" aria-label=\"Mendoje nj&#xeb; zgjidhje tjet&#xeb;r t&#xeb; k&#xeb;tij problemi!\" class=\"w-full min-h-11 rounded-2xl border-2 border-[#b36bb5] bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#a968ad]\"></textarea>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"relative mx-10 border-2 border-[#c68dc7] bg-[#f9ecdf] p-5 pr-28 shadow-sm mb-6 max-lg:mx-0 max-lg:pr-5 max-lg:pt-20 max-sm:pt-24\">\n        <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute right-0 top-0 h-20 w-24 bg-[#a968ad] flex items-center justify-center text-white max-lg:right-5 max-lg:top-5 max-lg:h-16 max-lg:w-16\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" class=\"w-9 h-9\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n            <path d=\"M18 12h22l6 6v34H18z\" fill=\"white\" opacity=\"0.95\"/>\n            <path d=\"M40 12v8h8\" fill=\"#a968ad\"/>\n            <path d=\"M21 46h22\" stroke=\"#a968ad\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n            <path d=\"M21 40h22\" stroke=\"#a968ad\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n            <path d=\"M21 34h16\" stroke=\"#a968ad\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"adt-body italic leading-relaxed\"><span data-id=\"pg117_n0011\">Pylli &#xeb;sht&#xeb; bashk&#xeb;si e gjall&#xeb; e pem&#xeb;ve dhe e shkurreve.</span> <span data-id=\"pg117_n0012\">Pylli konsiderohet si nj&#xeb; fabrik&#xeb; ekologjike e p&#xeb;rsosur, sepse pastron ajrin, por &#xeb;sht&#xeb; edhe nj&#xeb; vend ideal p&#xeb;r jet&#xeb;n e shum&#xeb; kafsh&#xeb;ve t&#xeb; egra dhe nj&#xeb;her&#xeb;sh njeriu p&#xeb;rfiton nga ai.</span></p>\n        <p class=\"adt-body italic leading-relaxed mt-4\"><span data-id=\"pg117_n0014\">Duke e ditur dobin&#xeb; e drur&#xeb;ve p&#xeb;r jet&#xeb;n n&#xeb; Tok&#xeb;, njeriu duhet t&#xeb; ket&#xeb; kujdes q&#xeb; t&#xeb; mos i pres&#xeb; drur&#xeb;t dhe t&#xeb; mos i shkat&#xeb;rroj&#xeb; pyjet.</span> <span data-id=\"pg117_n0015\">Njer&#xeb;zit me veprimet e tyre t&#xeb; pap&#xeb;rgjegjshme presin pyjet p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; b&#xeb;r&#xeb; rrug&#xeb;, vendbanime, si dhe p&#xeb;r shum&#xeb; nevoja t&#xeb; tjera personale.</span></p>\n        <p class=\"adt-body italic leading-relaxed mt-4\"><span data-id=\"pg117_n0017\">Gjat&#xeb; stin&#xeb;s s&#xeb; ver&#xeb;s, ekziston rreziku i zjarreve n&#xeb; pyje, p&#xeb;r shkak t&#xeb; temperaturave t&#xeb; larta.</span> <span data-id=\"pg117_n0018\">Pyjet priten ose digjen, por ne duhet t&#xeb; kujdesemi q&#xeb; ato t&#xeb; rip&#xeb;rt&#xeb;rihen.</span></p>\n        <p class=\"adt-body italic leading-relaxed mt-4\"><span data-id=\"pg117_n0020\">Ne duhet t&#xeb; jemi t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rgjegjsh&#xeb;m q&#xeb; gjithmon&#xeb; t&#xeb; mbjellim sa m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; drur&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id=\"pg117_n0021\">P&#xeb;r &#xe7;do pyll duhet t&#xeb; kujdeset pylltari, gjithashtu p&#xeb;r &#xe7;do prerje druri duhet t&#xeb; k&#xeb;rkohet leje nga institucionet p&#xeb;rkat&#xeb;se.</span></p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"mx-10 bg-white p-3 shadow-md border border-slate-200 max-lg:mx-0\">\n        <img data-id=\"pg117_im001_crop_v1\" src=\"images/pg117_im001_crop_v1.png\" alt=\"Nj&#xeb; burr&#xeb; po pret nj&#xeb; pem&#xeb; me s&#xeb;pat&#xeb; n&#xeb; oborr, i par&#xeb; p&#xeb;rmes dritares.\" class=\"w-full h-auto block\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg118_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg118_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"151\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl bg-white px-8 text-zinc-800 max-sm:px-5 opacity-0\">\n  <section data-section-type=\"text_and_single_image\" data-section-id=\"pg118_sec001\" class=\"pb-8 pt-6 max-sm:pt-4\">\n    <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-start gap-0 max-sm:gap-3\">\n        <div class=\"flex h-56 w-36 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-b-2xl bg-purple-500 max-sm:h-28 max-sm:w-20\">\n          <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-bold leading-none text-white\">&#x2766;</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col pt-14 max-sm:pt-3\">\n          <div class=\"bg-purple-500 px-4 py-2 text-white\">\n            <h1 data-id=\"pg118_n0002\" class=\"adt-h1 font-bold text-white\">Mjedisi i vendit tim</h1>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mt-4 border-b-4 border-purple-400 pb-3 max-sm:mt-3 max-sm:pb-2\" style=\"width:fit-content; min-width:58%; max-width:100%;\">\n            <h2 data-id=\"pg118_n0003\" class=\"adt-h2 font-semibold text-zinc-800\">Transporti publik dhe ai ekologjik</h2>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl pt-10 max-sm:pt-8\">\n      <p class=\"adt-body text-left leading-relaxed text-zinc-800\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg118_n0005\">Jona po fliste vazhdimisht p&#xeb;r r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sin&#xeb; e ruajtjes s&#xeb; ambientit, p&#xeb;r r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sin&#xeb; e hedhjes s&#xeb; mbeturinave n&#xeb; vendin e duhur, p&#xeb;r mbjelljen e bim&#xeb;ve, p&#xeb;r p&#xeb;rdorimin sa m&#xeb; t&#xeb; pakt&#xeb; t&#xeb; makinave.</span> <span data-id=\"pg118_n0006\">N&#xeb;na dhe babai i Jon&#xeb;s e d&#xeb;gjonin me v&#xeb;mendje dhe krenoheshin me vajz&#xeb;n e tyre q&#xeb; donte ta ruante ambientin.</span> <span data-id=\"pg118_n0007\">Nj&#xeb; dit&#xeb;, teksa po udh&#xeb;tonin p&#xeb;r te gjysh&#xeb;rit n&#xeb; nj&#xeb; qytet tjet&#xeb;r, Jon&#xeb;s i t&#xeb;rhoqi v&#xeb;mendjen nj&#xeb; autobus i gjat&#xeb; me ngjyr&#xeb; t&#xeb; verdh&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id=\"pg118_n0008\">Disa njer&#xeb;z po rrinin n&#xeb; k&#xeb;mb&#xeb; e t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb; ishin t&#xeb; ulur n&#xeb; t&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id=\"pg118_n0009\">Jona pyeti prind&#xeb;rit e saj: - P&#xeb;rse njer&#xeb;zit udh&#xeb;tonin me autobus kur nuk kishin vend dhe duhej t&#xeb; rrinin n&#xeb; k&#xeb;mb&#xeb;?</span> <span data-id=\"pg118_n0010\">Babai buz&#xeb;qeshi dhe e pyeti Jon&#xeb;n: - K&#xeb;ta njer&#xeb;z po i b&#xeb;nin mir&#xeb; ambientit apo d&#xeb;m?</span> <span data-id=\"pg118_n0011\">Jona u mendua pak dhe u p&#xeb;rgjigj: - Natyrisht q&#xeb; po i b&#xeb;nin mir&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id=\"pg118_n0012\">Po t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rdorte secili nga k&#xeb;ta njer&#xeb;z vetur&#xeb;n, at&#xeb;her&#xeb; do t&#xeb; digjeshin m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; l&#xeb;nd&#xeb; djeg&#xeb;se dhe do t&#xeb; ndotej ambienti.</span> <span data-id=\"pg118_n0013\">Sa i dobish&#xeb;m qenka p&#xeb;rdorimi i autobusit, - shtoi ajo.</span> <span data-id=\"pg118_n0014\">N&#xeb;na, e lumturuar nga p&#xeb;rgjigjet e Jon&#xeb;s, shtoi: - Ky lloj transporti quhet transport publik dhe &#xeb;sht&#xeb; i destinuar p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; qytetar&#xeb;t.</span> <span data-id=\"pg118_n0015\">Ai funksionon sipas nj&#xeb; orari, ndjek nj&#xeb; linj&#xeb; rruge t&#xeb; caktuar dhe p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; shfryt&#xeb;zuar at&#xeb; caktohet nj&#xeb; &#xe7;mim standard.</span> <span data-id=\"pg118_n0016\">- Mendoj q&#xeb; edhe ne, - tha Jona, - duhet t&#xeb; udh&#xeb;tojm&#xeb; me transport publik tash e tutje.</span> <span data-id=\"pg118_n0017\">Prind&#xeb;rve u p&#xeb;lqeu ideja e saj.</span>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <figure class=\"mx-auto mt-8 max-w-5xl overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-purple-50 p-1 max-sm:mt-6\">\n      <img data-id=\"pg118_im001\" src=\"images/pg118_im001.png\" alt=\"Autobus i verdh&#xeb; i transportit publik n&#xeb; rrug&#xeb;, me nd&#xeb;rtesa t&#xeb; qytetit n&#xeb; sfond.\" class=\"block h-auto w-full\">\n    </figure>\n  </section>\n</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg119_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg119_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"152\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container mx-auto opacity-0\">\n  <section data-section-type=\"text_and_single_image\" data-section-id=\"pg119_sec001\" class=\"bg-white text-slate-800 overflow-hidden\">\n    <div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 pt-8 pb-4\">\n      <div class=\"relative\">\n        <div class=\"pr-40 max-lg:pr-0\">\n          <div class=\"h-12 bg-purple-500 flex items-center px-6 max-sm:px-4\">\n            <h1 class=\"adt-h1 font-bold text-white\" data-id=\"pg119_n0002\">Mjedisi i vendit tim</h1>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mt-5 ml-12 max-lg:ml-8 max-sm:ml-0\">\n            <h2 class=\"adt-h2 font-semibold text-slate-900\" data-id=\"pg119_n0003\">Transporti publik dhe ekologjik</h2>\n            <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-3 h-1 w-80 max-sm:w-48 bg-purple-400\"></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute right-0 top-[-8px] h-44 w-36 rounded-md bg-purple-500 flex items-center justify-center max-lg:static max-lg:mt-6 max-lg:h-36 max-lg:w-32 max-sm:h-24 max-sm:w-24\">\n          <span class=\"text-white leading-none\">&#x1f343;</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 pb-6\">\n      <aside class=\"mb-8 border border-purple-200 bg-purple-100 overflow-hidden\">\n        <div class=\"flex\">\n          <div class=\"flex-1 p-5 max-sm:p-4\">\n            <ul class=\"space-y-2 adt-body text-left text-slate-800\">\n              <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-1 text-purple-700\">&#x2013;</span><span data-id=\"pg119_n0007\">&#xc7;far&#xeb; kupton me transport publik?</span></li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-1 text-purple-700\">&#x2013;</span><span data-id=\"pg119_n0009\">Si duhet t&#xeb; sillemi n&#xeb; transport publik?</span></li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-1 text-purple-700\">&#x2013;</span><span data-id=\"pg119_n0011\">Pse &#xeb;sht&#xeb; e r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sishme t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rdoret transporti ekologjik?</span></li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-1 text-purple-700\">&#x2013;</span><span data-id=\"pg119_n0013\">A ka n&#xeb; qarkullim transport ekologjik n&#xeb; vendin ton&#xeb;?</span></li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-24 bg-purple-500 flex items-start justify-center pt-4 text-white max-sm:w-20\">?</div>\n        </div>\n      </aside>\n\n      <div class=\"border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white p-5 max-sm:p-4 mb-6\">\n        <p class=\"adt-body italic leading-relaxed text-left text-slate-700\">\n          <span data-id=\"pg119_n0016\">Transporti publik &#xeb;sht&#xeb; m&#xeb;nyr&#xeb; udh&#xeb;timi me autobus, tren apo mjete t&#xeb; tjera, i cili &#xeb;sht&#xeb; n&#xeb; sh&#xeb;rbim t&#xeb; t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb;ve.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg119_n0017\">Llojet e transportit publik jan&#xeb;: transporti urban, nd&#xeb;rurban etj.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg119_n0018\">P&#xeb;r t&apos;i ofruar k&#xeb;to sh&#xeb;rbime, p&#xeb;rpos nd&#xeb;rmarrjes publike, ekzistojn&#xeb; edhe nd&#xeb;rmarrjet private, t&#xeb; cilat operojn&#xeb; n&#xeb; treg n&#xeb; form&#xeb; t&#xeb; biznesit.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg119_n0019\">Edhe k&#xeb;to p&#xeb;rdorin pak a shum&#xeb; t&#xeb; nj&#xeb;jtat mjete transporti, si minibus&#xeb;t, autobus&#xeb;t ose taksit&#xeb; etj.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg119_n0020\">N&#xeb; t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; bot&#xeb;n, r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;si t&#xeb; ve&#xe7;ant&#xeb; i kushtohet transportit ekologjik (metros), i cili redukton ndotjen e ajrit dhe kryen funksion t&#xeb; nj&#xeb;jt&#xeb; me transportin publik.</span>\n          <span data-id=\"pg119_n0021\">Ndot&#xeb;sit e mjedisit, midis tyre edhe p&#xeb;rdorimi i tep&#xeb;rt i makinave, po shkaktojn&#xeb; ngrohjen globale, prandaj &#xeb;sht&#xeb; i domosdosh&#xeb;m p&#xeb;rdorimi i transportit publik.</span>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div>\n        <img data-id=\"pg119_im001\" src=\"images/pg119_im001.png\" alt=\"Tren modern i shpejt&#xeb; duke kaluar pran&#xeb; nd&#xeb;rtesave t&#xeb; qytetit, si shembull i transportit publik ekologjik.\" class=\"w-full h-auto block\">\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"mt-4 border-t-2 border-slate-400 pt-4 adt-body text-left text-slate-800\">\n        <span class=\"font-semibold\" data-id=\"pg119_n0023\">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e:</span>\n        <span class=\"ml-1\" data-id=\"pg119_n0024\">transport publik, ndotje, aj&#xeb;r i past&#xeb;r, ekologjik.</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg120_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg120_sec001\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"153\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container bg-white opacity-0\">\n  <section data-section-type=\"text_only\" data-section-id=\"pg120_sec001\" class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 py-8 max-sm:px-5\">\n    <div class=\"w-full overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-purple-100/40 mb-8\">\n      <div class=\"bg-purple-500\">\n        <div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 flex items-stretch\">\n          <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-28 min-h-28 bg-purple-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white\">&#x267b;</div>\n          <div class=\"flex-1 flex items-center\">\n            <h1 class=\"adt-h1 text-left font-bold text-white px-6 py-4\" data-id=\"pg120_n0002\">Mjedisi i vendit tim</h1>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 pt-4 pb-2\">\n        <h2 class=\"adt-h2 text-left font-semibold text-gray-900\" data-id=\"pg120_n0004\">Si riciklohen mbetjet?</h2>\n        <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-3 h-1 w-full max-w-md bg-purple-400 rounded-full\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-gray-800 leading-relaxed mb-5\">\n      <span data-id=\"pg120_n0006\">Malit i kishin r&#xeb;n&#xeb; n&#xeb; sy vazhdimisht disa shenja n&#xeb; shport&#xeb;n e plehrave n&#xeb; oborrin e shkoll&#xeb;s.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg120_n0007\">Madje kishte d&#xeb;gjuar dhe p&#xeb;r rregull&#xeb;n &#x201c;R - rip&#xeb;rdor, riciklo dhe redukto&#x201d;.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg120_n0008\">Ndoshta se nuk ishte shum&#xeb; i interesuar at&#xeb;koh&#xeb;, prandaj nuk e kishte kuptuar dhe aq mir&#xeb; k&#xeb;t&#xeb; rregull.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg120_n0009\">Kur m&#xeb;suesja filloi t&#xeb; fliste se si mbeturinat nuk duhej t&#xeb; hidheshin t&#xeb; gjitha n&#xeb; t&#xeb; nj&#xeb;jt&#xeb;n shport&#xeb;, por ato duhej t&#xeb; klasifikoheshin, atij iu kujtua pse ekzistonte rregulla &#x201c;&#x201d;.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-gray-800 leading-relaxed mb-5\">\n      <span data-id=\"pg120_n0011\">Q&#xeb;llimi i k&#xeb;saj rregulle ishte q&#xeb; t&#xeb; shfryt&#xeb;zoheshin sa m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; produktet.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg120_n0012\">- M&#xeb;suese, a po flisni p&#xeb;r riciklimin? - pyeti Mali.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg120_n0013\">- Pik&#xeb;risht, Mali, t&#xeb; lumt&#xeb;!</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg120_n0014\">Mir&#xeb;po, po flas dhe p&#xeb;r rip&#xeb;rdorimin dhe reduktimin.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg120_n0015\">P.sh., ti mund t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rdor&#xeb;sh &#xe7;ant&#xeb;n e nj&#xeb;jt&#xeb; p&#xeb;r shum&#xeb; vjet n&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg120_n0016\">Mund t&#xeb; punosh ndonj&#xeb; dekor dhe ta zbukurosh &#xe7;do vit &#xe7;ant&#xeb;n, n&#xeb; vend q&#xeb; t&#xeb; k&#xeb;rkosh t&#xeb; blesh nj&#xeb; t&#xeb; re.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg120_n0017\">Apo, t&#x2019;i fal&#xeb;sh lodrat e tua.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg120_n0018\">K&#xeb;shtu, ne kemi rip&#xeb;rdorur materiale t&#xeb; ndryshme.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-gray-800 leading-relaxed mb-5\">\n      <span data-id=\"pg120_n0020\">Ju lutem, kudo q&#xeb; e shihni shenj&#xeb;n e riciklimit, t&#xeb; hidhni vet&#xeb;m materialet q&#xeb; mund t&#xeb; riciklohen, si: shishet e plastik&#xeb;s, letr&#xeb;n e past&#xeb;r, shishet e xhamit apo kana&#xe7;et e pijeve t&#xeb; ndryshme.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-gray-800 leading-relaxed mb-5\">\n      <span data-id=\"pg120_n0022\">Ju duhet t&#xeb; ndani mbeturinat edhe n&#xeb; sht&#xeb;pit&#xeb; tuaja.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg120_n0023\">Rrobat apo gj&#xeb;rat q&#xeb; mund t&#xeb; riciklohen, t&#x2019;i p&#xeb;rdorni sa m&#xeb; gjat&#xeb; q&#xeb; t&#xeb; mundeni.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg120_n0024\">Kur t&#xeb; mos ju b&#xeb;jn&#xeb; m&#xeb;, mund t&#x2019;ua dhuroni njer&#xeb;zve n&#xeb; nevoj&#xeb;.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-gray-800 leading-relaxed mb-5\">\n      <span data-id=\"pg120_n0026\">Mali dhe shok&#xeb;t e shoqet t&#xeb; klas&#xeb;s u g&#xeb;zuan shum&#xeb;, sepse menduan q&#xeb; kishin shum&#xeb; gj&#xeb;ra n&#xeb; dor&#xeb; p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; ruajtur ambientin.</span>\n      <span data-id=\"pg120_n0027\">Mezi po prisnin q&#xeb; t&#xeb; sistemonin lodrat e vegj&#xeb;lis&#xeb; e rrobat e tyre, me q&#xeb;llim q&#xeb; t&#x2019;ua dhuronin f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;ve t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-gray-800 leading-relaxed mb-8\">\n      <span data-id=\"pg120_n0029\">Mali propozoi q&#xeb; t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;t t&#xeb; vizatonin simbolin e riciklimit dhe ta vendosnin at&#xeb; n&#xeb; nj&#xeb; prej shportave t&#xeb; mbeturinave n&#xeb; sht&#xeb;pi.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <aside class=\"rounded-2xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-purple-50 overflow-hidden mb-8\">\n      <div class=\"flex max-lg:flex-col\">\n        <div class=\"bg-purple-500 text-white flex items-start justify-center px-6 py-6 w-24 max-lg:w-full\">\n          <div aria-hidden=\"true\">&#x1f4d8;</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex-1 p-6\">\n          <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-gray-800 leading-relaxed mb-4 italic\">\n            <span data-id=\"pg120_n0032\">Riciklimi &#xeb;sht&#xeb; ndarja e materialeve nga mbeturinat dhe rip&#xeb;rdorimi i tyre.</span>\n            <span data-id=\"pg120_n0033\">Ai p&#xeb;rfshin mbledhjen, ndarjen, p&#xeb;rpunimin dhe prodhimin e produkteve t&#xeb; reja nga sendet ose materialet e p&#xeb;rdorura.</span>\n            <span data-id=\"pg120_n0034\">Shum&#xeb; mbeturina mund t&#xeb; rip&#xeb;rdoren n&#xeb;se grumbullohen ve&#xe7;mas.</span>\n          </p>\n          <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-gray-800 leading-relaxed mb-4 italic\">\n            <span data-id=\"pg120_n0036\">&#xcb;sht&#xeb; shum&#xeb; e r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sishme q&#xeb; s&#xeb; pari t&#xeb; ndahen mbetjet sipas llojeve t&#xeb; mbeturinave.</span>\n            <span data-id=\"pg120_n0037\">Duhet t&#xeb; kemi kujdes kur i klasifikojm&#xeb; mbeturinat, sepse mbeturinat e riciklueshme duhet t&#x2019;i hedhim n&#xeb; koshin e caktuar.</span>\n          </p>\n          <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-gray-800 leading-relaxed italic\">\n            <span data-id=\"pg120_n0039\">Materialet q&#xeb; mund t&#xeb; riciklohen jan&#xeb;: letra, metalet, si: alumini, &#xe7;eliku, produktet e qelqit etj.</span>\n            <span data-id=\"pg120_n0040\">Krijimi i plehrave nga mbetjet organike &#xeb;sht&#xeb; nj&#xeb; tjet&#xeb;r shembull i mir&#xeb; i riciklimit.</span>\n            <span data-id=\"pg120_n0041\">Pa futjen e riciklimit n&#xeb; jet&#xeb;n e p&#xeb;rditshme, do t&#xeb; jet&#xeb; e pamundshme t&#xeb; imagjinohet nj&#xeb; sistem i rregullt i mbeturinave.</span>\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n\n    <div class=\"border-l-4 border-purple-400 pl-4 py-2\">\n      <p class=\"adt-body text-left text-gray-900 leading-relaxed\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg120_n0044\" class=\"font-semibold\">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e:</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg120_n0045\">kujdes, mbeturin&#xeb;, riciklim, p&#xeb;rfitim.</span>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg120_sec002.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg120_sec002\" />\n    <!-- Despite the na