\" data-id=\"pg122_n0002\">Mjedisi i vendit tim</h1><h2 class=\"adt-h2 inline-block w-fit max-w-full border-b-4 border-purple-400 bg-white px-6 py-4 font-medium text-zinc-800\" data-id=\"pg122_n0003\">Kujdesi p&#xeb;r higjien&#xeb;n n&#xeb; komunitet</h2></div></div></div><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 py-10 max-lg:py-8 max-sm:px-5 max-sm:py-6\"><p class=\"adt-body mb-5 leading-relaxed text-left\"><span data-id=\"pg122_n0005\">Shoqja e Lumit dhe e Nor&#xeb;s, Mira, shkon n&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;n e muzik&#xeb;s, ku m&#xeb;son pianon.</span> <span data-id=\"pg122_n0006\">N&#xeb; nj&#xeb; koncert q&#xeb; shkolla e muzik&#xeb;s organizoi, u ftuan t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; shok&#xeb;t e shoqet e Mir&#xeb;s.</span> <span data-id=\"pg122_n0007\">F&#xeb;mij&#xeb;t s&#x2019;kishin marr&#xeb; pjes&#xeb; asnj&#xeb;her&#xeb; n&#xeb; nj&#xeb; ngjarje t&#xeb; till&#xeb; m&#xeb; par&#xeb;.</span></p><p class=\"adt-body mb-5 leading-relaxed text-left\"><span data-id=\"pg122_n0009\">M&#xeb;suesja u kujtoi f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;ve se duhej t&#xeb; shkonin n&#xeb; koncert n&#xeb; koh&#xeb;n e duhur, t&#xeb; zinin vendet pa b&#xeb;r&#xeb; zhurm&#xeb;, t&#xeb; mos flisnin nd&#xeb;rkoh&#xeb; q&#xeb; interpretohej pjesa muzikore, t&#xeb; shikonin dhe t&#xeb; d&#xeb;gjonin performanc&#xeb;n e nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;sve.</span></p><p class=\"adt-body mb-5 leading-relaxed text-left\"><span data-id=\"pg122_n0011\">Nd&#xeb;rkoh&#xeb; q&#xeb; f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;t po prisnin n&#xeb; korridorin e shkoll&#xeb;s p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; filluar koncerti, Ylli, i ulur n&#xeb; nj&#xeb; karrige, pasi mbaroi ushqimin, hodhi letr&#xeb;n n&#xeb; dysheme.</span> <span data-id=\"pg122_n0012\">Edhe Diellza veproi n&#xeb; t&#xeb; nj&#xeb;jt&#xeb;n m&#xeb;nyr&#xeb; me letr&#xeb;n e saj t&#xeb; kekut.</span></p><p class=\"adt-body mb-8 leading-relaxed text-left\"><span data-id=\"pg122_n0014\">Ky veprim nuk kaloi pa u v&#xeb;n&#xeb; re nga m&#xeb;suesja dhe shum&#xeb; shok&#xeb; e shoqe q&#xeb; ishin aty.</span> <span data-id=\"pg122_n0015\">Ata kujtuan q&#xeb;, ashtu si&#xe7; mbajn&#xeb; past&#xeb;r higjien&#xeb;n personale, duhet t&#xeb; ruajn&#xeb; dhe ambientet publike.</span> <span data-id=\"pg122_n0016\">N&#xeb;se t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; do t&#xeb; hidhnin mbeturinat vend e pa vend, nuk do t&#xeb; mund t&#xeb; shijonin bukurit&#xeb; n&#xeb; mjedise t&#xeb; ndryshme.</span> <span data-id=\"pg122_n0017\">Lumi iu drejtua shok&#xeb;ve duke u th&#xeb;n&#xeb;: &#x201c;Le t&#xeb; kujdesemi p&#xeb;r higjien&#xeb;n gjithandej.</span> <span data-id=\"pg122_n0018\">Kjo higjien&#xeb; do t&#xeb; na mbaj&#xeb; t&#xeb; sh&#xeb;ndetsh&#xeb;m fizikisht dhe mend&#xeb;risht&#x201d;.</span></p><aside class=\"mb-8 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-purple-50 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-stretch max-lg:flex-col\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex w-28 shrink-0 items-start justify-center bg-purple-500 py-6 text-white max-lg:w-full max-lg:items-center max-sm:py-4\"><div class=\"font-bold leading-none\">&#x1f4d6;</div></div><div class=\"flex-1 p-6 max-sm:p-4\"><p class=\"adt-body mb-4 leading-relaxed text-left italic\"><span data-id=\"pg122_n0021\">Njeriu ka p&#xeb;rgjegj&#xeb;si q&#xeb;, p&#xeb;rve&#xe7; higjien&#xeb;s personale, t&#xeb; tregoj&#xeb; sjellje t&#xeb; mira si qytetar edhe n&#xeb; komunitet.</span> <span data-id=\"pg122_n0022\">K&#xeb;t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rgjegj&#xeb;si e demonstron me veprime t&#xeb; ndryshme, si: duke mbjell&#xeb; bim&#xeb; t&#xeb; ndryshme, duke u kujdesur p&#xeb;r ambientin, duke u kujdesur q&#xeb; t&#xeb; mos d&#xeb;mtoj&#xeb; gj&#xeb;rat q&#xeb; i p&#xeb;rdorim t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb;, si parqet, bankat, rrug&#xeb;t etj.</span></p><p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed text-left italic\"><span data-id=\"pg122_n0024\">T&#xeb; gjitha shprehit&#xeb; e jet&#xeb;s krijohen n&#xeb; f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;ri.</span> <span data-id=\"pg122_n0025\">P&#xeb;r &#xe7;do gj&#xeb; q&#xeb; na rrethon duhet t&#xeb; sillemi me to sikur jan&#xeb; tonat.</span> <span data-id=\"pg122_n0026\">N&#xeb;se sillemi me p&#xeb;rgjegj&#xeb;si dhe tregojm&#xeb; kujdes t&#xeb; plot&#xeb; p&#xeb;r higjien&#xeb;n e gj&#xeb;rave q&#xeb; na rrethojn&#xeb;, do t&#xeb; kemi nj&#xeb; jet&#xeb; t&#xeb; mir&#xeb; dhe t&#xeb; sh&#xeb;ndetshme n&#xeb; komunitetin ton&#xeb;.</span></p></div></div></aside><p class=\"adt-body border-l-4 border-purple-300 pl-4 font-medium text-left\"><span data-id=\"pg122_n0028\">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e: komunitet, higjien&#xeb;, kujdes, ambient publik.</span></p></div></section></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n","./pg122_sec002.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg122_sec002\" />\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"157\" />\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <h1 class=\"sr-only\" id=\"page-heading\">Shoqëria dhe Mjedis